      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "TestData doesn't support the use of [filters](https://grafana.com/docs/grafana/<GRAFANA_VERSION>/visualizations/dashboards/build-dashboards/filter-group-by/). Filters require the data source to implement tag key and value lookups, which TestData doesn't provide.",
