      "syntaxRole": "procedural-step",
      "sourceText": "1. TestData interpolates variables in these fields only: **Labels**, **Alias**, **Scenario**, **String Input**, **CSV Content**, and **Raw Frame Content**. Other fields don't support variable substitution.",
