      "syntaxRole": "procedural-step",
      "sourceText": "1. Verify you're using a backend-evaluated scenario. Browser-only scenarios (Streaming Client, Grafana Live, Grafana API, Steps, No Data Points) return empty results when evaluated by the alerting engine. Use a backend scenario like Random Walk or Predictable Pulse instead.",
      "headingPath": [
