    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.e707de78ec1c35152f44",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "When a request slows to a crawl or fails somewhere deep in your microservices, [Zipkin](https://zipkin.io/) shows you exactly where. Zipkin is an open source distributed tracing system that follows a request as it hops from service to service, so you can pinpoint the bottleneck instead of guessing.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Zipkin data source"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/datasources/zipkin/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "1edc44eb2e385813b3f44636f5a093cfd71c382c",
        "sha256": "f36df98b0c1cce9af09f2df890b3cdf1a2cffb89c0e2d400754e8acf06fd3214",
        "lineStart": 25,
        "lineEnd": 25,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/datasources/zipkin/_index.md#L25-L25"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.125c3e56ec04f41450c4",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "The Zipkin data source brings those traces straight into Grafana. Query and visualize them alongside your logs and metrics to find latency bottlenecks, follow requests across services, and map the dependencies between them. Grafana ships with the data source preinstalled, so you can start exploring traces right away.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Zipkin data source"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/datasources/zipkin/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "1edc44eb2e385813b3f44636f5a093cfd71c382c",
        "sha256": "f36df98b0c1cce9af09f2df890b3cdf1a2cffb89c0e2d400754e8acf06fd3214",
        "lineStart": 27,
        "lineEnd": 27,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/datasources/zipkin/_index.md#L27-L27"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.9532e1a24559b80c251a",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "As of Grafana 13.2, Zipkin is packaged as a standalone plugin so it can receive updates independently of Grafana releases. For details, refer to [Plugin updates](#plugin-updates).",
      "headingPath": [
        "Zipkin data source"
      ],
      "source": {
