      "sourceText": "The **Trace to logs** setting configures the [trace to logs feature](https://grafana.com/docs/grafana/<GRAFANA_VERSION>/explore/trace-integration/) that is available when you integrate Grafana with Zipkin. This feature lets you navigate from a span in a trace view directly to the relevant logs.",
