      "id": "grafana.candidate.8546577773ec68eff533",
      "syntaxRole": "procedural-step",
      "sourceText": "1. Select which tags to use in the logs query. The tags you configure must be present in the span attributes or resources for a trace to logs span link to appear. You can optionally configure a new name for the tag. This is useful if the tag has dots in the name and the target data source doesn't allow dots in labels. For example, you can remap `http.status` to `http_status`.",
