      "syntaxRole": "table-row",
      "sourceText": "| **\\_\\_span.tags**      | Namespace for the tags in the span. To access a specific tag named `version`, you would use `${__span.tags.version}`. If the tag contains a dot, access it as `${__span.tags[\"http.status\"]}`.                                                                                                                                          |",
