    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.f0918d16823206530bf2",
      "syntaxRole": "table-row",
      "sourceText": "| **Span start time shift** | Shifts the start time for the logs query, based on the span's start time. You can use time units, such as `5s`, `1m`, `3h`. To extend the time to the past, use a negative value. Default: `0`.                                                                                                 |",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure the Zipkin data source",
        "Trace to logs",
        "Trace to logs settings"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/datasources/zipkin/configure/index.md",
