      "id": "grafana.candidate.ee0abbf5f2949444ec27",
      "syntaxRole": "list-item",
      "sourceText": "- **Query:** The query run when navigating from a trace to the metrics data source. Interpolate tags using the `$__tags` keyword. For example, when you configure the query `requests_total{$__tags}` with the tags `k8s.pod=pod` and `cluster`, the result looks like `requests_total{pod=\"nginx-554b9\", cluster=\"us-east-1\"}`.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure the Zipkin data source",
        "Trace to metrics"
      ],
