      "syntaxRole": "table-row",
      "sourceText": "| `labels`           | map[String]String | Add labels to a stack if you want to add a visual way to distinguish them [in the UI](/docs/grafana-cloud/account-management/cloud-portal/#create-stack-labels). Labels are `key:value` pairs where the both the key and value can alphanumeric, `.`, `-` or `/`. Up to 10 labels are allowed. Example: `{\"team\":\"platform\", \"environment\":\"dev\"}` | No       |",
