      "syntaxRole": "table-row",
      "sourceText": "| `labels`           | map[String]String | Updates labels for a stack. Labels are `key:value` pairs where the both the key and value can alphanumeric, `.`, `-` or `/`. Up to 10 labels are allowed. To remove a label, just omit it in this request. To remove all labels send an empty object. Example: `{\"team\":\"platform\", \"environment\":\"dev\"}` | No       |",
