      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "In OSS, you can authenticate your requests to the HTTP APIs using basic auth or a service account token. In Grafana Cloud, only the service account token option is available. For more details refer to [HTTP API authentication](https://grafana.com/docs/grafana/<GRAFANA_VERSION>/developer-resources/api-reference/http-api/authentication).",
