    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.cef4b725b5d2a9f26b4d",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "**To use the Admin API endpoints you have to use Basic authentication, and the Grafana user must have the Grafana server administrator permission**. The `admin` user that Grafana is provisioned with by default has permissions to use these API endpoints.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Admin API",
        "Requirements"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/developer-resources/api-reference/http-api/api-legacy/admin.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "29ca3189a00bc6d6d6fc5bc5f34213ac6be34eb5",
        "sha256": "b4c9a6d87d25c2191a627cdbff716104c70c00ca5442c885e40f2b80043fc860",
        "lineStart": 27,
        "lineEnd": 27,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/developer-resources/api-reference/http-api/api-legacy/admin.md#L27-L27"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.6e394ca034acf1e63f94",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "You can't authenticate to the Admin HTTP API with service account tokens. Service accounts are limited to an organization and an organization role, and can't be granted [Grafana server administrator permissions](https://grafana.com/docs/grafana/<GRAFANA_VERSION>/administration/roles-and-permissions/#grafana-server-administrators).",
      "headingPath": [
        "Admin API",
        "Requirements"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/developer-resources/api-reference/http-api/api-legacy/admin.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "29ca3189a00bc6d6d6fc5bc5f34213ac6be34eb5",
        "sha256": "b4c9a6d87d25c2191a627cdbff716104c70c00ca5442c885e40f2b80043fc860",
        "lineStart": 29,
        "lineEnd": 29,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/developer-resources/api-reference/http-api/api-legacy/admin.md#L29-L29"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.75faaa38a5532c9b5852",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "If you're running Grafana Enterprise, for some endpoints you'll need to have specific permissions. Refer to [Role-based access control permissions](https://grafana.com/docs/grafana/<GRAFANA_VERSION>/administration/roles-and-permissions/access-control/custom-role-actions-scopes/) for more information.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Admin API",
        "Requirements"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/developer-resources/api-reference/http-api/api-legacy/admin.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "29ca3189a00bc6d6d6fc5bc5f34213ac6be34eb5",
        "sha256": "b4c9a6d87d25c2191a627cdbff716104c70c00ca5442c885e40f2b80043fc860",
        "lineStart": 31,
