      "syntaxRole": "list-item",
      "sourceText": "- `tags`: string. Optional. Use this to filter organization annotations. Organization annotations are annotations from an annotation data source that are not connected specifically to a dashboard or panel. To do an \"AND\" filtering with multiple tags, specify the tags parameter multiple times e.g. `tags=tag1&tags=tag2`.",
