      "id": "grafana.candidate.1311db62804102db803b",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Creates an annotation in the Grafana database. The `dashboardUid` and `panelId` fields are optional. If they are not specified then an organization annotation is created and can be queried in any dashboard that adds the Grafana annotations data source. When creating a region annotation include the timeEnd property.",
