      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Permissions with `folderId=-1` are the default permissions for users with the Viewer and Editor roles. Permissions can be set for a user, a team or a role (Viewer or Editor). Permissions cannot be set for Admins - they always have access to everything.",
