      "id": "grafana.candidate.4c866fedb7af18367fe9",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "The Organization HTTP API is divided in two resources, `/api/org` (current organization) and `/api/orgs` (admin organizations). One big difference between these are that the admin of all organizations API only works with basic authentication, see [Admin Organizations API](#admin-organizations-api) for more information.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Organization API"
      ],
