      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Returns a list of queries in the query history that matches the search criteria. Query history search supports pagination. Use the `limit` parameter to control the maximum number of queries returned; the default limit is 100. You can also use the `page` query parameter to fetch queries from any page other than the first one.",
