    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.e34cd77b6834fae659da",
      "syntaxRole": "table-row",
      "sourceText": "| frequency          | string    | Specifies how often the report should be sent. Can be `once`, `hourly`, `daily`, `weekly`, `monthly`, `last` or `custom`.<br/><br/>`last` - schedules the report for the last day of month.<br/><br/>`custom` - schedules the report to be sent on a custom interval.<br/>It requires `intervalFrequency` and `intervalAmount` to be specified: for example, every 2 weeks, where 2 is an `intervalAmount` and `weeks` is an `intervalFrequency`. |",
      "headingPath": [
        "Reporting API",
        "Create a report",
        "Example request",
        "Config JSON Body Schema"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/developer-resources/api-reference/http-api/api-legacy/reporting.md",
