      "id": "grafana.candidate.16897b560fcd9255d298",
      "syntaxRole": "table-row",
      "sourceText": "| branding.emailFooterMode | string    | Can be `sent-by` or `none`.<br/>`sent-by` adds a \"Sent by `branding.emailFooterText`\" footer link to the email. Requires specifying values in the `branding.emailFooterText` and `branding.emailFooterLink` fields.<br/>`none` suppresses adding a \"Sent by\" footer link to the email. |",
