      "sourceText": "> If you are running Grafana Enterprise, for some endpoints you'll need to have specific permissions. Refer to [Role-based access control permissions](/docs/grafana/latest/administration/roles-and-permissions/access-control/custom-role-actions-scopes/) for more information. > For Grafana Cloud instances, please use a Bearer token to authenticate. The examples within this section reference Basic authentication which is for On-Prem Grafana instances.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Service account API"
      ],
