    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.fcee3ba32628afae7145",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Default value for the `perpage` parameter is `1000` and for the `page` parameter is `1`. The `totalCount` field in the response can be used for pagination of the user list E.g. if `totalCount` is equal to 100 users and the `perpage` parameter is set to 10 then there are 10 pages of users. The `query` parameter is optional and it will return results where the query value is contained in one of the `name`. Query values with spaces need to be URL encoded e.g. `query=Jane%20Doe`.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Service account API",
        "Search service accounts with Paging"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/developer-resources/api-reference/http-api/api-legacy/serviceaccount.md",
