    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.a9d97747dfbb5682577c",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Default value for the `perpage` parameter is `1000` and for the `page` parameter is `1`.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Team API",
        "Team Search With Paging",
        "Using the query parameter"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/developer-resources/api-reference/http-api/api-legacy/team.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "eab01f157326e2962676f556554f35aae8709eda",
        "sha256": "9222792173c9d64a40f481858a30b484bcb1493343ade7ac080bf79a9d4550d4",
        "lineStart": 87,
        "lineEnd": 87,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/developer-resources/api-reference/http-api/api-legacy/team.md#L87-L87"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss",
          "cloud"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.29958e2f67436735fc8e",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "The `totalCount` field in the response can be used for pagination of the teams list E.g. if `totalCount` is equal to 100 teams and the `perpage` parameter is set to 10 then there are 10 pages of teams.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Team API",
        "Team Search With Paging",
        "Using the query parameter"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/developer-resources/api-reference/http-api/api-legacy/team.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "eab01f157326e2962676f556554f35aae8709eda",
        "sha256": "9222792173c9d64a40f481858a30b484bcb1493343ade7ac080bf79a9d4550d4",
        "lineStart": 89,
        "lineEnd": 89,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/developer-resources/api-reference/http-api/api-legacy/team.md#L89-L89"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss",
          "cloud"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.1f8890865bd016fc80b8",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "The `query` parameter is optional and it will return results where the query value is contained in the `name` field. Query values with spaces need to be URL encoded e.g. `query=my%20team`.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Team API",
        "Team Search With Paging",
        "Using the query parameter"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/developer-resources/api-reference/http-api/api-legacy/team.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "eab01f157326e2962676f556554f35aae8709eda",
        "sha256": "9222792173c9d64a40f481858a30b484bcb1493343ade7ac080bf79a9d4550d4",
        "lineStart": 91,
        "lineEnd": 91,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/developer-resources/api-reference/http-api/api-legacy/team.md#L91-L91"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss",
          "cloud"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.a137bc9d89dc79337c67",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "The `sort` param is an optional comma separated list of options to order the search result. Accepted values for the sort filter are: ` name-asc`, `name-desc`, `email-asc`, `email-desc`, `memberCount-asc`, `memberCount-desc`. By default, if `sort` is not specified, the teams list will be ordered by `name` in ascending order.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Team API",
        "Team Search With Paging",
        "Using the query parameter"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/developer-resources/api-reference/http-api/api-legacy/team.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "eab01f157326e2962676f556554f35aae8709eda",
        "sha256": "9222792173c9d64a40f481858a30b484bcb1493343ade7ac080bf79a9d4550d4",
        "lineStart": 93,
        "lineEnd": 93,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/developer-resources/api-reference/http-api/api-legacy/team.md#L93-L93"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss",
          "cloud"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.7707c172dea16340514c",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "The `name` parameter returns a single team if the parameter matches the `name` field.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Team API",
        "Team Search With Paging",
        "Using the name parameter"
