      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "This document explains how Grafana structures the `/apis` HTTP APIs, which use a Kubernetes-style API layer with a standardized structure and consistent versioning. Read on to understand request paths, versions, namespaces, and common response fields when you migrate from legacy `/api` endpoints or work with new APIs.",
