    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.0bf18ebd65e764fabb8a",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "To pass a username and password with [HTTP basic authorization](/docs/grafana/<GRAFANA_VERSION>/administration/roles-and-permissions/access-control/manage-rbac-roles/), encode them as base64. You can't use authorization tokens in the request.",
