    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.2c512e786f48121876fd",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "If [Grafana Alerting](ref:alerting) is enabled, you can set an optional query parameter `forceDeleteRules=false` so that requests will fail with 400 (Bad Request) error if the folder contains any Grafana alerts. However, if this parameter is set to `true` then it will delete any Grafana alerts under this folder.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Folder APIs",
        "Delete folder"
      ],
