    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.15b35a1ca2c3ea4aea65",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Before creating a dashboard, you'll need access to a Grafana instance and, in most cases, a data source that contains the data you want to visualize. If you're following this getting started guide, you can use the built-in Grafana data source to learn the dashboard creation workflow before connecting your own data.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Build your first dashboard",
        "Frequently asked questions"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/fundamentals/getting-started/first-dashboards/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "9bdfb60798be0eab3e7f687ba75633ebd4586419",
        "sha256": "e4e3883790b41376d97a698cc7d3c235fdaafb52bcd5f712af9da0cddec5ded3",
        "lineStart": 101,
        "lineEnd": 102,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/fundamentals/getting-started/first-dashboards/_index.md#L101-L102"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.898c04a4a4d9f63b7ba4",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Not necessarily. If you're following this getting started guide, you can use the built-in Grafana data source to create your first dashboard without connecting an external data source. For production dashboards, you'll typically connect a supported data source such as Prometheus, Loki, MySQL, or another supported integration.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Build your first dashboard",
        "Frequently asked questions"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/fundamentals/getting-started/first-dashboards/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "9bdfb60798be0eab3e7f687ba75633ebd4586419",
        "sha256": "e4e3883790b41376d97a698cc7d3c235fdaafb52bcd5f712af9da0cddec5ded3",
        "lineStart": 105,
        "lineEnd": 107,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/fundamentals/getting-started/first-dashboards/_index.md#L105-L107"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.d6197db7bcdc44c2c6ab",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Yes. Dashboards are designed to be updated over time. After saving a dashboard, you can reopen it in edit mode to add or remove panels, change queries, switch visualization types, update panel settings, or rename the dashboard whenever needed.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Build your first dashboard",
        "Frequently asked questions"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/fundamentals/getting-started/first-dashboards/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "9bdfb60798be0eab3e7f687ba75633ebd4586419",
        "sha256": "e4e3883790b41376d97a698cc7d3c235fdaafb52bcd5f712af9da0cddec5ded3",
        "lineStart": 110,
        "lineEnd": 112,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/fundamentals/getting-started/first-dashboards/_index.md#L110-L112"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.7be4aae29f043536b50f",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "You can [download InfluxDB](https://portal.influxdata.com/downloads/) and install it locally or you can sign up for [InfluxDB Cloud](https://www.influxdata.com/products/influxdb-cloud/). Windows installers are not available for some versions of InfluxDB.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Get started with Grafana and InfluxDB",
        "Get InfluxDB"
      ],
      "source": {
