      "sourceText": "Microsoft SQL Server is a popular relational database management system that is widely used in development and production environments. This topic walks you through the steps to create a series of dashboards in Grafana to display metrics from a MS SQL Server database.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Get started with Grafana and MS SQL Server"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/fundamentals/getting-started/first-dashboards/get-started-grafana-ms-sql-server.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "31b650f0da0d2da200cf164e3e6eaa0493bfd3e2",
        "sha256": "348191699f4a9998a082a8177eabda7fa4ba0ddbe9b7702a5f75e6f83752e3d4",
        "lineStart": 16,
        "lineEnd": 16,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/fundamentals/getting-started/first-dashboards/get-started-grafana-ms-sql-server.md#L16-L16"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.6a80714b4669572c9aa4",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "MS SQL Server can be installed on Windows or Linux operating systems and also on Docker containers. Refer to the [MS SQL Server downloads page](https://www.microsoft.com/en-us/sql-server/sql-server-downloads), for a complete list of all available options.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Get started with Grafana and MS SQL Server",
        "Download MS SQL Server"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/fundamentals/getting-started/first-dashboards/get-started-grafana-ms-sql-server.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "31b650f0da0d2da200cf164e3e6eaa0493bfd3e2",
        "sha256": "348191699f4a9998a082a8177eabda7fa4ba0ddbe9b7702a5f75e6f83752e3d4",
        "lineStart": 20,
        "lineEnd": 20,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/fundamentals/getting-started/first-dashboards/get-started-grafana-ms-sql-server.md#L20-L20"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.6a4c1b4b07455f5f33e6",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "You can install MS SQL Server on the host running Grafana or on a remote server. To install the software from the [downloads page](https://www.microsoft.com/en-us/sql-server/sql-server-downloads), follow their setup prompts.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Get started with Grafana and MS SQL Server",
        "Download MS SQL Server",
        "Install MS SQL Server"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/fundamentals/getting-started/first-dashboards/get-started-grafana-ms-sql-server.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "31b650f0da0d2da200cf164e3e6eaa0493bfd3e2",
        "sha256": "348191699f4a9998a082a8177eabda7fa4ba0ddbe9b7702a5f75e6f83752e3d4",
        "lineStart": 24,
        "lineEnd": 24,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/fundamentals/getting-started/first-dashboards/get-started-grafana-ms-sql-server.md#L24-L24"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.6a0022362f887fa3796d",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "If you are on a Windows host but want to use Grafana and MS SQL data source on a Linux environment, refer to the [WSL to set up your Grafana development environment](/blog/2021/03/03/how-to-set-up-a-grafana-development-environment-on-a-windows-pc-using-wsl) blog post. This will allow you to leverage the resources available in [grafana/grafana](https://github.com/grafana/grafana) GitHub repository. Here you will find a collection of supported data sources, including MS SQL Server, along with test data and pre-configured dashboards for use.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Get started with Grafana and MS SQL Server",
        "Download MS SQL Server",
        "Install MS SQL Server"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/fundamentals/getting-started/first-dashboards/get-started-grafana-ms-sql-server.md",
