    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.e1050e7c4c0e5d381eb3",
      "syntaxRole": "procedural-step",
      "sourceText": "1. Because you are running your own Prometheus instance locally, you must `remote_write` your metrics to the Grafana.com Prometheus instance. Grafana provides code to add to your `prometheus.yml` config file. This includes a remote write endpoint, your user name and password.",
      "headingPath": [
