    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.534b429feef6f7d6f3d8",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Now that you have a curated list of queries, create [dashboards](../../dashboards/) to render system metrics monitored by Prometheus. When you install Prometheus and Node exporter or windows_exporter, you will find recommended dashboards for use.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Get started with Grafana and Prometheus",
