      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.0bec7496d194a3950667",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Temperature data like the one in the example, is far from the only example of a time series. Other examples of time series are:",
