    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.36a42745b1dc689b8a16",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "A collector either _pushes_ data to a database or lets the database _pull_ the data from it. Both methods come with their own set of pros and cons:",
      "headingPath": [
        "Introduction to time series",
        "Time series and monitoring",
        "Collecting time series data"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/fundamentals/timeseries/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "aaa0df85d3c9a6ee56133f232af61ea75f549ce0",
        "sha256": "91cb08c8677efd98f7a5d0d1853fc98b712f1ea37e4e5dec5fb499108e697400",
        "lineStart": 128,
        "lineEnd": 128,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/fundamentals/timeseries/index.md#L128-L128"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.428e14bd15d9f20ce807",
      "syntaxRole": "table-row",
      "sourceText": "|      | Pros                                                                      | Cons                                                                     |",
      "headingPath": [
        "Introduction to time series",
        "Time series and monitoring",
        "Collecting time series data"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/fundamentals/timeseries/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "aaa0df85d3c9a6ee56133f232af61ea75f549ce0",
        "sha256": "91cb08c8677efd98f7a5d0d1853fc98b712f1ea37e4e5dec5fb499108e697400",
        "lineStart": 130,
        "lineEnd": 130,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/fundamentals/timeseries/index.md#L130-L130"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.90393c270e46d8cbaf0c",
      "syntaxRole": "table-row",
      "sourceText": "| Push | Easier to replicate data to multiple destinations.                        | The TSDB has no control over how much data gets sent.                    |",
      "headingPath": [
        "Introduction to time series",
        "Time series and monitoring",
        "Collecting time series data"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/fundamentals/timeseries/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "aaa0df85d3c9a6ee56133f232af61ea75f549ce0",
        "sha256": "91cb08c8677efd98f7a5d0d1853fc98b712f1ea37e4e5dec5fb499108e697400",
        "lineStart": 132,
        "lineEnd": 132,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/fundamentals/timeseries/index.md#L132-L132"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.fed4f48fd218cd619844",
      "syntaxRole": "table-row",
      "sourceText": "| Pull | Better control of how much data that gets ingested, and its authenticity. | Firewalls, VPNs or load balancers can make it hard to access the agents. |",
      "headingPath": [
        "Introduction to time series",
        "Time series and monitoring",
        "Collecting time series data"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/fundamentals/timeseries/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "aaa0df85d3c9a6ee56133f232af61ea75f549ce0",
        "sha256": "91cb08c8677efd98f7a5d0d1853fc98b712f1ea37e4e5dec5fb499108e697400",
        "lineStart": 133,
        "lineEnd": 133,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/fundamentals/timeseries/index.md#L133-L133"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.111d6d1e17ff70090308",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "[Grafana open source software](/oss/) enables you to query, visualize, alert on, and explore your metrics, logs, and traces wherever they are stored. Grafana OSS provides you with tools to turn your time-series database (TSDB) data into insightful graphs and visualizations. The Grafana OSS plugin framework also enables you to connect other data sources like NoSQL/SQL databases, ticketing tools like Jira or ServiceNow, and CI/CD tooling like GitLab.",
      "headingPath": [
        "About Grafana"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/introduction/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "d35a49c57b8a1382110f2440c733dd8414763c6d",
        "sha256": "4440c9df85f387c01946f1c1d22f986808a46ee19a31b5c631d9fb33a915c428",
        "lineStart": 17,
        "lineEnd": 17,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/introduction/_index.md#L17-L17"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.40e4250e62d0c9fb13b1",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "After you've [installed Grafana](../setup-grafana/installation/) and set up your first dashboard using instructions in [Getting started with Grafana](../getting-started/build-first-dashboard/), you will have many options to choose from depending on your requirements. For example, if you want to view weather data and statistics about your smart home, then you can create a [playlist](../dashboards/create-manage-playlists/). If you are the administrator for an enterprise and are managing Grafana for multiple teams, then you can set up [provisioning](../administration/provisioning/) and [authentication](../setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/).",
      "headingPath": [
        "About Grafana"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/introduction/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "d35a49c57b8a1382110f2440c733dd8414763c6d",
        "sha256": "4440c9df85f387c01946f1c1d22f986808a46ee19a31b5c631d9fb33a915c428",
