    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.9bc892972d9e6161c5ae",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Integrating with an IAM provider provides the following benefits:",
      "headingPath": [
        "Plan your IAM integration strategy",
        "Benefits of integrating with an IAM provider"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/_index.md",
