    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.256c1efd2b226551bca2",
      "syntaxRole": "list-item",
      "sourceText": "- **User management**: By providing Grafana access to your current user management system, you eliminate the overhead of replicating user information and instead have centralized user management for users' roles and permissions to Grafana resources.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Plan your IAM integration strategy",
        "Benefits of integrating with an IAM provider"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/_index.md",
