        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/_index.md#L24-L24"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "unresolved-no-explicit-oss-products-label",
        "products": []
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.cf5217b3573662ac4668",
      "syntaxRole": "list-item",
      "sourceText": "- **Security**: Many IAM solutions provide advanced security features such as multi-factor authentication, RBAC, and audit trails, which can help to improve the security of your Grafana installation.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Plan your IAM integration strategy",
        "Benefits of integrating with an IAM provider"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/_index.md",
