      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.05ae3657ca82cd128442",
      "syntaxRole": "list-item",
      "sourceText": "- **Scalability**: User additions and updates in your user database are immediately reflected in Grafana.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Plan your IAM integration strategy",
        "Benefits of integrating with an IAM provider"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "63f14286dc00550c860501a81f311188c9f26bde",
        "sha256": "b225f8d5068b6e330e18c0916c7295be963d055af907c0790708a7bbd383b7af",
        "lineStart": 30,
        "lineEnd": 30,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/_index.md#L30-L30"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "unresolved-no-explicit-oss-products-label",
        "products": []
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.08aa3fcccea3136f12d6",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "In order to plan an integration with Grafana, assess your organization's current needs, requirements, and any existing IAM solutions being used. This includes thinking about how roles and permissions will be mapped to users in Grafana and how users can be grouped to access shared resources.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Plan your IAM integration strategy",
        "Benefits of integrating with an IAM provider"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "63f14286dc00550c860501a81f311188c9f26bde",
        "sha256": "b225f8d5068b6e330e18c0916c7295be963d055af907c0790708a7bbd383b7af",
        "lineStart": 32,
        "lineEnd": 32,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/_index.md#L32-L32"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "unresolved-no-explicit-oss-products-label",
        "products": []
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.19ce1d1cb33a36186d7c",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Do you already use an identity provider to manage users? If so, Grafana might be able to integrate with your identity provider through one of our IdP integrations. Refer to [Configure authentication documentation](../configure-access/configure-authentication/) for the list of supported providers.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Plan your IAM integration strategy",
        "Internal vs external users"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "63f14286dc00550c860501a81f311188c9f26bde",
        "sha256": "b225f8d5068b6e330e18c0916c7295be963d055af907c0790708a7bbd383b7af",
        "lineStart": 38,
        "lineEnd": 39,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/_index.md#L38-L39"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "unresolved-no-explicit-oss-products-label",
        "products": []
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.545985b3f50c995cfdb6",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "If you are not interested in setting up an external identity provider, but still want to limit access to your Grafana instance, consider using Grafana's basic authentication.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Plan your IAM integration strategy",
        "Internal vs external users"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "63f14286dc00550c860501a81f311188c9f26bde",
        "sha256": "b225f8d5068b6e330e18c0916c7295be963d055af907c0790708a7bbd383b7af",
        "lineStart": 41,
        "lineEnd": 41,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/_index.md#L41-L41"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "unresolved-no-explicit-oss-products-label",
        "products": []
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.ebe52227983d9a4e09be",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Finally, if you want your Grafana instance to be accessible to everyone, you can enable anonymous access to Grafana. For information, refer to the [anonymous authentication documentation](../configure-access/configure-authentication/#anonymous-authentication).",
      "headingPath": [
        "Plan your IAM integration strategy",
        "Internal vs external users"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "63f14286dc00550c860501a81f311188c9f26bde",
        "sha256": "b225f8d5068b6e330e18c0916c7295be963d055af907c0790708a7bbd383b7af",
        "lineStart": 43,
        "lineEnd": 44,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/_index.md#L43-L44"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "unresolved-no-explicit-oss-products-label",
        "products": []
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.bc36c1fd7ce12e277cb0",
      "syntaxRole": "list-item",
      "sourceText": "- **Security**: Different groups of users or customers should only have access to their intended resources.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Plan your IAM integration strategy",
        "Ways to organize users"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "63f14286dc00550c860501a81f311188c9f26bde",
        "sha256": "b225f8d5068b6e330e18c0916c7295be963d055af907c0790708a7bbd383b7af",
        "lineStart": 50,
        "lineEnd": 50,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/_index.md#L50-L50"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "unresolved-no-explicit-oss-products-label",
        "products": []
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.2ddd0460b87a0e591d5f",
      "syntaxRole": "list-item",
      "sourceText": "- **Simplicity**: Reduce the scope of dashboards and resources available.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Plan your IAM integration strategy",
        "Ways to organize users"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "63f14286dc00550c860501a81f311188c9f26bde",
        "sha256": "b225f8d5068b6e330e18c0916c7295be963d055af907c0790708a7bbd383b7af",
        "lineStart": 51,
        "lineEnd": 51,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/_index.md#L51-L51"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "unresolved-no-explicit-oss-products-label",
        "products": []
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.9439fc87e8574b6cca26",
      "syntaxRole": "list-item",
      "sourceText": "- **Cost attribution**: Track and bill costs to individual customers, departments, or divisions.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Plan your IAM integration strategy",
        "Ways to organize users"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "63f14286dc00550c860501a81f311188c9f26bde",
        "sha256": "b225f8d5068b6e330e18c0916c7295be963d055af907c0790708a7bbd383b7af",
        "lineStart": 52,
        "lineEnd": 52,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/_index.md#L52-L52"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "unresolved-no-explicit-oss-products-label",
        "products": []
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.4dfc2879c7ac7a39e09f",
      "syntaxRole": "list-item",
      "sourceText": "- **Customization**: Each group of users could have a personalized experience like different dashboards or theme colors.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Plan your IAM integration strategy",
        "Ways to organize users"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "63f14286dc00550c860501a81f311188c9f26bde",
        "sha256": "b225f8d5068b6e330e18c0916c7295be963d055af907c0790708a7bbd383b7af",
        "lineStart": 53,
        "lineEnd": 53,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/_index.md#L53-L53"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "unresolved-no-explicit-oss-products-label",
        "products": []
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.bca80a2115169ee4cb57",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "You can organize users into [teams](../../administration/team-management/) and assign them roles and permissions reflecting the current organization. For example, instead of assigning five users access to the same dashboard, you can create a team of those users and assign dashboard permissions to the team.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Plan your IAM integration strategy",
        "Ways to organize users",
        "Users in Grafana teams"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "63f14286dc00550c860501a81f311188c9f26bde",
        "sha256": "b225f8d5068b6e330e18c0916c7295be963d055af907c0790708a7bbd383b7af",
        "lineStart": 57,
        "lineEnd": 57,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/_index.md#L57-L57"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "unresolved-no-explicit-oss-products-label",
        "products": []
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.71f2bf5101087b63bd00",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "A user can belong to multiple teams and be a member or an administrator for a given team. Team members inherit permissions from the team but cannot edit the team itself. Team administrators can add members to a team and update its settings, such as the team name, team members, roles assigned, and UI preferences.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Plan your IAM integration strategy",
        "Ways to organize users",
        "Users in Grafana teams"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "63f14286dc00550c860501a81f311188c9f26bde",
        "sha256": "b225f8d5068b6e330e18c0916c7295be963d055af907c0790708a7bbd383b7af",
        "lineStart": 59,
        "lineEnd": 59,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/_index.md#L59-L59"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "unresolved-no-explicit-oss-products-label",
        "products": []
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.a02de52ac31429eee3c7",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Teams are a perfect solution for working with a subset of users. Teams can share resources with other teams.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Plan your IAM integration strategy",
        "Ways to organize users",
        "Users in Grafana teams"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "63f14286dc00550c860501a81f311188c9f26bde",
        "sha256": "b225f8d5068b6e330e18c0916c7295be963d055af907c0790708a7bbd383b7af",
        "lineStart": 61,
        "lineEnd": 61,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/_index.md#L61-L61"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "unresolved-no-explicit-oss-products-label",
        "products": []
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.23fc35f4dfa25095a14c",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "[Grafana organizations](../../administration/organization-management/) allow complete isolation of resources, such as dashboards and data sources. Users can be members of one or several organizations, and they can only access resources from an organization they belong to.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Plan your IAM integration strategy",
        "Ways to organize users",
        "Users in Grafana organizations"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "63f14286dc00550c860501a81f311188c9f26bde",
        "sha256": "b225f8d5068b6e330e18c0916c7295be963d055af907c0790708a7bbd383b7af",
        "lineStart": 65,
        "lineEnd": 65,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/_index.md#L65-L65"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "unresolved-no-explicit-oss-products-label",
        "products": []
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.568f66b42829bc66dcfa",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Organizations provide a higher measure of isolation within Grafana than teams do and can be helpful in certain scenarios. However, because organizations lack the scalability and flexibility of teams and [folders](../../dashboards/manage-dashboards/#create-a-dashboard-folder), we do not recommend using them as the default way to group users and resources.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Plan your IAM integration strategy",
        "Ways to organize users",
        "Users in Grafana organizations"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "63f14286dc00550c860501a81f311188c9f26bde",
        "sha256": "b225f8d5068b6e330e18c0916c7295be963d055af907c0790708a7bbd383b7af",
        "lineStart": 69,
        "lineEnd": 69,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/_index.md#L69-L69"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "unresolved-no-explicit-oss-products-label",
        "products": []
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.26637ba00ba7a95fd38f",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Note that Grafana Cloud does not support having more than 1 organizations per instance.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Plan your IAM integration strategy",
        "Ways to organize users",
        "Users in Grafana organizations"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "63f14286dc00550c860501a81f311188c9f26bde",
        "sha256": "b225f8d5068b6e330e18c0916c7295be963d055af907c0790708a7bbd383b7af",
        "lineStart": 71,
        "lineEnd": 71,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/_index.md#L71-L71"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "mixed-edition-statement-requires-review",
        "products": []
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.59053b772efee95cc697",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Teams provide more flexibility, as resources can be accessible by multiple teams, and team creation and management are simple.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Plan your IAM integration strategy",
        "Ways to organize users",
        "Choosing between teams and organizations"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "63f14286dc00550c860501a81f311188c9f26bde",
        "sha256": "b225f8d5068b6e330e18c0916c7295be963d055af907c0790708a7bbd383b7af",
        "lineStart": 77,
        "lineEnd": 77,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/_index.md#L77-L77"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "unresolved-no-explicit-oss-products-label",
        "products": []
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.433c07b417d287a11632",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "In contrast, organizations provide more isolation than teams, as resources cannot be shared between organizations. They are more difficult to manage than teams, as you must create and update resources for each organization individually. Organizations cater to bigger companies or users with intricate access needs, necessitating complete resource segregation.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Plan your IAM integration strategy",
        "Ways to organize users",
        "Choosing between teams and organizations"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "63f14286dc00550c860501a81f311188c9f26bde",
        "sha256": "b225f8d5068b6e330e18c0916c7295be963d055af907c0790708a7bbd383b7af",
        "lineStart": 79,
        "lineEnd": 81,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/_index.md#L79-L81"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "unresolved-no-explicit-oss-products-label",
        "products": []
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.7575f3daebbcf3a29681",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Consider the need for machine-to-machine [M2M](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Machine_to_machine) communications. If a system needs to interact with Grafana, ensure it has proper access.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Plan your IAM integration strategy",
        "Access to external systems"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "63f14286dc00550c860501a81f311188c9f26bde",
        "sha256": "b225f8d5068b6e330e18c0916c7295be963d055af907c0790708a7bbd383b7af",
        "lineStart": 85,
        "lineEnd": 85,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/_index.md#L85-L85"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "unresolved-no-explicit-oss-products-label",
        "products": []
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.26f1b0a412eb5a5e6c88",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "**Define alerts**: Define alert rules to be triggered when a specific condition is met. Route alert notifications to different teams according to your organization's needs.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Plan your IAM integration strategy",
        "Access to external systems"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/_index.md",
