    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.3d01240ec057183bcf30",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "**Provisioning file**: Provisioning files can be used to automate the creation of dashboards, data sources, and other resources.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Plan your IAM integration strategy",
        "Access to external systems"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/_index.md",
