    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.f2d3e2628b3dc1535c2b",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "These are just a few examples of how Grafana can be used in M2M scenarios. The platform is highly flexible and can be used in various M2M applications, making it a powerful tool for organizations seeking insights into their systems and devices.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Plan your IAM integration strategy",
        "Access to external systems"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "63f14286dc00550c860501a81f311188c9f26bde",
        "sha256": "b225f8d5068b6e330e18c0916c7295be963d055af907c0790708a7bbd383b7af",
        "lineStart": 95,
        "lineEnd": 95,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/_index.md#L95-L95"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "unresolved-no-explicit-oss-products-label",
        "products": []
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.405c2233a9d21f7c332e",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "You can use a service account to run automated workloads in Grafana, such as dashboard provisioning, configuration, or report generation. Create service accounts and service accounts tokens to authenticate applications, such as Terraform, with the Grafana API.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Plan your IAM integration strategy",
        "Access to external systems",
        "Service accounts"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "63f14286dc00550c860501a81f311188c9f26bde",
        "sha256": "b225f8d5068b6e330e18c0916c7295be963d055af907c0790708a7bbd383b7af",
        "lineStart": 99,
        "lineEnd": 99,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/_index.md#L99-L99"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "unresolved-no-explicit-oss-products-label",
        "products": []
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.35a3c6326b961f67635d",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "A common use case for creating a service account is to perform operations on automated or triggered tasks. You can use service accounts to:",
      "headingPath": [
        "Plan your IAM integration strategy",
        "Access to external systems",
        "Service accounts"
      ],
