    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.d8732a53c60715719867",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "In [Grafana Enterprise](../../introduction/grafana-enterprise/), you can also use service accounts in combination with [role-based access control](../../administration/roles-and-permissions/access-control/) to grant very specific permissions to applications that interact with Grafana.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Plan your IAM integration strategy",
        "Access to external systems",
        "Service accounts"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "63f14286dc00550c860501a81f311188c9f26bde",
        "sha256": "b225f8d5068b6e330e18c0916c7295be963d055af907c0790708a7bbd383b7af",
        "lineStart": 112,
        "lineEnd": 112,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/_index.md#L112-L112"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "mixed-edition-statement-requires-review",
        "products": []
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.6b54d02b4b96f87d96e5",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Service accounts can only act in the organization they are created for. We recommend creating service accounts in each organization if you have the same task needed for multiple organizations.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Plan your IAM integration strategy",
        "Access to external systems",
        "Service accounts"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "63f14286dc00550c860501a81f311188c9f26bde",
        "sha256": "b225f8d5068b6e330e18c0916c7295be963d055af907c0790708a7bbd383b7af",
        "lineStart": 115,
        "lineEnd": 115,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/_index.md#L115-L115"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "unresolved-no-explicit-oss-products-label",
        "products": []
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.3bf5725a5e44c4f0cfb8",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "To authenticate with Grafana's HTTP API, a randomly generated string known as a service account token can be used as an alternative to a password.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Plan your IAM integration strategy",
        "Access to external systems",
        "Service accounts",
        "Service account tokens"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "63f14286dc00550c860501a81f311188c9f26bde",
        "sha256": "b225f8d5068b6e330e18c0916c7295be963d055af907c0790708a7bbd383b7af",
        "lineStart": 124,
        "lineEnd": 124,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/_index.md#L124-L124"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "unresolved-no-explicit-oss-products-label",
        "products": []
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.15756d3a649ef40c80cf",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "When a service account is created, it can be linked to multiple access tokens. These service access tokens can be utilized in the same manner as API keys, providing a means to programmatically access Grafana HTTP API.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Plan your IAM integration strategy",
        "Access to external systems",
        "Service accounts",
        "Service account tokens"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "63f14286dc00550c860501a81f311188c9f26bde",
        "sha256": "b225f8d5068b6e330e18c0916c7295be963d055af907c0790708a7bbd383b7af",
        "lineStart": 126,
        "lineEnd": 126,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/_index.md#L126-L126"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "unresolved-no-explicit-oss-products-label",
        "products": []
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.1bee486653709d54bc25",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "You can create multiple tokens for the same service account. You might want to do this if:",
      "headingPath": [
        "Plan your IAM integration strategy",
        "Access to external systems",
        "Service accounts",
        "Service account tokens"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/_index.md",
