    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.cd65418729b8a09c18a2",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "If users want to use the same email address with multiple identity providers (for example, Grafana.Com OAuth and Google OAuth), you can configure Grafana to use the email address as the unique identifier for the user. To do so, enable the `oauth_allow_insecure_email_lookup` option, which is disabled by default. Refer to the [Enable email lookup](#enable-email-lookup) section for details.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure authentication",
        "Using the same email address to login with different identity providers"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "4eaeb6c9573c12f36370a29ae5cde9ef8903af26",
        "sha256": "c0d14f6586dd5c3329bd35640260ccf0154fa243faff94f744821a626f330ebe",
        "lineStart": 78,
        "lineEnd": 78,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/_index.md#L78-L78"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.ca768207affb222bda14",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Note that enabling this option can lower the security of your Grafana instance. If you enable this option, make sure that the `Allowed organization`, `Allowed groups` and `Allowed domains` settings are configured correctly to prevent unauthorized access.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure authentication",
        "Using the same email address to login with different identity providers"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "4eaeb6c9573c12f36370a29ae5cde9ef8903af26",
        "sha256": "c0d14f6586dd5c3329bd35640260ccf0154fa243faff94f744821a626f330ebe",
        "lineStart": 80,
        "lineEnd": 80,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/_index.md#L80-L80"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.b1ba5ec1a1a5c59ab4dc",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Grafana and the Grafana Cloud portal currently do not include built-in support for multi-factor authentication (MFA).",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure authentication",
        "Multi-factor authentication (MFA/2FA)"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "4eaeb6c9573c12f36370a29ae5cde9ef8903af26",
        "sha256": "c0d14f6586dd5c3329bd35640260ccf0154fa243faff94f744821a626f330ebe",
        "lineStart": 84,
        "lineEnd": 84,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/_index.md#L84-L84"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "mixed-edition-statement-requires-review",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.caaafaeade54e2ca506c",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "We strongly recommend integrating an external identity provider (IdP) that supports MFA, such as Okta, Entra ID, or Google Workspace. By configuring your Grafana instances to use an external IdP, you can leverage MFA to protect your accounts and resources effectively.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure authentication",
        "Multi-factor authentication (MFA/2FA)"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "4eaeb6c9573c12f36370a29ae5cde9ef8903af26",
        "sha256": "c0d14f6586dd5c3329bd35640260ccf0154fa243faff94f744821a626f330ebe",
        "lineStart": 86,
        "lineEnd": 86,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/_index.md#L86-L86"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.f646556d79e585a0103c",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "> The following applies if you're using Grafana basic authentication, LDAP (without Auth proxy) or OAuth integration.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure authentication",
        "Login and short-lived tokens"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/_index.md",
