        "lineStart": 98,
        "lineEnd": 98,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/_index.md#L98-L98"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.8216f18b22094576c63a",
      "syntaxRole": "list-item",
      "sourceText": "- A user can close a Grafana window and return before `now + login_maximum_inactive_lifetime_duration` to continue their session.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure authentication",
        "Login and short-lived tokens"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "4eaeb6c9573c12f36370a29ae5cde9ef8903af26",
        "sha256": "c0d14f6586dd5c3329bd35640260ccf0154fa243faff94f744821a626f330ebe",
        "lineStart": 99,
        "lineEnd": 99,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/_index.md#L99-L99"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.a305447a39f93cacca30",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Under certain circumstances you may require your users to re-authenticate before their session naturally expires. While Grafana doesn't offer Admin session revocation as standard functionality, you have the following workarounds if you need to force the logout of a user:",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure authentication",
        "Login and short-lived tokens",
        "Force logout"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "4eaeb6c9573c12f36370a29ae5cde9ef8903af26",
        "sha256": "c0d14f6586dd5c3329bd35640260ccf0154fa243faff94f744821a626f330ebe",
