    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.0428c0008a5908f24fa3",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "You can log out from other devices by removing login sessions from the bottom of your profile page. If you are a Grafana admin user, you can also do the same for any user from the Server Admin / Edit User view.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure authentication",
        "Extended authentication settings",
        "Remote logout"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "4eaeb6c9573c12f36370a29ae5cde9ef8903af26",
        "sha256": "c0d14f6586dd5c3329bd35640260ccf0154fa243faff94f744821a626f330ebe",
        "lineStart": 242,
        "lineEnd": 243,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/_index.md#L242-L243"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.1571c47836bfe6c80ba4",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "By default, after you configure an authorization provider, Grafana will adopt existing users into the new authentication scheme. For example, if you have created a user with basic authentication having the login `jsmith@example.com`, then set up SAML authentication where `jsmith@example.com` is an account, the user's authentication type will be changed to SAML if they perform a SAML sign-in.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure authentication",
        "Extended authentication settings",
        "Protected roles"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "4eaeb6c9573c12f36370a29ae5cde9ef8903af26",
        "sha256": "c0d14f6586dd5c3329bd35640260ccf0154fa243faff94f744821a626f330ebe",
        "lineStart": 251,
        "lineEnd": 251,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/_index.md#L251-L251"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.ef5eb62122bd83c5b440",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "You can disable this user adoption for certain roles using the `protected_roles` property:",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure authentication",
        "Extended authentication settings",
        "Protected roles"
      ],
