      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.8d3d50fa0dc4d217529c",
      "syntaxRole": "list-item",
      "sourceText": "- The next part of the configuration is the tricky part. We use Apache’s rewrite engine to create our **X-WEBAUTH-USER header**, populated with the authenticated user.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure auth proxy authentication",
        "Making Apache’s auth work together with Grafana’s AuthProxy",
        "Apache BasicAuth",
        "Apache configuration"
      ],
      "source": {
