    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.646c15f3c01e9bc739cd",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "With our Grafana and Apache containers running, you can now connect to http://localhost/ and log in using the username and password we created in the `htpasswd` file.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure auth proxy authentication",
        "Full walkthrough using Docker.",
        "Use grafana."
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/auth-proxy/index.md",
