    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.ddb73a161276d1e10b8e",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "With Team Sync, it's possible to set up synchronization between teams in your authentication provider and Grafana. You can send Grafana values as part of an HTTP header and have Grafana map them to your team structure. This allows you to put users into specific teams automatically.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure auth proxy authentication",
        "Full walkthrough using Docker.",
        "Team Sync"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/auth-proxy/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "9a79b026fbdf94cc528ae47537d1a00d347ad48a",
        "sha256": "fa803a39ed5121a5bc3cd9e90c23855d067d46c7e0ef1fa5d076af5a7b13ba7d",
        "lineStart": 246,
        "lineEnd": 246,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/auth-proxy/index.md#L246-L246"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.ea51f85876b1cf3d6802",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "To support the feature, auth proxy allows optional headers to map additional user attributes. The specific attribute to support team sync is `Groups`.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure auth proxy authentication",
        "Full walkthrough using Docker.",
        "Team Sync"
      ],
