    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.7de1083b95a750544a58",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "You use the `X-WEBAUTH-GROUPS` header to send the team information for each user. Specifically, the set of Grafana's group IDs that the user belongs to.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure auth proxy authentication",
        "Full walkthrough using Docker.",
        "Team Sync"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/auth-proxy/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "9a79b026fbdf94cc528ae47537d1a00d347ad48a",
        "sha256": "fa803a39ed5121a5bc3cd9e90c23855d067d46c7e0ef1fa5d076af5a7b13ba7d",
        "lineStart": 255,
        "lineEnd": 255,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/auth-proxy/index.md#L255-L255"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.a9b0d0b09ac5acae5d98",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "First, we need to set up the mapping between your authentication provider and Grafana. Follow [these instructions](../../configure-team-sync/#synchronize-a-grafana-team-with-an-external-group) to add groups to a team within Grafana.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure auth proxy authentication",
        "Full walkthrough using Docker.",
        "Team Sync"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/auth-proxy/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "9a79b026fbdf94cc528ae47537d1a00d347ad48a",
        "sha256": "fa803a39ed5121a5bc3cd9e90c23855d067d46c7e0ef1fa5d076af5a7b13ba7d",
        "lineStart": 257,
        "lineEnd": 257,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/auth-proxy/index.md#L257-L257"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.04dc01a7ffe24672251f",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Once that's done. You can verify your mappings by querying the API.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure auth proxy authentication",
        "Full walkthrough using Docker.",
        "Team Sync"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/auth-proxy/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "9a79b026fbdf94cc528ae47537d1a00d347ad48a",
        "sha256": "fa803a39ed5121a5bc3cd9e90c23855d067d46c7e0ef1fa5d076af5a7b13ba7d",
        "lineStart": 259,
        "lineEnd": 259,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/auth-proxy/index.md#L259-L259"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.50ffee3ab984dce48628",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "With this, the user `leonard` will be automatically placed into the Loki team as part of Grafana authentication.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure auth proxy authentication",
        "Full walkthrough using Docker.",
        "Team Sync"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/auth-proxy/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "9a79b026fbdf94cc528ae47537d1a00d347ad48a",
        "sha256": "fa803a39ed5121a5bc3cd9e90c23855d067d46c7e0ef1fa5d076af5a7b13ba7d",
        "lineStart": 313,
        "lineEnd": 313,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/auth-proxy/index.md#L313-L313"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.afc09dbe4371bb356da0",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "An empty `X-WEBAUTH-GROUPS` or the absence of a groups header will remove the user from all teams.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure auth proxy authentication",
        "Full walkthrough using Docker.",
        "Team Sync"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/auth-proxy/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "9a79b026fbdf94cc528ae47537d1a00d347ad48a",
        "sha256": "fa803a39ed5121a5bc3cd9e90c23855d067d46c7e0ef1fa5d076af5a7b13ba7d",
        "lineStart": 316,
        "lineEnd": 316,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/auth-proxy/index.md#L316-L316"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.1efedf372d1bca7fbbcb",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "[Learn more about Team Sync](../../configure-team-sync/)",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure auth proxy authentication",
        "Full walkthrough using Docker.",
        "Team Sync"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/auth-proxy/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "9a79b026fbdf94cc528ae47537d1a00d347ad48a",
