    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.4124d9a316797867300b",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "With `enable_login_token` set to `true` Grafana will, after successful auth proxy header validation, assign the user a login token and cookie. You only have to configure your auth proxy to provide headers for the /login route. Requests via other routes will be authenticated using the cookie.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure auth proxy authentication",
        "Login token and session cookie"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/auth-proxy/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "9a79b026fbdf94cc528ae47537d1a00d347ad48a",
        "sha256": "fa803a39ed5121a5bc3cd9e90c23855d067d46c7e0ef1fa5d076af5a7b13ba7d",
        "lineStart": 323,
        "lineEnd": 325,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/auth-proxy/index.md#L323-L325"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.616063a798d827b2407c",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Use the settings `login_maximum_inactive_lifetime_duration` and `login_maximum_lifetime_duration` under `[auth]` to control session lifetime.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure auth proxy authentication",
        "Login token and session cookie"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/auth-proxy/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "9a79b026fbdf94cc528ae47537d1a00d347ad48a",
        "sha256": "fa803a39ed5121a5bc3cd9e90c23855d067d46c7e0ef1fa5d076af5a7b13ba7d",
        "lineStart": 327,
        "lineEnd": 328,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/auth-proxy/index.md#L327-L328"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.b1aff878e4acbbd7961f",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Available in [Grafana Enterprise](../../../../introduction/grafana-enterprise/) and [Grafana Cloud](/docs/grafana-cloud). If you are a Grafana Cloud customer, please [open a support ticket in the Cloud Portal](/profile/org#support) to request this feature.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure enhanced LDAP integration"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/enhanced-ldap/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "284de0e86b0afebb96982ec3e1b1751d3a221ac8",
        "sha256": "50dbdd402f3a8c437a269535d7a5a7f44fd12348e039120e36a630db73063253",
        "lineStart": 29,
        "lineEnd": 30,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/enhanced-ldap/index.md#L29-L30"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "excluded-by-explicit-document-products",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.6ca52cda8b56d73aa0f1",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "With enhanced LDAP integration, you can set up synchronization between LDAP groups and teams. This enables LDAP users that are members of certain LDAP groups to automatically be added or removed as members to certain teams in Grafana.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure enhanced LDAP integration",
        "LDAP group synchronization for teams"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/enhanced-ldap/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "284de0e86b0afebb96982ec3e1b1751d3a221ac8",
        "sha256": "50dbdd402f3a8c437a269535d7a5a7f44fd12348e039120e36a630db73063253",
        "lineStart": 37,
        "lineEnd": 38,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/enhanced-ldap/index.md#L37-L38"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "excluded-by-explicit-document-products",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.eebabc3a5b1e75d96785",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Grafana keeps track of all synchronized users in teams, and you can see which users have been synchronized from LDAP in the team members list, see `LDAP` label in screenshot. This mechanism allows Grafana to remove an existing synchronized user from a team when its LDAP group membership changes. This mechanism also allows you to manually add a user as member of a team, and it will not be removed when the user signs in. This gives you flexibility to combine LDAP group memberships and Grafana team memberships.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure enhanced LDAP integration",
        "LDAP group synchronization for teams"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/enhanced-ldap/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "284de0e86b0afebb96982ec3e1b1751d3a221ac8",
        "sha256": "50dbdd402f3a8c437a269535d7a5a7f44fd12348e039120e36a630db73063253",
        "lineStart": 42,
        "lineEnd": 44,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/enhanced-ldap/index.md#L42-L44"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "excluded-by-explicit-document-products",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.32917d67cf9c63dbb44f",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "[Learn more about team sync.](https://grafana.com/docs/grafana/<GRAFANA_VERSION>/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-team-sync)",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure enhanced LDAP integration",
        "LDAP group synchronization for teams"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/enhanced-ldap/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "284de0e86b0afebb96982ec3e1b1751d3a221ac8",
        "sha256": "50dbdd402f3a8c437a269535d7a5a7f44fd12348e039120e36a630db73063253",
        "lineStart": 46,
        "lineEnd": 46,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/enhanced-ldap/index.md#L46-L46"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "excluded-by-explicit-document-products",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.a70cb1de53c108ad5ea3",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "In the open source version of Grafana, user data from LDAP is synchronized only during the login process when authenticating using LDAP.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure enhanced LDAP integration",
        "Active LDAP synchronization"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/enhanced-ldap/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "284de0e86b0afebb96982ec3e1b1751d3a221ac8",
        "sha256": "50dbdd402f3a8c437a269535d7a5a7f44fd12348e039120e36a630db73063253",
        "lineStart": 52,
        "lineEnd": 52,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/enhanced-ldap/index.md#L52-L52"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "excluded-by-explicit-document-products",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.5509fa2466a01772ceee",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "With active LDAP synchronization, you can configure Grafana to actively sync users with LDAP servers in the background. Only users that have logged into Grafana at least once are synchronized.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure enhanced LDAP integration",
        "Active LDAP synchronization"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/enhanced-ldap/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "284de0e86b0afebb96982ec3e1b1751d3a221ac8",
        "sha256": "50dbdd402f3a8c437a269535d7a5a7f44fd12348e039120e36a630db73063253",
        "lineStart": 54,
        "lineEnd": 54,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/enhanced-ldap/index.md#L54-L54"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "excluded-by-explicit-document-products",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.04b229e6f27bebbc6c27",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Removed users are automatically logged out and their account disabled. These accounts are displayed in the **Server Admin > Users** page with a `disabled` label. Disabled users keep their custom permissions on dashboards, folders, and data sources, so if you add them back in your LDAP database, they have access to the application with the same custom permissions as before.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure enhanced LDAP integration",
        "Active LDAP synchronization"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/enhanced-ldap/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "284de0e86b0afebb96982ec3e1b1751d3a221ac8",
        "sha256": "50dbdd402f3a8c437a269535d7a5a7f44fd12348e039120e36a630db73063253",
        "lineStart": 58,
        "lineEnd": 58,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/enhanced-ldap/index.md#L58-L58"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "excluded-by-explicit-document-products",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.b34499b0b75945408d88",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "For the synchronization to work, the `servers.search_filter` and `servers.attributes.username` in the `ldap.toml` configuration file must match. By default, the `servers.attributes.username` is `cn`, so if you use another attribute as the search filter, you must also update the username attribute.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure enhanced LDAP integration",
        "Active LDAP synchronization"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/enhanced-ldap/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "284de0e86b0afebb96982ec3e1b1751d3a221ac8",
        "sha256": "50dbdd402f3a8c437a269535d7a5a7f44fd12348e039120e36a630db73063253",
        "lineStart": 81,
        "lineEnd": 81,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/enhanced-ldap/index.md#L81-L81"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "excluded-by-explicit-document-products",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.34937b6ede2da10fca0f",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "If the attributes aren't the same, the users' sessions will be terminated after each synchronization. That's because the search will be done using the username's value, and that value doesn't exist for the attribute used in the search filter.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure enhanced LDAP integration",
        "Active LDAP synchronization"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/enhanced-ldap/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "284de0e86b0afebb96982ec3e1b1751d3a221ac8",
        "sha256": "50dbdd402f3a8c437a269535d7a5a7f44fd12348e039120e36a630db73063253",
        "lineStart": 93,
        "lineEnd": 93,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/enhanced-ldap/index.md#L93-L93"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "excluded-by-explicit-document-products",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.51933a825fd54bf97121",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "The Microsoft Entra ID authentication allows you to use a Microsoft Entra ID (formerly known as Azure Active Directory) tenant as an identity provider for Grafana. You can use Entra ID application roles to assign users and groups to Grafana roles from the Azure Portal.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure Microsoft Entra ID OAuth authentication"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/entraid/index.md",
