      "syntaxRole": "procedural-step",
      "sourceText": "1. You must have set `client_authentication` (env var `GF_AUTH_AZUREAD_CLIENT_AUTHENTICATION`) under `[auth.azuread]` to `workload_identity` in the Grafana server configuration for this to work.",
