      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "When assigning a group to a Grafana role, ensure that users are direct members of the group. Users in nested groups will not have access to Grafana due to limitations within Entra ID side. For more information, see [Microsoft Entra service limits and restrictions](https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/entra/identity/users/directory-service-limits-restrictions).",
