      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Every role requires a [Universally Unique Identifier](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Universally_unique_identifier) which you can generate on Linux with `uuidgen`, and on Windows through Microsoft PowerShell with `New-Guid`.",
