    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.d641d4284e5ca4bf5ada",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "After you've registered your application with Entra Id, As a Grafana Admin, you can configure your Entra ID OAuth client from within Grafana using the Grafana UI. To do this, navigate to the **Administration > Authentication > Entra ID** page and fill in the form. If you have a current configuration in the Grafana configuration file, the form will be pre-populated with those values. Otherwise the form will contain default values.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure Microsoft Entra ID OAuth authentication",
        "Configure the Entra ID authentication client using the Grafana UI"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/entraid/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "59fb58efe7a59116a30801f34622d72a3c482076",
        "sha256": "1fa9334110b531d913f725ea2734e69bce32e4da352e7d5a54ddde926605b058",
        "lineStart": 232,
        "lineEnd": 232,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/entraid/index.md#L232-L232"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.625d8b14a4c5d4244b78",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "After you have filled in the form, click **Save** to save the configuration. If the save was successful, Grafana will apply the new configurations.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure Microsoft Entra ID OAuth authentication",
        "Configure the Entra ID authentication client using the Grafana UI"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/entraid/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "59fb58efe7a59116a30801f34622d72a3c482076",
        "sha256": "1fa9334110b531d913f725ea2734e69bce32e4da352e7d5a54ddde926605b058",
        "lineStart": 234,
        "lineEnd": 234,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/entraid/index.md#L234-L234"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.40106fb0e090b2e16185",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "If you need to reset changes you made in the UI back to the default values, click **Reset**. After you have reset the changes, Grafana will apply the configuration from the Grafana configuration file (if there is any configuration) or the default values.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure Microsoft Entra ID OAuth authentication",
        "Configure the Entra ID authentication client using the Grafana UI"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/entraid/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "59fb58efe7a59116a30801f34622d72a3c482076",
        "sha256": "1fa9334110b531d913f725ea2734e69bce32e4da352e7d5a54ddde926605b058",
        "lineStart": 236,
        "lineEnd": 236,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/entraid/index.md#L236-L236"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.26a3f781461ec7299daf",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "If you run Grafana in high availability mode, configuration changes may not get applied to all Grafana instances immediately. You may need to wait a few minutes for the configuration to propagate to all Grafana instances.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure Microsoft Entra ID OAuth authentication",
        "Configure the Entra ID authentication client using the Grafana UI"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/entraid/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "59fb58efe7a59116a30801f34622d72a3c482076",
        "sha256": "1fa9334110b531d913f725ea2734e69bce32e4da352e7d5a54ddde926605b058",
        "lineStart": 239,
        "lineEnd": 239,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/entraid/index.md#L239-L239"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
