    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.aafa9efca92a497be06e",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Ensure that you have access to the [Grafana configuration file](../../../configure-grafana/#configuration-file-location).",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure Microsoft Entra ID OAuth authentication",
        "Configure the Entra ID authentication client using the Grafana configuration file"
      ],
      "source": {
