    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.8e92cc377a845ee0cfc5",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "You can find the Object Id of a group by clicking on the group and then clicking on **Properties**. The object ID is listed under **Object ID**. If you want to only give access to members of the group `example` with an Object Id of `8bab1c86-8fba-33e5-2089-1d1c80ec267d`, then set the following:",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure Microsoft Entra ID OAuth authentication",
        "Configure the Entra ID authentication client using the Grafana configuration file",
        "Configure allowed groups"
      ],
      "source": {
