    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.257c84f6c887276f6cfe",
      "syntaxRole": "procedural-step",
      "sourceText": "1. You must enable adding the [group attribute](https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/entra/identity-platform/optional-claims#configure-groups-optional-claims) to the tokens in your Entra ID App registration either [from the Azure Portal](#configure-group-membership-claims-on-the-azure-portal) or [from the manifest file](#configure-group-membership-claim-in-the-manifest-file).",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure Microsoft Entra ID OAuth authentication",
        "Configure the Entra ID authentication client using the Grafana configuration file",
        "Configure allowed groups"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/entraid/index.md",
