      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "If the user is a member of more than 200 groups, Entra ID does not emit the groups claim in the token and instead emits a group overage claim. To set up a group overage claim, see [Users with over 200 Group assignments](#users-with-over-200-group-assignments).",
