      "sourceText": "| `workload_identity_token_file`  | No       | Yes                | The path to the token file used to authenticate to the OAuth2 provider. This is only required when `client_authentication` is set to `workload_identity`. The token file contains the service account token projected by Kubernetes.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            | `/var/run/secrets/azure/tokens/azure-identity-token` |",
