      "sourceText": "| `federated_credential_audience` | No       | Yes                | The audience of the federated identity credential of your OAuth2 app. Required when `client_authentication` is set to `managed_identity` or `workload_identity`. For public cloud, this is typically `api://AzureADTokenExchange`.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                              | `api://AzureADTokenExchange`                         |",
