      "sourceText": "| `domain_hint`                   | No       | Yes                | The realm of the user in a federated directory. This skips the email-based discovery process that the user goes through on the Entra ID sign-in page, for a slightly more streamlined user experience. More info [here](https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/entra/identity-platform/v2-protocols-oidc#send-the-sign-in-request).                                                                                                                                                                  |                                                      |",
