    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.1fbe28e25e2414b77454",
      "syntaxRole": "table-row",
      "sourceText": "| `force_use_graph_api`           | No       | Yes                | Set to `true` to always fetch groups from the Microsoft Graph API instead of the `id_token`. If a user belongs to more than 200 groups, the Microsoft Graph API will be used to retrieve the groups regardless of this setting.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                 | `false`                                              |",
      "headingPath": [
