    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.4390ae84b557d268042a",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Here are some common issues and particulars you can run into when configuring Entra ID authentication in Grafana.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure Microsoft Entra ID OAuth authentication",
        "Common troubleshooting"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/entraid/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "59fb58efe7a59116a30801f34622d72a3c482076",
        "sha256": "1fa9334110b531d913f725ea2734e69bce32e4da352e7d5a54ddde926605b058",
        "lineStart": 482,
        "lineEnd": 482,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/entraid/index.md#L482-L482"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.53d9701c036ee9171513",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "To ensure that the token size doesn't exceed HTTP header size limits, Entra ID limits the number of object IDs that it includes in the groups claim. If a user is member of more groups than the coverage limit (200), then Entra ID does not emit the groups claim in the token and emits a group overage claim instead.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure Microsoft Entra ID OAuth authentication",
        "Common troubleshooting",
        "Users with over 200 Group assignments"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/entraid/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "59fb58efe7a59116a30801f34622d72a3c482076",
        "sha256": "1fa9334110b531d913f725ea2734e69bce32e4da352e7d5a54ddde926605b058",
        "lineStart": 486,
        "lineEnd": 488,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/entraid/index.md#L486-L488"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.87d00f1cb745556cd0ac",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "If Grafana receives a token with a group overage claim instead of a groups claim, Grafana attempts to retrieve the user's group membership by calling the included endpoint.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure Microsoft Entra ID OAuth authentication",
        "Common troubleshooting",
        "Users with over 200 Group assignments"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/entraid/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "59fb58efe7a59116a30801f34622d72a3c482076",
        "sha256": "1fa9334110b531d913f725ea2734e69bce32e4da352e7d5a54ddde926605b058",
        "lineStart": 492,
        "lineEnd": 493,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/entraid/index.md#L492-L493"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.322a54b110d3b66254eb",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "The Entra ID `App registration` must include the following API permissions for group overage claim calls to succeed:",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure Microsoft Entra ID OAuth authentication",
        "Common troubleshooting",
        "Users with over 200 Group assignments"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/entraid/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "59fb58efe7a59116a30801f34622d72a3c482076",
        "sha256": "1fa9334110b531d913f725ea2734e69bce32e4da352e7d5a54ddde926605b058",
