      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "If no application role is found, the user is assigned the role specified by [the `auto_assign_org_role` option](../../../configure-grafana/#auto_assign_org_role). You can disable this default role assignment by setting `role_attribute_strict = true`. This setting denies user access if no role or an invalid role is returned and the `org_mapping` expression evaluates to an empty mapping.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure Microsoft Entra ID OAuth authentication",
        "Common troubleshooting",
        "Map roles"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/entraid/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "59fb58efe7a59116a30801f34622d72a3c482076",
        "sha256": "1fa9334110b531d913f725ea2734e69bce32e4da352e7d5a54ddde926605b058",
        "lineStart": 538,
        "lineEnd": 540,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/entraid/index.md#L538-L540"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.25db35b0c4cf18f52871",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "You can use the `org_mapping` configuration option to assign the user to multiple organizations and specify their role based on their Entra ID group membership. For more information, refer to [Org roles mapping example](#org-roles-mapping-example). If the org role mapping (`org_mapping`) is specified and Entra ID returns a valid role, then the user will get the highest of the two roles.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure Microsoft Entra ID OAuth authentication",
        "Common troubleshooting",
        "Map roles"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/entraid/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "59fb58efe7a59116a30801f34622d72a3c482076",
