    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.2eafdae9fac84df540ad",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Most of the OAuth2 providers expose a stable subject identifier in the `sub` claim. You can use it to populate the Grafana login by setting `login_attribute_path` to `sub`. Because email is still required, also make sure Grafana can resolve the user's email (for example by including the `email` scope or mapping a custom field via `email_attribute_path`).",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure Generic OAuth authentication",
        "Configure generic OAuth authentication client using the Grafana configuration file",
        "Configure login",
        "Use the `sub` claim for login"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/generic-oauth/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "996494cdc76551860001d5497ab4650b4563badf",
        "sha256": "93bacfb30c084c7dd0e225675e875cd091c4a0ef7a5053c330ccb6c9cd367d87",
        "lineStart": 152,
        "lineEnd": 152,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/generic-oauth/index.md#L152-L152"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.e77760f43eeb7913c769",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Grafana can resolve a user's display name from the OAuth2 ID token, user information retrieved from the OAuth2 UserInfo endpoint, or the OAuth2 access token. Grafana looks at these sources in the order listed until it finds a display name. If no display name is found, then user's login is displayed instead.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure Generic OAuth authentication",
        "Configure generic OAuth authentication client using the Grafana configuration file",
        "Configure display name"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/generic-oauth/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "996494cdc76551860001d5497ab4650b4563badf",
        "sha256": "93bacfb30c084c7dd0e225675e875cd091c4a0ef7a5053c330ccb6c9cd367d87",
        "lineStart": 167,
        "lineEnd": 169,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/generic-oauth/index.md#L167-L169"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
