    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.fc48ff6925c1733a344e",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Available in [Grafana Enterprise](https://grafana.com/docs/grafana/<GRAFANA_VERSION>/introduction/grafana-enterprise/) and to customers on select Grafana Cloud plans. For pricing information, visit [pricing](https://grafana.com/pricing/) or contact our sales team.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure Generic OAuth authentication",
        "Configure team synchronization"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/generic-oauth/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "996494cdc76551860001d5497ab4650b4563badf",
        "sha256": "93bacfb30c084c7dd0e225675e875cd091c4a0ef7a5053c330ccb6c9cd367d87",
        "lineStart": 388,
        "lineEnd": 388,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/generic-oauth/index.md#L388-L388"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "mixed-edition-statement-requires-review",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.4cbb5331a8f336aae3fe",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "By using Team Sync, you can link your OAuth2 groups to teams within Grafana. This will automatically assign users to the appropriate teams. Teams for each user are synchronized when the user logs in.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure Generic OAuth authentication",
        "Configure team synchronization"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/generic-oauth/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "996494cdc76551860001d5497ab4650b4563badf",
        "sha256": "93bacfb30c084c7dd0e225675e875cd091c4a0ef7a5053c330ccb6c9cd367d87",
        "lineStart": 391,
        "lineEnd": 392,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/generic-oauth/index.md#L391-L392"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.e558bfbb42053ec88230",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Generic OAuth groups can be referenced by group ID, such as `8bab1c86-8fba-33e5-2089-1d1c80ec267d` or `myteam`. Group information can be extracted from the OAuth2 ID token, user information from the UserInfo endpoint, or the OAuth2 access token. For information on configuring OAuth2 groups with Grafana using the `groups_attribute_path` configuration option, refer to [configuration options](#configuration-options).",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure Generic OAuth authentication",
        "Configure team synchronization"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/generic-oauth/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "996494cdc76551860001d5497ab4650b4563badf",
        "sha256": "93bacfb30c084c7dd0e225675e875cd091c4a0ef7a5053c330ccb6c9cd367d87",
        "lineStart": 394,
        "lineEnd": 396,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/generic-oauth/index.md#L394-L396"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.33265854dba37bf4de48",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "To learn more about Team Sync, refer to [Configure team sync](https://grafana.com/docs/grafana/<GRAFANA_VERSION>/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-team-sync/).",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure Generic OAuth authentication",
        "Configure team synchronization"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/generic-oauth/index.md",
