      "syntaxRole": "table-row",
      "sourceText": "| `allow_sign_up`              | No       | Yes                | Controls Grafana user creation through the Generic OAuth login. Only existing Grafana users can log in with Generic OAuth if set to `false`.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                | `true`          |",
