      "syntaxRole": "table-row",
      "sourceText": "| `auto_login`                 | No       | Yes                | Set to `true` to enable users to bypass the login screen and automatically log in. This setting is ignored if you configure multiple auth providers to use auto-login.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                      | `false`         |",
