    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.f16519297537663aae0a",
      "syntaxRole": "table-row",
      "sourceText": "| `email_attribute_path`       | No       | Yes                | [JMESPath](http://jmespath.org/examples.html) expression to use for user email lookup from the user information. For more information on how user email is retrieved, refer to [Configure email address](#configure-email-address).                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                         |                 |",
