    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.7c310526e7042775a6e3",
      "syntaxRole": "table-row",
      "sourceText": "| `team_ids_attribute_path`    | No       | Yes                | The [JMESPath](http://jmespath.org/examples.html) expression to use for Grafana team ID lookup within the results returned by the `teams_url` endpoint.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                     |                 |",
      "headingPath": [
