      "sourceText": "| `tls_skip_verify_insecure`   | No       | No                 | If set to `true`, the client accepts any certificate presented by the server and any host name in that certificate. _You should only use this for testing_, because this mode leaves SSL/TLS susceptible to man-in-the-middle attacks.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                      | `false`         |",
