      "sourceText": "| `validate_id_token`          | No       | Yes                | Set to `true` to enable JWT signature validation for ID tokens. When enabled, `jwk_set_url` must be configured.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                             | `false`         |",
