    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.8e5b292a73d754364961",
      "syntaxRole": "procedural-step",
      "sourceText": "1. If you wish to use a flow besides `Sign Up or In`, go to the **IdP Applications** menu in the console, and select your IdP application. Then alter the **Flow Hosting URL** query parameter `?flow=sign-up-or-in` to change which flow id you wish to use.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure Generic OAuth authentication",
        "Examples of setting up Generic OAuth",
        "Set up OAuth2 with Descope"
      ],
      "source": {
