      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "`<dex base uri>` corresponds to the `issuer: ` configuration in Dex (e.g. the Dex domain possibly including a path such as e.g. `/dex`). The `offline_access` scope is needed when using [refresh tokens](#configure-a-refresh-token).",
