    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.6b289af97efa04af3b8e",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "As a Grafana Admin, you can configure GitHub OAuth client from within Grafana using the GitHub UI. To do this, navigate to **Administration > Authentication > GitHub** page and fill in the form. If you have a current configuration in the Grafana configuration file, the form will be pre-populated with those values. Otherwise the form will contain default values.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure GitHub OAuth authentication",
        "Configure GitHub authentication client using the Grafana UI"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/github/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "d2e6241054e4dfdceaf82864b39f2c01b645d35b",
        "sha256": "e3144b4bb1bc579850a537917ef83ed365c13e124ab10db7f6446154676a14c4",
        "lineStart": 48,
        "lineEnd": 48,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/github/index.md#L48-L48"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.fc2a2c19e3a44dafd156",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "After you have filled in the form, click **Save**. If the save was successful, Grafana will apply the new configurations.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure GitHub OAuth authentication",
        "Configure GitHub authentication client using the Grafana UI"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/github/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "d2e6241054e4dfdceaf82864b39f2c01b645d35b",
        "sha256": "e3144b4bb1bc579850a537917ef83ed365c13e124ab10db7f6446154676a14c4",
        "lineStart": 50,
        "lineEnd": 50,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/github/index.md#L50-L50"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.5a18a04fd2c5be039538",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "If you need to reset changes you made in the UI back to the default values, click **Reset**. After you have reset the changes, Grafana will apply the configuration from the Grafana configuration file (if there is any configuration) or the default values.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure GitHub OAuth authentication",
        "Configure GitHub authentication client using the Grafana UI"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/github/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "d2e6241054e4dfdceaf82864b39f2c01b645d35b",
        "sha256": "e3144b4bb1bc579850a537917ef83ed365c13e124ab10db7f6446154676a14c4",
        "lineStart": 52,
        "lineEnd": 52,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/github/index.md#L52-L52"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.8bc3a42ccf08992bfd3c",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "If you run Grafana in high availability mode, configuration changes may not get applied to all Grafana instances immediately. You may need to wait a few minutes for the configuration to propagate to all Grafana instances.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure GitHub OAuth authentication",
        "Configure GitHub authentication client using the Grafana UI"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/github/index.md",
