    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.303d3dd17e481277f826",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Unless the `skip_org_role_sync` option is enabled, the user's role will be set to the role retrieved from GitHub upon user login.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure GitHub OAuth authentication",
        "Configure GitHub authentication client using the Grafana configuration file",
        "Configure role mapping"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/github/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "d2e6241054e4dfdceaf82864b39f2c01b645d35b",
        "sha256": "e3144b4bb1bc579850a537917ef83ed365c13e124ab10db7f6446154676a14c4",
        "lineStart": 114,
        "lineEnd": 114,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/github/index.md#L114-L114"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.304903fdc1a7b58e6b9a",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "The user's role is retrieved using a [JMESPath](http://jmespath.org/examples.html) expression from the `role_attribute_path` configuration option. To map the server administrator role, use the `allow_assign_grafana_admin` configuration option. Refer to [configuration options](#configuration-options) for more information.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure GitHub OAuth authentication",
        "Configure GitHub authentication client using the Grafana configuration file",
        "Configure role mapping"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/github/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "d2e6241054e4dfdceaf82864b39f2c01b645d35b",
        "sha256": "e3144b4bb1bc579850a537917ef83ed365c13e124ab10db7f6446154676a14c4",
        "lineStart": 116,
        "lineEnd": 118,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/github/index.md#L116-L118"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.401200618e54b33f1d13",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "If no valid role is found, the user is assigned the role specified by [the `auto_assign_org_role` option](../../../configure-grafana/#auto_assign_org_role). You can disable this default role assignment by setting `role_attribute_strict = true`. This setting denies user access if no role or an invalid role is returned after evaluating the `role_attribute_path` and the `org_mapping` expressions.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure GitHub OAuth authentication",
        "Configure GitHub authentication client using the Grafana configuration file",
        "Configure role mapping"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/github/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "d2e6241054e4dfdceaf82864b39f2c01b645d35b",
        "sha256": "e3144b4bb1bc579850a537917ef83ed365c13e124ab10db7f6446154676a14c4",
        "lineStart": 120,
        "lineEnd": 121,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/github/index.md#L120-L121"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.7b945bcbbe3cb4ee3acd",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "You can use the `org_mapping` configuration options to assign the user to organizations and specify their role based on their GitHub team membership. For more information, refer to [Org roles mapping example](#org-roles-mapping-example). If both org role mapping (`org_mapping`) and the regular role mapping (`role_attribute_path`) are specified, then the user will get the highest of the two mapped roles.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure GitHub OAuth authentication",
        "Configure GitHub authentication client using the Grafana configuration file",
        "Configure role mapping"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/github/index.md",
