    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.8350d7b2e288dd7fe3d6",
      "syntaxRole": "table-row",
      "sourceText": "| `allow_sign_up`              | No       | Yes                | Whether to allow new Grafana user creation through GitHub login. If set to `false`, then only existing Grafana users can log in with GitHub OAuth.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    | `true`                                        |",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure GitHub OAuth authentication",
        "Configuration options"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/github/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "d2e6241054e4dfdceaf82864b39f2c01b645d35b",
        "sha256": "e3144b4bb1bc579850a537917ef83ed365c13e124ab10db7f6446154676a14c4",
        "lineStart": 251,
        "lineEnd": 251,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/github/index.md#L251-L251"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.0378ddd45bf41a525e9b",
      "syntaxRole": "table-row",
      "sourceText": "| `auto_login`                 | No       | Yes                | Set to `true` to enable users to bypass the login screen and automatically log in. This setting is ignored if you configure multiple auth providers to use auto-login.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                | `false`                                       |",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure GitHub OAuth authentication",
        "Configuration options"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/github/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "d2e6241054e4dfdceaf82864b39f2c01b645d35b",
        "sha256": "e3144b4bb1bc579850a537917ef83ed365c13e124ab10db7f6446154676a14c4",
        "lineStart": 252,
        "lineEnd": 252,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/github/index.md#L252-L252"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.84a14eceb0c3fdfefb8c",
      "syntaxRole": "table-row",
      "sourceText": "| `login_prompt`               | No       | Yes                | Indicates the type of user interaction when the user logs in with GitHub. Available values are `login`, `consent` and `select_account`.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                               |                                               |",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure GitHub OAuth authentication",
        "Configuration options"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/github/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "d2e6241054e4dfdceaf82864b39f2c01b645d35b",
        "sha256": "e3144b4bb1bc579850a537917ef83ed365c13e124ab10db7f6446154676a14c4",
        "lineStart": 253,
        "lineEnd": 253,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/github/index.md#L253-L253"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.86b504937ce3cd6b4cc0",
      "syntaxRole": "table-row",
      "sourceText": "| `role_attribute_path`        | No       | Yes                | [JMESPath](http://jmespath.org/examples.html) expression to use for Grafana role lookup. Grafana will first evaluate the expression using the user information obtained from the UserInfo endpoint. If no role is found, Grafana creates a JSON data with `groups` key that maps to GitHub teams obtained from GitHub's [`/api/user/teams`](https://docs.github.com/en/rest/teams/teams#list-teams-for-the-authenticated-user) endpoint, and evaluates the expression using this data. The result of the evaluation should be a valid Grafana role (`None`, `Viewer`, `Editor`, `Admin` or `GrafanaAdmin`). For more information on user role mapping, refer to [Configure role mapping](#org-roles-mapping-example). |                                               |",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure GitHub OAuth authentication",
        "Configuration options"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/github/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "d2e6241054e4dfdceaf82864b39f2c01b645d35b",
