      "syntaxRole": "table-row",
      "sourceText": "| `skip_org_role_sync`         | No       | Yes                | Set to `true` to stop automatically syncing user roles.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                               | `false`                                       |",
