    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.4d4e21d12bc8e5783ec2",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "To limit access to authenticated users that are members of one or more [GitLab groups](https://docs.gitlab.com/ce/user/group/index.html), set `allowed_groups` to a comma or space-separated list of groups.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure GitLab OAuth authentication",
        "Configure GitLab authentication client using the Grafana configuration file",
        "Configure allowed groups"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/gitlab/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "60055d69865bdbc143aa7f58e3b08d13b64a58a6",
        "sha256": "11af01f967c74718eb99ac11c02fdfa3c3722d3fb4566916e5a70c0a5ecd2ac5",
        "lineStart": 169,
        "lineEnd": 171,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/gitlab/index.md#L169-L171"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.36c60160e6f9c4e60f11",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "GitLab's groups are referenced by the group name. For example, `developers`. To reference a subgroup `frontend`, use `developers/frontend`. Note that in GitLab, the group or subgroup name does not always match its display name, especially if the display name contains spaces or special characters. Make sure you always use the group or subgroup name as it appears in the URL of the group or subgroup.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure GitLab OAuth authentication",
        "Configure GitLab authentication client using the Grafana configuration file",
        "Configure allowed groups"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/gitlab/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "60055d69865bdbc143aa7f58e3b08d13b64a58a6",
        "sha256": "11af01f967c74718eb99ac11c02fdfa3c3722d3fb4566916e5a70c0a5ecd2ac5",
        "lineStart": 173,
        "lineEnd": 175,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/gitlab/index.md#L173-L175"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.7f8c30cf1bde6940b888",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Unless `skip_org_role_sync` option is enabled, the user's role will be set to the role retrieved from GitLab upon user login.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure GitLab OAuth authentication",
        "Configure GitLab authentication client using the Grafana configuration file",
        "Configure role mapping"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/gitlab/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "60055d69865bdbc143aa7f58e3b08d13b64a58a6",
        "sha256": "11af01f967c74718eb99ac11c02fdfa3c3722d3fb4566916e5a70c0a5ecd2ac5",
        "lineStart": 179,
        "lineEnd": 179,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/gitlab/index.md#L179-L179"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.e2ad697a5e3dda34c641",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "The user's role is retrieved using a [JMESPath](http://jmespath.org/examples.html) expression from the `role_attribute_path` configuration option. To map the server administrator role, use the `allow_assign_grafana_admin` configuration option. Refer to [configuration options](#configuration-options) for more information.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure GitLab OAuth authentication",
        "Configure GitLab authentication client using the Grafana configuration file",
        "Configure role mapping"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/gitlab/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "60055d69865bdbc143aa7f58e3b08d13b64a58a6",
        "sha256": "11af01f967c74718eb99ac11c02fdfa3c3722d3fb4566916e5a70c0a5ecd2ac5",
        "lineStart": 181,
        "lineEnd": 183,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/gitlab/index.md#L181-L183"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.61dfb61782436a932c21",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "You can use the `org_mapping` configuration option to assign the user to multiple organizations and specify their role based on their GitLab group membership. For more information, refer to [Org roles mapping example](#org-roles-mapping-example). If the org role mapping (`org_mapping`) is specified and Entra ID returns a valid role, then the user will get the highest of the two roles.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure GitLab OAuth authentication",
        "Configure GitLab authentication client using the Grafana configuration file",
        "Configure role mapping"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/gitlab/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "60055d69865bdbc143aa7f58e3b08d13b64a58a6",
        "sha256": "11af01f967c74718eb99ac11c02fdfa3c3722d3fb4566916e5a70c0a5ecd2ac5",
        "lineStart": 185,
        "lineEnd": 185,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/gitlab/index.md#L185-L185"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.60c77410bcae4dfd92ed",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "If no valid role is found, the user is assigned the role specified by [the `auto_assign_org_role` option](../../../configure-grafana/#auto_assign_org_role). You can disable this default role assignment by setting `role_attribute_strict = true`. This setting denies user access if no role or an invalid role is returned after evaluating the `role_attribute_path` and the `org_mapping` expressions.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure GitLab OAuth authentication",
        "Configure GitLab authentication client using the Grafana configuration file",
        "Configure role mapping"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/gitlab/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "60055d69865bdbc143aa7f58e3b08d13b64a58a6",
        "sha256": "11af01f967c74718eb99ac11c02fdfa3c3722d3fb4566916e5a70c0a5ecd2ac5",
