      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "GitLab groups are referenced by the group name. For example, `developers`. To reference a subgroup `frontend`, use `developers/frontend`. Note that in GitLab, the group or subgroup name does not always match its display name, especially if the display name contains spaces or special characters. Make sure you always use the group or subgroup name as it appears in the URL of the group or subgroup.",
      "headingPath": [
