      "id": "grafana.candidate.3ee7841ac53a2baf8cdf",
      "syntaxRole": "table-row",
      "sourceText": "| `auth_url`                   | Yes      | Yes                | Authorization endpoint of your GitLab OAuth provider. If you use your own instance of GitLab instead of gitlab.com, adjust `auth_url` by replacing the `gitlab.com` hostname with your own.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                              | `https://gitlab.com/oauth/authorize` |",
