      "sourceText": "| `api_url`                    | No       | Yes                | Grafana uses `<api_url>/user` endpoint to obtain GitLab user information compatible with [OpenID UserInfo](https://connect2id.com/products/server/docs/api/userinfo).                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    | `https://gitlab.com/api/v4`          |",
