      "id": "grafana.candidate.46c11bae0dec0f094a0a",
      "syntaxRole": "table-row",
      "sourceText": "| `scopes`                     | No       | Yes                | List of comma or space-separated GitLab OAuth scopes.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    | `openid email profile`               |",
