    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.4f8c53cd11a22b7e6598",
      "syntaxRole": "table-row",
      "sourceText": "| `auto_login`                 | No       | Yes                | Set to `true` to enable users to bypass the login screen and automatically log in. This setting is ignored if you configure multiple auth providers to use auto-login.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                   | `false`                              |",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure GitLab OAuth authentication",
        "Configuration options"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/gitlab/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "60055d69865bdbc143aa7f58e3b08d13b64a58a6",
        "sha256": "11af01f967c74718eb99ac11c02fdfa3c3722d3fb4566916e5a70c0a5ecd2ac5",
        "lineStart": 307,
        "lineEnd": 307,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/gitlab/index.md#L307-L307"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.9acef95188287daeed19",
      "syntaxRole": "table-row",
      "sourceText": "| `login_prompt`               | No       | Yes                | Indicates the type of user interaction when the user logs in with GitLab. Available values are `login`, `consent` and `select_account`.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                  |                                      |",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure GitLab OAuth authentication",
        "Configuration options"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/gitlab/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "60055d69865bdbc143aa7f58e3b08d13b64a58a6",
        "sha256": "11af01f967c74718eb99ac11c02fdfa3c3722d3fb4566916e5a70c0a5ecd2ac5",
        "lineStart": 308,
        "lineEnd": 308,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/gitlab/index.md#L308-L308"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.f5584f8cf69414154ddd",
      "syntaxRole": "table-row",
      "sourceText": "| `role_attribute_path`        | No       | Yes                | [JMESPath](http://jmespath.org/examples.html) expression to use for Grafana role lookup. Grafana will first evaluate the expression using the GitLab OAuth token. If no role is found, Grafana creates a JSON data with `groups` key that maps to groups obtained from GitLab's `/oauth/userinfo` endpoint, and evaluates the expression using this data. Finally, if a valid role is still not found, the expression is evaluated against the user information retrieved from `api_url/users` endpoint and groups retrieved from `api_url/groups` endpoint. The result of the evaluation should be a valid Grafana role (`None`, `Viewer`, `Editor`, `Admin` or `GrafanaAdmin`). For more information on user role mapping, refer to [Configure role mapping](#configure-role-mapping). |                                      |",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure GitLab OAuth authentication",
        "Configuration options"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/gitlab/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "60055d69865bdbc143aa7f58e3b08d13b64a58a6",
        "sha256": "11af01f967c74718eb99ac11c02fdfa3c3722d3fb4566916e5a70c0a5ecd2ac5",
        "lineStart": 309,
        "lineEnd": 309,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/gitlab/index.md#L309-L309"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.b7c5fef8c0eb07908683",
      "syntaxRole": "table-row",
      "sourceText": "| `role_attribute_strict`      | No       | Yes                | Set to `true` to deny user login if the Grafana role cannot be extracted using `role_attribute_path`. For more information on user role mapping, refer to [Configure role mapping](#configure-role-mapping).                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                             | `false`                              |",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure GitLab OAuth authentication",
        "Configuration options"
      ],
