    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.486830e7c4bc7495be0c",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "As a Grafana Admin, you can configure Google OAuth client from within Grafana using the Google UI. To do this, navigate to **Administration > Authentication > Google** page and fill in the form. If you have a current configuration in the Grafana configuration file then the form will be pre-populated with those values otherwise the form will contain default values.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure Google OAuth authentication",
        "Configure Google authentication client using the Grafana UI"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/google/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "53ca46b6aee0a719a8cbd28a536c33a8fe2e5733",
        "sha256": "a3ff08724962dd5598b98503415b00b745cf0225af5d2b42cdc330ad5f2f46e8",
        "lineStart": 50,
        "lineEnd": 50,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/google/index.md#L50-L50"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.c051130b5b62a24fc16d",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "After you have filled in the form, click **Save**. If the save was successful, Grafana will apply the new configurations.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure Google OAuth authentication",
        "Configure Google authentication client using the Grafana UI"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/google/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "53ca46b6aee0a719a8cbd28a536c33a8fe2e5733",
        "sha256": "a3ff08724962dd5598b98503415b00b745cf0225af5d2b42cdc330ad5f2f46e8",
        "lineStart": 52,
        "lineEnd": 52,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/google/index.md#L52-L52"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.c515eeadd494420ea3e5",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "If you need to reset changes made in the UI back to the default values, click **Reset**. After you have reset the changes, Grafana will apply the configuration from the Grafana configuration file (if there is any configuration) or the default values.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure Google OAuth authentication",
        "Configure Google authentication client using the Grafana UI"
      ],
      "source": {
