    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.e72936d1e159144ae33d",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Ensure that you have access to the [Grafana configuration file](../../../configure-grafana/#configuration-file-location).",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure Google OAuth authentication",
        "Configure Google authentication client using the Grafana configuration file"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/google/index.md",
