    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.53063e319cea9925e7ce",
      "syntaxRole": "table-row",
      "sourceText": "| `auth_style`                 | No       | Yes                | Name of the [OAuth2 AuthStyle](https://pkg.go.dev/golang.org/x/oauth2#AuthStyle) to be used when ID token is requested from OAuth2 provider. It determines how `client_id` and `client_secret` are sent to Oauth2 provider. Available values are `AutoDetect`, `InParams` and `InHeader`.                                                                                                                                                                                                       | `AutoDetect`                                       |",
