    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.e49aeae86aa910bba1c8",
      "syntaxRole": "table-row",
      "sourceText": "| `validate_hd`                | No       | Yes                | Set to `false` to disable the validation of the `hd` parameter from the Google ID token. For more informatiion, refer to [Enable Google OAuth in Grafana](#enable-google-oauth-in-grafana).                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                     | `true`                                             |",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure Google OAuth authentication",
        "Configuration options"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/google/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "53ca46b6aee0a719a8cbd28a536c33a8fe2e5733",
