    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.56579ae90306e31bc11e",
      "syntaxRole": "table-row",
      "sourceText": "| `role_attribute_strict`      | No       | Yes                | Set to `true` to deny user login if the Grafana org role cannot be extracted using `role_attribute_path` or `org_mapping`. For more information on user role mapping, refer to [Configure role mapping](#configure-role-mapping).                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                               | `false`                                            |",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure Google OAuth authentication",
        "Configuration options"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/google/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "53ca46b6aee0a719a8cbd28a536c33a8fe2e5733",
        "sha256": "a3ff08724962dd5598b98503415b00b745cf0225af5d2b42cdc330ad5f2f46e8",
        "lineStart": 330,
        "lineEnd": 330,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/google/index.md#L330-L330"
      },
