    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.9c717763624ceba43757",
      "syntaxRole": "table-row",
      "sourceText": "| `org_attribute_path`         | No       | No                 | [JMESPath](http://jmespath.org/examples.html) expression to use for Grafana org to role lookup. Grafana will first evaluate the expression using the OAuth2 ID token. If no value is returned, the expression will be evaluated using the user information obtained from the UserInfo endpoint. The result of the evaluation will be mapped to org roles based on `org_mapping`. For more information on org to role mapping, refer to [Org roles mapping example](#org-roles-mapping-example). |                                                    |",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure Google OAuth authentication",
        "Configuration options"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/google/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "53ca46b6aee0a719a8cbd28a536c33a8fe2e5733",
        "sha256": "a3ff08724962dd5598b98503415b00b745cf0225af5d2b42cdc330ad5f2f46e8",
        "lineStart": 331,
        "lineEnd": 331,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/google/index.md#L331-L331"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.7d90b36e8387a2a4fd47",
      "syntaxRole": "table-row",
      "sourceText": "| `org_mapping`                | No       | No                 | List of comma- or space-separated `<ExternalOrgName>:<OrgIdOrName>:<Role>` mappings. Value can be `*` meaning \"All users\". Role is optional and can have the following values: `None`, `Viewer`, `Editor` or `Admin`. For more information on external organization to role mapping, refer to [Org roles mapping example](#org-roles-mapping-example).                                                                                                                                          |                                                    |",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure Google OAuth authentication",
        "Configuration options"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/google/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "53ca46b6aee0a719a8cbd28a536c33a8fe2e5733",
        "sha256": "a3ff08724962dd5598b98503415b00b745cf0225af5d2b42cdc330ad5f2f46e8",
        "lineStart": 332,
        "lineEnd": 332,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/google/index.md#L332-L332"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.4c74394bd22ad342ba5e",
      "syntaxRole": "table-row",
      "sourceText": "| `allow_assign_grafana_admin` | No       | No                 | Set to `true` to automatically sync the Grafana server administrator role. When enabled, if the Google user's App role is `GrafanaAdmin`, Grafana grants the user server administrator privileges and the organization administrator role. If disabled, the user will only receive the organization administrator role. For more details on user role mapping, refer to [Map roles](#map-roles).                                                                                                | `false`                                            |",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure Google OAuth authentication",
        "Configuration options"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/google/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "53ca46b6aee0a719a8cbd28a536c33a8fe2e5733",
        "sha256": "a3ff08724962dd5598b98503415b00b745cf0225af5d2b42cdc330ad5f2f46e8",
        "lineStart": 333,
        "lineEnd": 333,
