    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.ba18568d7b9501698908",
      "syntaxRole": "table-row",
      "sourceText": "| `allowed_groups`             | No       | Yes                | List of comma- or space-separated groups. The user should be a member of at least one group to log in. If you configure `allowed_groups`, you must also configure Google to include the `groups` claim following [Configure allowed groups](#configure-allowed-groups).                                                                                                                                                                                                                         |                                                    |",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure Google OAuth authentication",
        "Configuration options"
      ],
      "source": {
