      "id": "grafana.candidate.1b4584210e53cbf5a277",
      "syntaxRole": "table-row",
      "sourceText": "| `validate_id_token`          | No       | Yes                | If enabled, Grafana will validate the JWT signature of ID tokens using the JWKS endpoint. This enhances security by ensuring tokens are authentic and have not been tampered with.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                              | `false`                                            |",
      "headingPath": [
