      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Typically, the subject claim called `\"sub\"` would be used as a login but it might also be set to some application specific claim.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure JWT authentication",
        "Configure login claim"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/jwt/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "d73972fe9dec8503e08753fa7924c464bebf652b",
        "sha256": "00ebda8f01e575437120e31c92569275e9356e4f56b009a2c9490677dfb94841",
        "lineStart": 52,
        "lineEnd": 52,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/jwt/index.md#L52-L52"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.238c39dc8900a672aee9",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "If `auto_sign_up` is enabled, then the `sub` claim is used as the \"external Auth ID\". The `name` claim is used as the user's full name if it is present.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure JWT authentication",
        "Configure login claim"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/jwt/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "d73972fe9dec8503e08753fa7924c464bebf652b",
        "sha256": "00ebda8f01e575437120e31c92569275e9356e4f56b009a2c9490677dfb94841",
        "lineStart": 68,
        "lineEnd": 68,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/jwt/index.md#L68-L68"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.7126e93882015b4b1dd6",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Additionally, if the login username or the email claims are nested inside the JWT structure, you can specify the path to the attributes using the `username_attribute_path` and `email_attribute_path` configuration options using the JMESPath syntax.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure JWT authentication",
        "Configure login claim"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/jwt/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "d73972fe9dec8503e08753fa7924c464bebf652b",
        "sha256": "00ebda8f01e575437120e31c92569275e9356e4f56b009a2c9490677dfb94841",
        "lineStart": 70,
        "lineEnd": 70,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/jwt/index.md#L70-L70"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.6aa6aeb5ba6a4bca5243",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "If you want to embed Grafana in an iframe while maintaining user identity and role checks, you can use JWT authentication to authenticate the iframe.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure JWT authentication",
        "Iframe Embedding"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/jwt/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "d73972fe9dec8503e08753fa7924c464bebf652b",
        "sha256": "00ebda8f01e575437120e31c92569275e9356e4f56b009a2c9490677dfb94841",
        "lineStart": 98,
        "lineEnd": 99,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/jwt/index.md#L98-L99"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.d1c96e243e6cf95f7bec",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "In this scenario, you will need to configure Grafana to accept a JWT provided in the HTTP header and a reverse proxy should rewrite requests to the Grafana instance to include the JWT in the request's headers.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure JWT authentication",
        "Iframe Embedding"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/jwt/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "d73972fe9dec8503e08753fa7924c464bebf652b",
        "sha256": "00ebda8f01e575437120e31c92569275e9356e4f56b009a2c9490677dfb94841",
        "lineStart": 106,
        "lineEnd": 108,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/jwt/index.md#L106-L108"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.c8da3d053c4a0ae7f123",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "For embedding to work, you must enable `allow_embedding` in the [security section](../../../configure-grafana/#allow_embedding). This setting is not available in Grafana Cloud.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure JWT authentication",
        "Iframe Embedding"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/jwt/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "d73972fe9dec8503e08753fa7924c464bebf652b",
        "sha256": "00ebda8f01e575437120e31c92569275e9356e4f56b009a2c9490677dfb94841",
        "lineStart": 111,
        "lineEnd": 111,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/jwt/index.md#L111-L111"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "mixed-edition-statement-requires-review",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.adca6b658a390d2d8deb",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "In a scenario where it is not possible to rewrite the request headers you can use URL login instead.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure JWT authentication",
        "Iframe Embedding"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/jwt/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "d73972fe9dec8503e08753fa7924c464bebf652b",
        "sha256": "00ebda8f01e575437120e31c92569275e9356e4f56b009a2c9490677dfb94841",
        "lineStart": 114,
        "lineEnd": 115,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/jwt/index.md#L114-L115"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.8ee1baa542b191593d49",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "`url_login` allows grafana to search for a JWT in the URL query parameter `auth_token` and use it as the authentication token.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure JWT authentication",
        "Iframe Embedding",
        "URL login"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/jwt/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "d73972fe9dec8503e08753fa7924c464bebf652b",
        "sha256": "00ebda8f01e575437120e31c92569275e9356e4f56b009a2c9490677dfb94841",
        "lineStart": 119,
        "lineEnd": 120,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/jwt/index.md#L119-L120"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.b4f8f07522393ac1ed48",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "You need to enable JWT before setting this setting. Refer to [Enabled JWT](#enable-jwt).",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure JWT authentication",
        "Iframe Embedding",
        "URL login"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/jwt/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "d73972fe9dec8503e08753fa7924c464bebf652b",
        "sha256": "00ebda8f01e575437120e31c92569275e9356e4f56b009a2c9490677dfb94841",
        "lineStart": 123,
        "lineEnd": 123,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/jwt/index.md#L123-L123"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.20f1cd26d563dc031b8e",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "This can lead to JWTs being exposed in logs and possible session hijacking if the server is not using HTTP over TLS.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure JWT authentication",
        "Iframe Embedding",
        "URL login"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/jwt/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "d73972fe9dec8503e08753fa7924c464bebf652b",
        "sha256": "00ebda8f01e575437120e31c92569275e9356e4f56b009a2c9490677dfb94841",
        "lineStart": 127,
        "lineEnd": 128,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/jwt/index.md#L127-L128"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.93a4ec9af3f6695a506d",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "JSON web token integrity needs to be verified so cryptographic signature is used for this purpose. So we expect that every token must be signed with some known cryptographic key.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure JWT authentication",
        "Signature verification"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/jwt/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "d73972fe9dec8503e08753fa7924c464bebf652b",
        "sha256": "00ebda8f01e575437120e31c92569275e9356e4f56b009a2c9490677dfb94841",
        "lineStart": 148,
        "lineEnd": 148,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/jwt/index.md#L148-L148"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.1b3a5281fd3a01c5f0e1",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "If the JWKS endpoint includes cache control headers and the value is less than the configured `cache_ttl`, then the cache control header value is used instead. If the `cache_ttl` is not set, the default of `60m` is used. `no-store` and `no-cache` cache control headers are ignored. To disable JWKS caching, set `cache_ttl = 0s`",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure JWT authentication",
        "Signature verification",
        "Verify token using a JSON Web Key Set loaded from https endpoint"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/jwt/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "d73972fe9dec8503e08753fa7924c464bebf652b",
        "sha256": "00ebda8f01e575437120e31c92569275e9356e4f56b009a2c9490677dfb94841",
        "lineStart": 178,
        "lineEnd": 178,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/jwt/index.md#L178-L178"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.03a20d4d27819dd2c414",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Key set in the same format as in JWKS endpoint but located on disk.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure JWT authentication",
        "Signature verification",
        "Verify token using a JSON Web Key Set loaded from JSON file"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/jwt/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "d73972fe9dec8503e08753fa7924c464bebf652b",
        "sha256": "00ebda8f01e575437120e31c92569275e9356e4f56b009a2c9490677dfb94841",
        "lineStart": 183,
        "lineEnd": 183,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/jwt/index.md#L183-L183"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.dd9155c33d80b02d20ba",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "If the JWT token's header specifies a `kid` (Key ID), then the Key ID must be set using the `key_id` configuration option.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure JWT authentication",
        "Signature verification",
        "Verify token using a single key loaded from PEM-encoded file"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/jwt/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "d73972fe9dec8503e08753fa7924c464bebf652b",
        "sha256": "00ebda8f01e575437120e31c92569275e9356e4f56b009a2c9490677dfb94841",
        "lineStart": 197,
        "lineEnd": 197,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/jwt/index.md#L197-L197"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.bb51039e36518e75856c",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "When you can't place a file on disk, put the key material directly in the configuration. This is useful when you provision configuration to a managed instance. Both options use the same content as their file-based counterparts, base64-encoded so it fits on one line.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure JWT authentication",
        "Signature verification",
        "Verify token using an inline key or key set"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/jwt/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "d73972fe9dec8503e08753fa7924c464bebf652b",
        "sha256": "00ebda8f01e575437120e31c92569275e9356e4f56b009a2c9490677dfb94841",
        "lineStart": 205,
        "lineEnd": 205,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/jwt/index.md#L205-L205"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.358d174129e2aac94732",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Configure the key set with exactly one of `key_file`, `key_value`, `jwk_set_file`, `jwk_set_value`, or `jwk_set_url`. Setting more than one is an error.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure JWT authentication",
        "Signature verification",
        "Verify token using an inline key or key set"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/jwt/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "d73972fe9dec8503e08753fa7924c464bebf652b",
        "sha256": "00ebda8f01e575437120e31c92569275e9356e4f56b009a2c9490677dfb94841",
        "lineStart": 222,
        "lineEnd": 222,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/jwt/index.md#L222-L222"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.1a17cc91908baf6d0bea",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "By default, only `\"exp\"`, `\"nbf\"` and `\"iat\"` claims are validated.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure JWT authentication",
        "Validate claims"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/jwt/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "d73972fe9dec8503e08753fa7924c464bebf652b",
        "sha256": "00ebda8f01e575437120e31c92569275e9356e4f56b009a2c9490677dfb94841",
        "lineStart": 227,
        "lineEnd": 227,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/jwt/index.md#L227-L227"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.b9ecbc68549f2ca7159c",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Consider validating that other claims match your expectations by using the `expect_claims` configuration option. Token claims must match exactly the values set here.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure JWT authentication",
        "Validate claims"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/jwt/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "d73972fe9dec8503e08753fa7924c464bebf652b",
        "sha256": "00ebda8f01e575437120e31c92569275e9356e4f56b009a2c9490677dfb94841",
        "lineStart": 229,
        "lineEnd": 230,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/jwt/index.md#L229-L230"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.936535e7cc43f0403bad",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Grafana checks for the presence of a role using the [JMESPath](http://jmespath.org/examples.html) specified via the `role_attribute_path` configuration option. The JMESPath is applied to JWT token claims. The result after evaluation of the `role_attribute_path` JMESPath expression should be a valid Grafana role, for example, `None`, `Viewer`, `Editor` or `Admin`.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure JWT authentication",
        "Roles"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/jwt/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "d73972fe9dec8503e08753fa7924c464bebf652b",
        "sha256": "00ebda8f01e575437120e31c92569275e9356e4f56b009a2c9490677dfb94841",
        "lineStart": 239,
        "lineEnd": 239,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/jwt/index.md#L239-L239"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.fbd70f9cd8978a85923a",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "To assign the role to a specific organization include the `X-Grafana-Org-Id` header along with your JWT when making API requests to Grafana. To learn more about the header, please refer to the [documentation](../../../../developers/http_api/#x-grafana-org-id-header).",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure JWT authentication",
        "Roles"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/jwt/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "d73972fe9dec8503e08753fa7924c464bebf652b",
        "sha256": "00ebda8f01e575437120e31c92569275e9356e4f56b009a2c9490677dfb94841",
        "lineStart": 241,
        "lineEnd": 242,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/jwt/index.md#L241-L242"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.45ecc24b75865ebe9d2a",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Unless `skip_org_role_sync` option is enabled, the user's role will be set to the role retrieved from the JWT.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure JWT authentication",
        "Roles",
        "Configure role mapping"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/jwt/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "d73972fe9dec8503e08753fa7924c464bebf652b",
        "sha256": "00ebda8f01e575437120e31c92569275e9356e4f56b009a2c9490677dfb94841",
        "lineStart": 246,
        "lineEnd": 246,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/jwt/index.md#L246-L246"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.1a5e58f0b079f09cd72a",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "The user's role is retrieved using a [JMESPath](http://jmespath.org/examples.html) expression from the `role_attribute_path` configuration option. To map the server administrator role, use the `allow_assign_grafana_admin` configuration option.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure JWT authentication",
        "Roles",
        "Configure role mapping"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/jwt/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "d73972fe9dec8503e08753fa7924c464bebf652b",
        "sha256": "00ebda8f01e575437120e31c92569275e9356e4f56b009a2c9490677dfb94841",
        "lineStart": 248,
        "lineEnd": 249,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/jwt/index.md#L248-L249"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.1515987e0cd0779cd06f",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "If no valid role is found, the user is assigned the role specified by [the `auto_assign_org_role` option](../../../configure-grafana/#auto_assign_org_role). You can disable this default role assignment by setting `role_attribute_strict = true`. This setting denies user access if no role or an invalid role is returned after evaluating the `role_attribute_path` and the `org_mapping` expressions.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure JWT authentication",
        "Roles",
        "Configure role mapping"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/jwt/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "d73972fe9dec8503e08753fa7924c464bebf652b",
        "sha256": "00ebda8f01e575437120e31c92569275e9356e4f56b009a2c9490677dfb94841",
        "lineStart": 251,
        "lineEnd": 252,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/jwt/index.md#L251-L252"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.3f787869fd1be7d6b100",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "You can use the `org_attribute_path` and `org_mapping` configuration options to assign the user to organizations and specify their role. For more information, refer to [Org roles mapping example](#org-roles-mapping-example). If both org role mapping (`org_mapping`) and the regular role mapping (`role_attribute_path`) are specified, then the user will get the highest of the two mapped roles.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure JWT authentication",
        "Roles",
        "Configure role mapping"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/jwt/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "d73972fe9dec8503e08753fa7924c464bebf652b",
        "sha256": "00ebda8f01e575437120e31c92569275e9356e4f56b009a2c9490677dfb94841",
        "lineStart": 254,
        "lineEnd": 254,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/jwt/index.md#L254-L254"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.574fb3c5ccaa3a05cf58",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "In the following example user will get `Editor` as role when authenticating. The value of the property `role` will be the resulting role if the role is a proper Grafana role, i.e. `None`, `Viewer`, `Editor` or `Admin`.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure JWT authentication",
        "Roles",
        "Configure role mapping"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/jwt/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "d73972fe9dec8503e08753fa7924c464bebf652b",
        "sha256": "00ebda8f01e575437120e31c92569275e9356e4f56b009a2c9490677dfb94841",
        "lineStart": 260,
        "lineEnd": 260,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/jwt/index.md#L260-L260"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.b1ee1a61f8d5e13fba84",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "In the following example user will get `Admin` as role when authenticating since it has a role `admin`. If a user has a role `editor` it will get `Editor` as role, otherwise `Viewer`.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure JWT authentication",
        "Roles",
        "Configure role mapping"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/jwt/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "d73972fe9dec8503e08753fa7924c464bebf652b",
        "sha256": "00ebda8f01e575437120e31c92569275e9356e4f56b009a2c9490677dfb94841",
        "lineStart": 280,
        "lineEnd": 280,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/jwt/index.md#L280-L280"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.e1a1e387fc85508a506f",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "If the `role_attribute_path` property returns a `GrafanaAdmin` role, Grafana Admin is not assigned by default, instead the `Admin` role is assigned. To allow `Grafana Admin` role to be assigned set `allow_assign_grafana_admin = true`.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure JWT authentication",
        "Roles",
        "Grafana Admin Role"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/jwt/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "d73972fe9dec8503e08753fa7924c464bebf652b",
        "sha256": "00ebda8f01e575437120e31c92569275e9356e4f56b009a2c9490677dfb94841",
        "lineStart": 335,
        "lineEnd": 335,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/jwt/index.md#L335-L335"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.fb4cf34fdbe8ed20fa8f",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "To skip the assignment of roles and permissions upon login via JWT and handle them via other mechanisms like the user interface, we can skip the organization role synchronization with the following configuration.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure JWT authentication",
        "Roles",
        "Skip organization role mapping"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/jwt/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "d73972fe9dec8503e08753fa7924c464bebf652b",
        "sha256": "00ebda8f01e575437120e31c92569275e9356e4f56b009a2c9490677dfb94841",
        "lineStart": 339,
        "lineEnd": 339,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/jwt/index.md#L339-L339"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.1f52b221fbed3a0b2668",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "While Grafana offers a variety of authentication providers, you can only configure one provider of one type at a time. However, you can configure multiple providers of the same type with the help of Keycloak.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Multiple providers with Keycloak in Grafana"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/keycloak-multitenant/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "10ec9783df65ff9b89174fae531c35b7db6552b8",
        "sha256": "6e6e24a97df78e4991b7b91450bdb43a26439e8f847047899d1dfb351c70b028",
        "lineStart": 26,
        "lineEnd": 26,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/keycloak-multitenant/index.md#L26-L26"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.d7fb03ab59e3f548de1b",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "This guide explains how to set up multiple providers of the same type with Keycloak as an authentication provider in Grafana.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Multiple providers with Keycloak in Grafana"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/keycloak-multitenant/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "10ec9783df65ff9b89174fae531c35b7db6552b8",
        "sha256": "6e6e24a97df78e4991b7b91450bdb43a26439e8f847047899d1dfb351c70b028",
        "lineStart": 28,
        "lineEnd": 28,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/keycloak-multitenant/index.md#L28-L28"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.2638f53762c2b4577913",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "The idea is to set up multiple OIDC providers in Keycloak with different tenants and configure Grafana to use the same Keycloak instance as the authentication provider.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Multiple providers with Keycloak in Grafana"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/keycloak-multitenant/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "10ec9783df65ff9b89174fae531c35b7db6552b8",
        "sha256": "6e6e24a97df78e4991b7b91450bdb43a26439e8f847047899d1dfb351c70b028",
        "lineStart": 30,
        "lineEnd": 30,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/keycloak-multitenant/index.md#L30-L30"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.1269b61594c1b83a54ef",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "For Entra ID, repeat the following steps for each tenant you want to set up in Keycloak.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Multiple providers with Keycloak in Grafana",
        "Entra ID configuration"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/keycloak-multitenant/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "10ec9783df65ff9b89174fae531c35b7db6552b8",
        "sha256": "6e6e24a97df78e4991b7b91450bdb43a26439e8f847047899d1dfb351c70b028",
        "lineStart": 34,
        "lineEnd": 34,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/keycloak-multitenant/index.md#L34-L34"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.2d3b301dcff621d113a6",
      "syntaxRole": "procedural-step",
      "sourceText": "1. Register your application in Entra ID.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Multiple providers with Keycloak in Grafana",
        "Entra ID configuration",
        "Overview"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/keycloak-multitenant/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "10ec9783df65ff9b89174fae531c35b7db6552b8",
        "sha256": "6e6e24a97df78e4991b7b91450bdb43a26439e8f847047899d1dfb351c70b028",
        "lineStart": 38,
        "lineEnd": 38,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/keycloak-multitenant/index.md#L38-L38"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.113764667a89fac5aef5",
      "syntaxRole": "procedural-step",
      "sourceText": "1. Give access to the application to the users in the tenant.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Multiple providers with Keycloak in Grafana",
        "Entra ID configuration",
        "Overview"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/keycloak-multitenant/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "10ec9783df65ff9b89174fae531c35b7db6552b8",
        "sha256": "6e6e24a97df78e4991b7b91450bdb43a26439e8f847047899d1dfb351c70b028",
        "lineStart": 39,
        "lineEnd": 39,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/keycloak-multitenant/index.md#L39-L39"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.e8a5983497cd1a53b2e5",
      "syntaxRole": "procedural-step",
      "sourceText": "1. Create credentials for the application.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Multiple providers with Keycloak in Grafana",
        "Entra ID configuration",
        "Overview"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/keycloak-multitenant/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "10ec9783df65ff9b89174fae531c35b7db6552b8",
        "sha256": "6e6e24a97df78e4991b7b91450bdb43a26439e8f847047899d1dfb351c70b028",
