      "sourceText": "Keycloak OAuth2 authentication allows users to log in to Grafana using their Keycloak credentials. This guide explains how to set up Keycloak as an authentication provider in Grafana.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure Keycloak OAuth2 authentication"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/keycloak/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "6ce0f7a47b22bee96812516ed041474dd97165a9",
        "sha256": "7b4cab722870807b63fe61bdd9cb6fc32283401c62978edd9d231b6e766dede8",
        "lineStart": 25,
        "lineEnd": 25,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/keycloak/index.md#L25-L25"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.f535e87a6e3ff9e2fd54",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "If you use the same email address in Keycloak as in other authentication providers (such as Grafana.com), you need to do additional configuration to ensure that the users are matched correctly. Please refer to the [Using the same email address to login with different identity providers](../#using-the-same-email-address-to-login-with-different-identity-providers) documentation for more information.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure Keycloak OAuth2 authentication"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/keycloak/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "6ce0f7a47b22bee96812516ed041474dd97165a9",
        "sha256": "7b4cab722870807b63fe61bdd9cb6fc32283401c62978edd9d231b6e766dede8",
        "lineStart": 30,
        "lineEnd": 30,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/keycloak/index.md#L30-L30"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.ae520cfa4e5da4c15dc5",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "You may have to set the `root_url` option of `[server]` for the callback URL to be correct. For example in case you are serving Grafana behind a proxy.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure Keycloak OAuth2 authentication"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/keycloak/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "6ce0f7a47b22bee96812516ed041474dd97165a9",
        "sha256": "7b4cab722870807b63fe61bdd9cb6fc32283401c62978edd9d231b6e766dede8",
        "lineStart": 33,
        "lineEnd": 34,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/keycloak/index.md#L33-L34"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.0058f2902d7b40e190ae",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "As an example, `<PROVIDER_DOMAIN>` can be `keycloak-demo.grafana.org` and `<REALM_NAME>` can be `grafana`.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure Keycloak OAuth2 authentication"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/keycloak/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "6ce0f7a47b22bee96812516ed041474dd97165a9",
        "sha256": "7b4cab722870807b63fe61bdd9cb6fc32283401c62978edd9d231b6e766dede8",
        "lineStart": 55,
        "lineEnd": 56,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/keycloak/index.md#L55-L56"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.34143cf483adc1d252a7",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "To configure the `kc_idp_hint` parameter for Keycloak, you need to change the `auth_url` configuration to include the `kc_idp_hint` parameter. For example if you want to hint the Google identity provider:",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure Keycloak OAuth2 authentication"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/keycloak/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "6ce0f7a47b22bee96812516ed041474dd97165a9",
        "sha256": "7b4cab722870807b63fe61bdd9cb6fc32283401c62978edd9d231b6e766dede8",
        "lineStart": 58,
        "lineEnd": 58,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/keycloak/index.md#L58-L58"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.03d86827beab627798c0",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "api_url is not required if the id_token contains all the necessary user information and can add latency to the login process. It is useful as a fallback or if the user has more than 150 group memberships.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure Keycloak OAuth2 authentication"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/keycloak/index.md",
