    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.71621a9c551426e3e10d",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "These scopes do not add group claims to the `id_token`. Without group claims, teamsync will not work. Teamsync is covered further down in this document.",
