    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.1c0bf2c110abd96fef53",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "To enable Single Logout, you need to add the following option to the configuration of Grafana:",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure Keycloak OAuth2 authentication",
        "Enable Single Logout"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/keycloak/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "6ce0f7a47b22bee96812516ed041474dd97165a9",
        "sha256": "7b4cab722870807b63fe61bdd9cb6fc32283401c62978edd9d231b6e766dede8",
        "lineStart": 148,
        "lineEnd": 148,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/keycloak/index.md#L148-L148"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.cf3e6c1051c1b7f49da6",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "As an example, `<PROVIDER_DOMAIN>` can be `keycloak-demo.grafana.org`, `<REALM_NAME>` can be `grafana` and `<GRAFANA_DOMAIN>` can be `play.grafana.org`.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure Keycloak OAuth2 authentication",
        "Enable Single Logout"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/keycloak/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "6ce0f7a47b22bee96812516ed041474dd97165a9",
        "sha256": "7b4cab722870807b63fe61bdd9cb6fc32283401c62978edd9d231b6e766dede8",
        "lineStart": 155,
        "lineEnd": 156,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/keycloak/index.md#L155-L156"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.aca02f28508bba84761c",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Grafana supports ID token hints for single logout. Grafana automatically adds the `id_token_hint` parameter to the logout request if it detects OAuth as the authentication method.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure Keycloak OAuth2 authentication",
        "Enable Single Logout"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/keycloak/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "6ce0f7a47b22bee96812516ed041474dd97165a9",
        "sha256": "7b4cab722870807b63fe61bdd9cb6fc32283401c62978edd9d231b6e766dede8",
        "lineStart": 159,
        "lineEnd": 159,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/keycloak/index.md#L159-L159"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.9f386d9d30841bdece1b",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "If the application role received by Grafana is `GrafanaAdmin` , Grafana grants the user server administrator privileges.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure Keycloak OAuth2 authentication",
        "Allow assigning Grafana Admin"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/keycloak/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "6ce0f7a47b22bee96812516ed041474dd97165a9",
        "sha256": "7b4cab722870807b63fe61bdd9cb6fc32283401c62978edd9d231b6e766dede8",
        "lineStart": 164,
        "lineEnd": 164,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/keycloak/index.md#L164-L164"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.1dc4d1dcc32603aa1717",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "This is useful if you want to grant server administrator privileges to a subset of users. Grafana also assigns the user the `Admin` role of the default organization.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure Keycloak OAuth2 authentication",
        "Allow assigning Grafana Admin"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/keycloak/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "6ce0f7a47b22bee96812516ed041474dd97165a9",
        "sha256": "7b4cab722870807b63fe61bdd9cb6fc32283401c62978edd9d231b6e766dede8",
        "lineStart": 166,
        "lineEnd": 167,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/keycloak/index.md#L166-L167"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.f0bedad8a8808b540e52",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "When a user logs in using an OAuth provider, Grafana verifies that the access token has not expired. When an access token expires, Grafana uses the provided refresh token (if any exists) to obtain a new access token.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure Keycloak OAuth2 authentication",
        "Allow assigning Grafana Admin",
        "Configure refresh token"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/keycloak/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "6ce0f7a47b22bee96812516ed041474dd97165a9",
        "sha256": "7b4cab722870807b63fe61bdd9cb6fc32283401c62978edd9d231b6e766dede8",
        "lineStart": 176,
        "lineEnd": 176,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/keycloak/index.md#L176-L176"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.6cd08096b4ceead3ca37",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Grafana uses a refresh token to obtain a new access token without requiring the user to log in again. If a refresh token doesn't exist, Grafana logs the user out of the system after the access token has expired.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure Keycloak OAuth2 authentication",
        "Allow assigning Grafana Admin",
        "Configure refresh token"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/keycloak/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "6ce0f7a47b22bee96812516ed041474dd97165a9",
        "sha256": "7b4cab722870807b63fe61bdd9cb6fc32283401c62978edd9d231b6e766dede8",
        "lineStart": 178,
        "lineEnd": 178,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/keycloak/index.md#L178-L178"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.77d35132e025c5836ab2",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "To enable a refresh token for Keycloak, do the following:",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure Keycloak OAuth2 authentication",
        "Allow assigning Grafana Admin",
        "Configure refresh token"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/keycloak/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "6ce0f7a47b22bee96812516ed041474dd97165a9",
        "sha256": "7b4cab722870807b63fe61bdd9cb6fc32283401c62978edd9d231b6e766dede8",
        "lineStart": 180,
        "lineEnd": 180,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/keycloak/index.md#L180-L180"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.eec1b8ed49359bd947a4",
      "syntaxRole": "procedural-step",
      "sourceText": "1. Extend the `scopes` in `[auth.generic_oauth]` with `offline_access`.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure Keycloak OAuth2 authentication",
        "Allow assigning Grafana Admin",
        "Configure refresh token"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/keycloak/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "6ce0f7a47b22bee96812516ed041474dd97165a9",
        "sha256": "7b4cab722870807b63fe61bdd9cb6fc32283401c62978edd9d231b6e766dede8",
