    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.68b5c50da0b3d63d721b",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "If you want to delete all the changes made through the UI and revert to the configuration file settings, click the three dots menu icon and click **Reset to default values**.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure LDAP authentication using the Grafana user interface",
        "Steps to configure LDAP authentication",
        "4. Persisting the configuration"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/ldap-ui/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "2d749dad98e59ace7ff12b4b2ca4591e0358050f",
        "sha256": "fe97a1e1d8dd1f68e5d7fa181134d9b1972f2df61a2a774237a5d5ed0b2e0d6a",
        "lineStart": 122,
        "lineEnd": 122,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/ldap-ui/_index.md#L122-L122"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.a5bf19df99b2c161a333",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "The LDAP integration in Grafana allows your Grafana users to login with their LDAP credentials. You can also specify mappings between LDAP group memberships and Grafana Organization user roles.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure LDAP authentication"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/ldap/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "0a7dd45e5855210e94ce8d5db7a2265b63ba0500",
        "sha256": "0402aaa5dd9cd58e1686eab5c8771ec0d9b52f8b2180bd5cce5d75a5badea3c3",
        "lineStart": 20,
        "lineEnd": 21,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/ldap/index.md#L20-L21"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.172c337b6decc3a66772",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Refer to [Role-based access control](../../../../administration/roles-and-permissions/access-control/) to understand how you can control access with role-based permissions.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure LDAP authentication"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/ldap/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "0a7dd45e5855210e94ce8d5db7a2265b63ba0500",
        "sha256": "0402aaa5dd9cd58e1686eab5c8771ec0d9b52f8b2180bd5cce5d75a5badea3c3",
        "lineStart": 27,
        "lineEnd": 27,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/ldap/index.md#L27-L27"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.a264127b170e098fd24e",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Grafana uses a [third-party LDAP library](https://github.com/go-ldap/ldap) under the hood that supports basic LDAP v3 functionality. This means that you should be able to configure LDAP integration using any compliant LDAPv3 server, for example [OpenLDAP](#openldap) or [Active Directory](#active-directory) among [others](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Directory_service#LDAP_implementations).",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure LDAP authentication",
        "Supported LDAP Servers"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/ldap/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "0a7dd45e5855210e94ce8d5db7a2265b63ba0500",
        "sha256": "0402aaa5dd9cd58e1686eab5c8771ec0d9b52f8b2180bd5cce5d75a5badea3c3",
        "lineStart": 31,
        "lineEnd": 33,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/ldap/index.md#L31-L33"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.ac473069427ab44418ee",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "In order to use LDAP integration you'll first need to enable LDAP in the [main config file](../../../configure-grafana/) as well as specify the path to the LDAP specific configuration file (default: `/etc/grafana/ldap.toml`).",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure LDAP authentication",
        "Enable LDAP"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/ldap/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "0a7dd45e5855210e94ce8d5db7a2265b63ba0500",
        "sha256": "0402aaa5dd9cd58e1686eab5c8771ec0d9b52f8b2180bd5cce5d75a5badea3c3",
        "lineStart": 37,
        "lineEnd": 38,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/ldap/index.md#L37-L38"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.33e33e7aeeff12765409",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "After enabling LDAP, the default behavior is for Grafana users to be created automatically upon successful LDAP authentication. If you prefer for only existing Grafana users to be able to sign in, you can change `allow_sign_up` to `false` in the `[auth.ldap]` section.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure LDAP authentication",
        "Enable LDAP"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/ldap/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "0a7dd45e5855210e94ce8d5db7a2265b63ba0500",
        "sha256": "0402aaa5dd9cd58e1686eab5c8771ec0d9b52f8b2180bd5cce5d75a5badea3c3",
        "lineStart": 40,
        "lineEnd": 40,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/ldap/index.md#L40-L40"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.e41e3436245f9a720df3",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "If you use LDAP to authenticate users but don't use role mapping, and prefer to manually assign organizations and roles, you can use the `skip_org_role_sync` configuration option.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure LDAP authentication",
        "Disable org role synchronization"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/ldap/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "0a7dd45e5855210e94ce8d5db7a2265b63ba0500",
        "sha256": "0402aaa5dd9cd58e1686eab5c8771ec0d9b52f8b2180bd5cce5d75a5badea3c3",
        "lineStart": 57,
        "lineEnd": 58,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/ldap/index.md#L57-L58"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.490146bff2aef743027a",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Whenever you modify the ldap.toml file, you must restart Grafana in order for the change(s) to take effect.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure LDAP authentication",
        "Grafana LDAP Configuration"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/ldap/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "0a7dd45e5855210e94ce8d5db7a2265b63ba0500",
