    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.de495cf9e810ee48f466",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "You can configure LDAP using the Grafana user interface by navigating to **Administration > Authentication > LDAP**. Please refer to the [LDAP user interface](../ldap-ui/) documentation for more information.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure LDAP authentication",
        "Grafana LDAP Configuration",
        "Using the Grafana user interface"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/ldap/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "0a7dd45e5855210e94ce8d5db7a2265b63ba0500",
        "sha256": "0402aaa5dd9cd58e1686eab5c8771ec0d9b52f8b2180bd5cce5d75a5badea3c3",
        "lineStart": 141,
        "lineEnd": 141,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/ldap/index.md#L141-L141"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.0108e330606b72214d90",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "You can interpolate variables in the TOML configuration from environment variables. For instance, you could externalize your `bind_password` that way:",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure LDAP authentication",
        "Grafana LDAP Configuration",
        "Using environment variables"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/ldap/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "0a7dd45e5855210e94ce8d5db7a2265b63ba0500",
        "sha256": "0402aaa5dd9cd58e1686eab5c8771ec0d9b52f8b2180bd5cce5d75a5badea3c3",
        "lineStart": 145,
        "lineEnd": 145,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/ldap/index.md#L145-L145"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.488dda98a115c5601863",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "By default the configuration expects you to specify a bind DN and bind password. This should be a read only user that can perform LDAP searches. When the user DN is found a second bind is performed with the user provided username and password (in the normal Grafana login form).",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure LDAP authentication",
        "Grafana LDAP Configuration",
        "Bind and bind password"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/ldap/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "0a7dd45e5855210e94ce8d5db7a2265b63ba0500",
        "sha256": "0402aaa5dd9cd58e1686eab5c8771ec0d9b52f8b2180bd5cce5d75a5badea3c3",
        "lineStart": 153,
        "lineEnd": 154,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/ldap/index.md#L153-L154"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.53b6e5a274a928d596ce",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "If you can provide a single bind expression that matches all possible users, you can skip the second bind and bind against the user DN directly. This allows you to not specify a bind_password in the configuration file.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure LDAP authentication",
        "Grafana LDAP Configuration",
        "Bind and bind password",
        "Single bind example"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/ldap/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "0a7dd45e5855210e94ce8d5db7a2265b63ba0500",
        "sha256": "0402aaa5dd9cd58e1686eab5c8771ec0d9b52f8b2180bd5cce5d75a5badea3c3",
        "lineStart": 163,
        "lineEnd": 164,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/ldap/index.md#L163-L164"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.8b44d6587de007cb7e7a",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "In this case you skip providing a `bind_password` and instead provide a `bind_dn` value with a `%s` somewhere. This will be replaced with the username entered in on the Grafana login page. The search filter and search bases settings are still needed to perform the LDAP search to retrieve the other LDAP information (like LDAP groups and email).",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure LDAP authentication",
        "Grafana LDAP Configuration",
        "Bind and bind password",
        "Single bind example"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/ldap/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "0a7dd45e5855210e94ce8d5db7a2265b63ba0500",
        "sha256": "0402aaa5dd9cd58e1686eab5c8771ec0d9b52f8b2180bd5cce5d75a5badea3c3",
        "lineStart": 170,
        "lineEnd": 171,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/ldap/index.md#L170-L171"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.09506566e115819987cb",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "If your LDAP server does not support the `memberOf` attribute, add the following options:",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure LDAP authentication",
        "Grafana LDAP Configuration",
        "POSIX schema"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/ldap/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "0a7dd45e5855210e94ce8d5db7a2265b63ba0500",
        "sha256": "0402aaa5dd9cd58e1686eab5c8771ec0d9b52f8b2180bd5cce5d75a5badea3c3",
        "lineStart": 175,
        "lineEnd": 175,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/ldap/index.md#L175-L175"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.eca1dbc08d2982605d1c",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "In `[[servers.group_mappings]]` you can map an LDAP group to a Grafana organization and role. These will be synced every time the user logs in, with LDAP being the authoritative source.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure LDAP authentication",
        "Grafana LDAP Configuration",
        "Group mappings"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/ldap/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "0a7dd45e5855210e94ce8d5db7a2265b63ba0500",
        "sha256": "0402aaa5dd9cd58e1686eab5c8771ec0d9b52f8b2180bd5cce5d75a5badea3c3",
        "lineStart": 188,
        "lineEnd": 188,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/ldap/index.md#L188-L188"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.d4d3435a48321c97a80e",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "The first group mapping that an LDAP user is matched to will be used for the sync. If you have LDAP users that fit multiple mappings, the topmost mapping in the TOML configuration will be used.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure LDAP authentication",
        "Grafana LDAP Configuration",
        "Group mappings"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/ldap/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "0a7dd45e5855210e94ce8d5db7a2265b63ba0500",
        "sha256": "0402aaa5dd9cd58e1686eab5c8771ec0d9b52f8b2180bd5cce5d75a5badea3c3",
        "lineStart": 190,
        "lineEnd": 190,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/ldap/index.md#L190-L190"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.1e9b001924a265fdd645",
      "syntaxRole": "table-row",
      "sourceText": "| Setting         | Required | Description                                                                                                                                           | Default              |",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure LDAP authentication",
        "Grafana LDAP Configuration",
        "Group mappings"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/ldap/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "0a7dd45e5855210e94ce8d5db7a2265b63ba0500",
        "sha256": "0402aaa5dd9cd58e1686eab5c8771ec0d9b52f8b2180bd5cce5d75a5badea3c3",
        "lineStart": 216,
        "lineEnd": 216,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/ldap/index.md#L216-L216"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.d04bc0d23b804253b264",
      "syntaxRole": "table-row",
      "sourceText": "| `group_dn`      | Yes      | LDAP distinguished name (DN) of LDAP group. If you want to match all (or no LDAP groups) then you can use wildcard (`\"*\"`)                            |",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure LDAP authentication",
        "Grafana LDAP Configuration",
        "Group mappings"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/ldap/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "0a7dd45e5855210e94ce8d5db7a2265b63ba0500",
        "sha256": "0402aaa5dd9cd58e1686eab5c8771ec0d9b52f8b2180bd5cce5d75a5badea3c3",
        "lineStart": 218,
        "lineEnd": 218,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/ldap/index.md#L218-L218"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.2ef8646bfeada1304508",
      "syntaxRole": "table-row",
      "sourceText": "| `org_role`      | Yes      | Assign users of `group_dn` the organization role `Admin`, `Editor`, or `Viewer`. The organization role name is case sensitive.                        |",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure LDAP authentication",
        "Grafana LDAP Configuration",
        "Group mappings"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/ldap/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "0a7dd45e5855210e94ce8d5db7a2265b63ba0500",
        "sha256": "0402aaa5dd9cd58e1686eab5c8771ec0d9b52f8b2180bd5cce5d75a5badea3c3",
        "lineStart": 219,
        "lineEnd": 219,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/ldap/index.md#L219-L219"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.6723ece543bde7c0aa9b",
      "syntaxRole": "table-row",
      "sourceText": "| `org_id`        | No       | The Grafana organization database id. Setting this allows for multiple group_dn's to be assigned to the same `org_role` provided the `org_id` differs | `1` (default org id) |",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure LDAP authentication",
        "Grafana LDAP Configuration",
        "Group mappings"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/ldap/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "0a7dd45e5855210e94ce8d5db7a2265b63ba0500",
        "sha256": "0402aaa5dd9cd58e1686eab5c8771ec0d9b52f8b2180bd5cce5d75a5badea3c3",
        "lineStart": 220,
        "lineEnd": 220,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/ldap/index.md#L220-L220"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.b82121790b34f998773b",
      "syntaxRole": "table-row",
      "sourceText": "| `grafana_admin` | No       | When `true` makes user of `group_dn` Grafana server admin. A Grafana server admin has admin access over all organizations and users.                  | `false`              |",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure LDAP authentication",
        "Grafana LDAP Configuration",
        "Group mappings"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/ldap/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "0a7dd45e5855210e94ce8d5db7a2265b63ba0500",
        "sha256": "0402aaa5dd9cd58e1686eab5c8771ec0d9b52f8b2180bd5cce5d75a5badea3c3",
        "lineStart": 221,
        "lineEnd": 221,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/ldap/index.md#L221-L221"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.90baba2c99252ed4869e",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Commenting out a group mapping requires also commenting out the header of said group or it will fail validation as an empty mapping.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure LDAP authentication",
        "Grafana LDAP Configuration",
        "Group mappings"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/ldap/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "0a7dd45e5855210e94ce8d5db7a2265b63ba0500",
        "sha256": "0402aaa5dd9cd58e1686eab5c8771ec0d9b52f8b2180bd5cce5d75a5badea3c3",
        "lineStart": 224,
        "lineEnd": 225,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/ldap/index.md#L224-L225"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.1c0a142ebe0a6acb9579",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Users with nested/recursive group membership must have an LDAP server that supports `LDAP_MATCHING_RULE_IN_CHAIN` and configure `group_search_filter` in a way that it returns the groups the submitted username is a member of.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure LDAP authentication",
        "Grafana LDAP Configuration",
        "Nested/recursive group membership"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/ldap/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "0a7dd45e5855210e94ce8d5db7a2265b63ba0500",
        "sha256": "0402aaa5dd9cd58e1686eab5c8771ec0d9b52f8b2180bd5cce5d75a5badea3c3",
        "lineStart": 250,
        "lineEnd": 251,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/ldap/index.md#L250-L251"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.8044e4954d2d6351fe41",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "To configure `group_search_filter`:",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure LDAP authentication",
        "Grafana LDAP Configuration",
        "Nested/recursive group membership"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/ldap/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "0a7dd45e5855210e94ce8d5db7a2265b63ba0500",
