    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.cc66752e59169dadccdb",
      "syntaxRole": "procedural-step",
      "sourceText": "1. Update the Okta integration by setting the `Role attribute path` (`role_attribute_path` in Terraform and config file) to `<YOUR_ROLE_VARIABLE>`. For example: `role_attribute_path = grafana_role` (using the configuration).",
