    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.72c02f34a7367e828ec1",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "As a Grafana Admin, you can configure Okta OAuth2 client from within Grafana using the Okta UI. To do this, navigate to **Administration > Authentication > Okta** page and fill in the form. If you have a current configuration in the Grafana configuration file then the form will be pre-populated with those values otherwise the form will contain default values.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure Okta OIDC authentication",
        "Configure Okta authentication client using the Grafana UI"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/okta/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "4de8751f865ff55ac58451811f4eafc681a66671",
        "sha256": "fe422737ef152e83e92f9b6cbc00fc7578d6b44c697ed6a6486447f716916c6d",
        "lineStart": 104,
        "lineEnd": 104,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/okta/index.md#L104-L104"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.e61209105582e6d14837",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "After you have filled in the form, click **Save**. If the save was successful, Grafana will apply the new configurations.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure Okta OIDC authentication",
        "Configure Okta authentication client using the Grafana UI"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/okta/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "4de8751f865ff55ac58451811f4eafc681a66671",
        "sha256": "fe422737ef152e83e92f9b6cbc00fc7578d6b44c697ed6a6486447f716916c6d",
        "lineStart": 106,
        "lineEnd": 106,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/okta/index.md#L106-L106"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.b179eecfd888cada16b8",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "If you need to reset changes you made in the UI back to the default values, click **Reset**. After you have reset the changes, Grafana will apply the configuration from the Grafana configuration file (if there is any configuration) or the default values.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure Okta OIDC authentication",
        "Configure Okta authentication client using the Grafana UI"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/okta/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "4de8751f865ff55ac58451811f4eafc681a66671",
        "sha256": "fe422737ef152e83e92f9b6cbc00fc7578d6b44c697ed6a6486447f716916c6d",
        "lineStart": 108,
        "lineEnd": 108,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/okta/index.md#L108-L108"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.9da4a704cdf10c754b45",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "If you run Grafana in high availability mode, configuration changes may not get applied to all Grafana instances immediately. You may need to wait a few minutes for the configuration to propagate to all Grafana instances.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure Okta OIDC authentication",
        "Configure Okta authentication client using the Grafana UI"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/okta/index.md",
