      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.e6c03164ebcdf41d649f",
      "syntaxRole": "procedural-step",
      "sourceText": "1. Set `validate_id_token` to `true` in the `[auth.okta]` section of the Grafana configuration file.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure Okta OIDC authentication",
        "Configure Okta authentication client using the Grafana configuration file",
        "Configure JWT ID token validation"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/okta/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "4de8751f865ff55ac58451811f4eafc681a66671",
        "sha256": "fe422737ef152e83e92f9b6cbc00fc7578d6b44c697ed6a6486447f716916c6d",
        "lineStart": 207,
        "lineEnd": 207,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/okta/index.md#L207-L207"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.8f8d6667cdf8bacd554a",
      "syntaxRole": "procedural-step",
      "sourceText": "2. Configure `jwk_set_url` with the URL of your Okta tenant's JSON Web Key Set (JWKS) endpoint. This endpoint provides the public keys used to verify JWT signatures.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure Okta OIDC authentication",
        "Configure Okta authentication client using the Grafana configuration file",
        "Configure JWT ID token validation"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/okta/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "4de8751f865ff55ac58451811f4eafc681a66671",
        "sha256": "fe422737ef152e83e92f9b6cbc00fc7578d6b44c697ed6a6486447f716916c6d",
        "lineStart": 208,
        "lineEnd": 208,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/okta/index.md#L208-L208"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.132fe0dad10b9d550319",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "When JWT validation is enabled, Grafana caches the JWKS keys to improve performance. The cache respects the `Cache-Control` header from the JWKS endpoint response. If no cache expiration is specified, keys are cached for 5 minutes by default.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure Okta OIDC authentication",
        "Configure Okta authentication client using the Grafana configuration file",
        "Configure JWT ID token validation"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/okta/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "4de8751f865ff55ac58451811f4eafc681a66671",
        "sha256": "fe422737ef152e83e92f9b6cbc00fc7578d6b44c697ed6a6486447f716916c6d",
        "lineStart": 225,
        "lineEnd": 225,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/okta/index.md#L225-L225"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.c796ac9b9aedc06152de",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "If `validate_id_token` is set to `true`, you must configure `jwk_set_url`. Authentication will fail if the JWK Set URL is not provided or if the ID token signature cannot be verified.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure Okta OIDC authentication",
        "Configure Okta authentication client using the Grafana configuration file",
        "Configure JWT ID token validation"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/okta/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "4de8751f865ff55ac58451811f4eafc681a66671",
        "sha256": "fe422737ef152e83e92f9b6cbc00fc7578d6b44c697ed6a6486447f716916c6d",
        "lineStart": 229,
        "lineEnd": 229,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/okta/index.md#L229-L229"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.65413b2b00e8c6edcce2",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Unless `skip_org_role_sync` option is enabled, the user's role will be set to the role retrieved from the auth provider upon user login.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure Okta OIDC authentication",
        "Configure Okta authentication client using the Grafana configuration file",
        "Configure role mapping"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/okta/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "4de8751f865ff55ac58451811f4eafc681a66671",
        "sha256": "fe422737ef152e83e92f9b6cbc00fc7578d6b44c697ed6a6486447f716916c6d",
        "lineStart": 235,
        "lineEnd": 235,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/okta/index.md#L235-L235"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.7977f35e0230ee199aad",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "If no valid role is found, the user is assigned the role specified by [the `auto_assign_org_role` option](../../../configure-grafana/#auto_assign_org_role). You can disable this default role assignment by setting `role_attribute_strict = true`. This setting denies user access if no role or an invalid role is returned after evaluating the `role_attribute_path` and the `org_mapping` expressions.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure Okta OIDC authentication",
        "Configure Okta authentication client using the Grafana configuration file",
        "Configure role mapping"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/okta/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "4de8751f865ff55ac58451811f4eafc681a66671",
        "sha256": "fe422737ef152e83e92f9b6cbc00fc7578d6b44c697ed6a6486447f716916c6d",
        "lineStart": 240,
        "lineEnd": 241,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/okta/index.md#L240-L241"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.b0891c5512b5d75ee775",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "You can use the `org_attribute_path` and `org_mapping` configuration options to assign the user to organizations and specify their role. For more information, refer to [Org roles mapping example](#org-roles-mapping-example). If both org role mapping (`org_mapping`) and the regular role mapping (`role_attribute_path`) are specified, then the user will get the highest of the two mapped roles.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure Okta OIDC authentication",
        "Configure Okta authentication client using the Grafana configuration file",
        "Configure role mapping"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/okta/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "4de8751f865ff55ac58451811f4eafc681a66671",
        "sha256": "fe422737ef152e83e92f9b6cbc00fc7578d6b44c697ed6a6486447f716916c6d",
        "lineStart": 243,
        "lineEnd": 243,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/okta/index.md#L243-L243"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.05c92dc4be20821d16db",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "To allow mapping Grafana server administrator role, use the `allow_assign_grafana_admin` configuration option. Refer to [configuration options](../generic-oauth/#configuration-options) for more information.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure Okta OIDC authentication",
        "Configure Okta authentication client using the Grafana configuration file",
        "Configure role mapping"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/okta/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "4de8751f865ff55ac58451811f4eafc681a66671",
        "sha256": "fe422737ef152e83e92f9b6cbc00fc7578d6b44c697ed6a6486447f716916c6d",
        "lineStart": 245,
        "lineEnd": 246,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/okta/index.md#L245-L246"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.efc9250015dbd6d5d1c9",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "In [Create an Okta app](#create-an-okta-app), you created a custom attribute in Okta to store the role. You can use this attribute to map the role to a Grafana role by setting the `role_attribute_path` configuration option to the custom attribute name: `role_attribute_path = grafana_role`.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure Okta OIDC authentication",
        "Configure Okta authentication client using the Grafana configuration file",
        "Configure role mapping"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/okta/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "4de8751f865ff55ac58451811f4eafc681a66671",
        "sha256": "fe422737ef152e83e92f9b6cbc00fc7578d6b44c697ed6a6486447f716916c6d",
        "lineStart": 248,
        "lineEnd": 248,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/okta/index.md#L248-L248"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.efcfcf6b4eb2eb69bde3",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "If you want to map the role based on the user's group, you can use the `groups` attribute from the user info endpoint. An example of this is `role_attribute_path = contains(groups[*], 'Example::DevOps') && 'Admin' || 'None'`. You can find more examples of JMESPath expressions on the Generic OAuth page for [JMESPath examples](../generic-oauth/#role-mapping-examples).",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure Okta OIDC authentication",
        "Configure Okta authentication client using the Grafana configuration file",
        "Configure role mapping"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/okta/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "4de8751f865ff55ac58451811f4eafc681a66671",
        "sha256": "fe422737ef152e83e92f9b6cbc00fc7578d6b44c697ed6a6486447f716916c6d",
        "lineStart": 250,
        "lineEnd": 250,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/okta/index.md#L250-L250"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.befbc9baf8846a61865f",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "To learn about adding custom claims to the user info in Okta, refer to [add custom claims](https://developer.okta.com/docs/guides/customize-tokens-returned-from-okta/main/#add-a-custom-claim-to-a-token).",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure Okta OIDC authentication",
        "Configure Okta authentication client using the Grafana configuration file",
        "Configure role mapping"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/okta/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "4de8751f865ff55ac58451811f4eafc681a66671",
        "sha256": "fe422737ef152e83e92f9b6cbc00fc7578d6b44c697ed6a6486447f716916c6d",
        "lineStart": 252,
        "lineEnd": 252,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/okta/index.md#L252-L252"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.dcab94fc375ebcdd26a0",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "In this example, the `org_mapping` uses the `groups` attribute as the source (`org_attribute_path`) to map the current user to different organizations and roles. The user has been granted the role of a `Viewer` in the `org_foo` org if they are a member of the `Group 1` group, the role of an `Editor` in the `org_bar` org if they are a member of the `Group 2` group, and the role of an `Editor` in the `org_baz`(OrgID=3) org.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure Okta OIDC authentication",
        "Configure Okta authentication client using the Grafana configuration file",
        "Configure role mapping",
        "Org roles mapping example"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/okta/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "4de8751f865ff55ac58451811f4eafc681a66671",
        "sha256": "fe422737ef152e83e92f9b6cbc00fc7578d6b44c697ed6a6486447f716916c6d",
        "lineStart": 260,
        "lineEnd": 260,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/okta/index.md#L260-L260"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.cbea4d90133b65ff2def",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "By using Team Sync, you can link your Okta groups to teams within Grafana. This will automatically assign users to the appropriate teams.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure Okta OIDC authentication",
        "Configure Okta authentication client using the Grafana configuration file",
        "Configure team synchronization"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/okta/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "4de8751f865ff55ac58451811f4eafc681a66671",
        "sha256": "fe422737ef152e83e92f9b6cbc00fc7578d6b44c697ed6a6486447f716916c6d",
        "lineStart": 275,
        "lineEnd": 275,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/okta/index.md#L275-L275"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.81f8e3782ed2b78b736e",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Map your Okta groups to teams in Grafana so that your users will automatically be added to the correct teams.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure Okta OIDC authentication",
        "Configure Okta authentication client using the Grafana configuration file",
        "Configure team synchronization"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/okta/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "4de8751f865ff55ac58451811f4eafc681a66671",
        "sha256": "fe422737ef152e83e92f9b6cbc00fc7578d6b44c697ed6a6486447f716916c6d",
        "lineStart": 277,
        "lineEnd": 278,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/okta/index.md#L277-L278"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.3eebc6a1947e350f83ad",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Okta groups can be referenced by group names, like `Admins` or `Editors`.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure Okta OIDC authentication",
        "Configure Okta authentication client using the Grafana configuration file",
        "Configure team synchronization"
      ],
      "source": {
