    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.092defcca554182274a9",
      "syntaxRole": "table-row",
      "sourceText": "| `use_pkce`               | No       | Yes                | Set to `true` to use [Proof Key for Code Exchange (PKCE)](https://datatracker.ietf.org/doc/html/rfc7636). Grafana uses the SHA256 based `S256` challenge method and a 128 bytes (base64url encoded) code verifier.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                  | `true`                        |",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure Okta OIDC authentication",
        "Configuration options"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/okta/index.md",
