    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.89aa43c77b9bd44f6cff",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "The SAML authentication integration allows your Grafana users to log in by using an external SAML 2.0 Identity Provider (IdP). To enable this, Grafana becomes a Service Provider (SP) in the authentication flow, interacting with the IdP to exchange user information.",
      "headingPath": [
        "SAML authentication in Grafana"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/saml/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "0404f252186b683cd8a612ddaa68e1834993fdf3",
        "sha256": "2afa4049b36a250abb3e57bac54b2c765fb533f7863199ae4c2812735fe3dc61",
        "lineStart": 29,
        "lineEnd": 29,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/saml/_index.md#L29-L29"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "excluded-by-explicit-document-products",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.67a159015c8b33f9ac73",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "You can configure SAML authentication in Grafana with different methods. While the configuration options don't change, if you want to keep all of Grafana authentication settings in one place, use the Grafana configuration file or the Terraform provider. If you're a Grafana Cloud user, you don't have access to Grafana configuration file. Instead, configure SAML through the other methods.",
      "headingPath": [
        "SAML authentication in Grafana",
        "Set up options for SAML authentication in Grafana"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/saml/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "0404f252186b683cd8a612ddaa68e1834993fdf3",
        "sha256": "2afa4049b36a250abb3e57bac54b2c765fb533f7863199ae4c2812735fe3dc61",
        "lineStart": 33,
        "lineEnd": 33,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/saml/_index.md#L33-L33"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "excluded-by-explicit-document-products",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.9953803b584693b23801",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Configuration in the API or UI takes precedence over the configuration in the Grafana configuration file. SAML settings from the API will override any SAML configuration set in the Grafana configuration file.",
      "headingPath": [
        "SAML authentication in Grafana",
        "Set up options for SAML authentication in Grafana"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/saml/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "0404f252186b683cd8a612ddaa68e1834993fdf3",
        "sha256": "2afa4049b36a250abb3e57bac54b2c765fb533f7863199ae4c2812735fe3dc61",
        "lineStart": 36,
        "lineEnd": 36,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/saml/_index.md#L36-L36"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "excluded-by-explicit-document-products",
        "products": [
