      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.fe76f9b508238725f972",
      "syntaxRole": "list-item",
      "sourceText": "- Without a suffix `idp_metadata`, Grafana assumes base64-encoded XML file contents.",
      "headingPath": [
        "SAML authentication in Grafana",
        "Identity provider (IdP) registration",
        "IdP metadata"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/saml/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "0404f252186b683cd8a612ddaa68e1834993fdf3",
        "sha256": "2afa4049b36a250abb3e57bac54b2c765fb533f7863199ae4c2812735fe3dc61",
        "lineStart": 89,
        "lineEnd": 89,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/saml/_index.md#L89-L89"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "excluded-by-explicit-document-products",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.70eafb14610245c2cd73",
      "syntaxRole": "list-item",
      "sourceText": "- With the `_path` suffix, Grafana assumes a path and attempts to read the file from the file system.",
      "headingPath": [
        "SAML authentication in Grafana",
        "Identity provider (IdP) registration",
        "IdP metadata"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/saml/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "0404f252186b683cd8a612ddaa68e1834993fdf3",
        "sha256": "2afa4049b36a250abb3e57bac54b2c765fb533f7863199ae4c2812735fe3dc61",
        "lineStart": 90,
        "lineEnd": 90,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/saml/_index.md#L90-L90"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "excluded-by-explicit-document-products",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.eb4b1382a55fffe94ec2",
      "syntaxRole": "list-item",
      "sourceText": "- With the `_url` suffix, Grafana assumes a URL and attempts to load the metadata from the given location.",
      "headingPath": [
        "SAML authentication in Grafana",
        "Identity provider (IdP) registration",
        "IdP metadata"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/saml/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "0404f252186b683cd8a612ddaa68e1834993fdf3",
        "sha256": "2afa4049b36a250abb3e57bac54b2c765fb533f7863199ae4c2812735fe3dc61",
        "lineStart": 91,
        "lineEnd": 91,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/saml/_index.md#L91-L91"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "excluded-by-explicit-document-products",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.139cd51475a9c7d8e83f",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "During the SAML SSO authentication flow, Grafana receives the ACS callback. The callback contains all the relevant information of the user under authentication embedded in the SAML response. Grafana parses the response to create (or update) the user within its internal database.",
      "headingPath": [
        "SAML authentication in Grafana",
        "Assertion mapping"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/saml/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "0404f252186b683cd8a612ddaa68e1834993fdf3",
        "sha256": "2afa4049b36a250abb3e57bac54b2c765fb533f7863199ae4c2812735fe3dc61",
        "lineStart": 95,
        "lineEnd": 95,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/saml/_index.md#L95-L95"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "excluded-by-explicit-document-products",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.baef017a0de2bea98ad1",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "For Grafana to map the user information, it looks at the individual attributes within the assertion. You can think of these attributes as Key/Value pairs (although, they contain more information than that).",
      "headingPath": [
        "SAML authentication in Grafana",
        "Assertion mapping"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/saml/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "0404f252186b683cd8a612ddaa68e1834993fdf3",
        "sha256": "2afa4049b36a250abb3e57bac54b2c765fb533f7863199ae4c2812735fe3dc61",
        "lineStart": 97,
        "lineEnd": 97,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/saml/_index.md#L97-L97"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "excluded-by-explicit-document-products",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.bbcbb137ab2088afb18a",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Grafana provides configuration options that let you modify which keys to look at for these values. The data we need to create the user in Grafana is Name, Login handle, and email.",
      "headingPath": [
        "SAML authentication in Grafana",
        "Assertion mapping"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/saml/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "0404f252186b683cd8a612ddaa68e1834993fdf3",
        "sha256": "2afa4049b36a250abb3e57bac54b2c765fb533f7863199ae4c2812735fe3dc61",
        "lineStart": 99,
        "lineEnd": 99,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/saml/_index.md#L99-L99"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "excluded-by-explicit-document-products",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.6b1ccdf4e4c9da25fcad",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "If you're also using SCIM provisioning for this Grafana application in Entra ID, it's crucial to align the user identifiers between SAML and SCIM for seamless operation. The unique identifier that links the SAML user to the SCIM provisioned user is determined by the `assertion_attribute_external_uid` setting in the Grafana SAML configuration. This `assertion_attribute_external_uid` should correspond to the `externalId` used in SCIM provisioning (typically set to the Entra ID `user.objectid`).",
      "headingPath": [
        "SAML authentication in Grafana",
        "Integrate with SCIM Provisioning"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/saml/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "0404f252186b683cd8a612ddaa68e1834993fdf3",
        "sha256": "2afa4049b36a250abb3e57bac54b2c765fb533f7863199ae4c2812735fe3dc61",
        "lineStart": 103,
        "lineEnd": 103,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/saml/_index.md#L103-L103"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "excluded-by-explicit-document-products",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.906b72f1dfc8bafd5e2f",
      "syntaxRole": "procedural-step",
      "sourceText": "1.  **Ensure Consistent Identifier in SAML Assertion:**",
      "headingPath": [
        "SAML authentication in Grafana",
        "Integrate with SCIM Provisioning"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/saml/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "0404f252186b683cd8a612ddaa68e1834993fdf3",
        "sha256": "2afa4049b36a250abb3e57bac54b2c765fb533f7863199ae4c2812735fe3dc61",
        "lineStart": 105,
        "lineEnd": 105,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/saml/_index.md#L105-L105"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "excluded-by-explicit-document-products",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.af890cf62868c14000e0",
      "syntaxRole": "list-item",
      "sourceText": "- The unique identifier from Entra ID (typically `user.objectid`) that you mapped to the `externalId` attribute in Grafana in your SCIM provisioning setup **must also be sent as a claim in the SAML assertion.** For more details on SCIM, refer to the [SCIM provisioning documentation](https://www.grafana.com/docs/grafana/<GRAFANA_VERSION>/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-scim-provisioning/).",
      "headingPath": [
        "SAML authentication in Grafana",
        "Integrate with SCIM Provisioning"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/saml/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "0404f252186b683cd8a612ddaa68e1834993fdf3",
        "sha256": "2afa4049b36a250abb3e57bac54b2c765fb533f7863199ae4c2812735fe3dc61",
        "lineStart": 106,
        "lineEnd": 106,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/saml/_index.md#L106-L106"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "excluded-by-explicit-document-products",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.7492028dfcc5ea616369",
      "syntaxRole": "list-item",
      "sourceText": "- In the Entra ID Enterprise Application, under **Single sign-on** > **Attributes & Claims**, ensure you add a claim that provides this identifier. For example, you might add a claim named `UserID` (or similar, like `externalId`) that sources its value from `user.objectid`.",
      "headingPath": [
        "SAML authentication in Grafana",
        "Integrate with SCIM Provisioning"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/saml/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "0404f252186b683cd8a612ddaa68e1834993fdf3",
        "sha256": "2afa4049b36a250abb3e57bac54b2c765fb533f7863199ae4c2812735fe3dc61",
        "lineStart": 107,
        "lineEnd": 107,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/saml/_index.md#L107-L107"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "excluded-by-explicit-document-products",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.4063bad5f3edbe5dec76",
      "syntaxRole": "procedural-step",
      "sourceText": "2.  **Configure Grafana SAML Settings for SCIM:**",
      "headingPath": [
        "SAML authentication in Grafana",
        "Integrate with SCIM Provisioning"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/saml/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "0404f252186b683cd8a612ddaa68e1834993fdf3",
        "sha256": "2afa4049b36a250abb3e57bac54b2c765fb533f7863199ae4c2812735fe3dc61",
        "lineStart": 109,
        "lineEnd": 109,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/saml/_index.md#L109-L109"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "excluded-by-explicit-document-products",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.72cba9ef65f6faee813a",
      "syntaxRole": "list-item",
      "sourceText": "- In the `[auth.saml]` section of your Grafana configuration, set `assertion_attribute_external_uid` to the name of the SAML claim you configured in the previous step (e.g., `userUID` or the full URI like `http://schemas.microsoft.com/identity/claims/objectidentifier` if that's how Entra ID sends it).",
      "headingPath": [
        "SAML authentication in Grafana",
        "Integrate with SCIM Provisioning"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/saml/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "0404f252186b683cd8a612ddaa68e1834993fdf3",
        "sha256": "2afa4049b36a250abb3e57bac54b2c765fb533f7863199ae4c2812735fe3dc61",
        "lineStart": 110,
        "lineEnd": 110,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/saml/_index.md#L110-L110"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "excluded-by-explicit-document-products",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.274e9f2515d87db7bb48",
      "syntaxRole": "list-item",
      "sourceText": "- The `assertion_attribute_login` setting should still be configured to map to the attribute your users will log in with (e.g., `userPrincipalName`, `mail`).",
      "headingPath": [
        "SAML authentication in Grafana",
        "Integrate with SCIM Provisioning"
      ],
      "source": {
