      "id": "grafana.candidate.3211202a693f80b18d80",
      "syntaxRole": "list-item",
      "sourceText": "- By default (if `assertion_attribute_external_uid` is not set), Grafana uses the `userUID` attribute from the SAML assertion for SCIM linking.",
