    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.df90653165864492ef3c",
      "syntaxRole": "list-item",
      "sourceText": "- **Recommended for Entra ID:** For SCIM integration with Entra ID, it is necessary to:",
      "headingPath": [
        "SAML authentication in Grafana",
        "Integrate with SCIM Provisioning"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/saml/_index.md",
