    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.5727807f96a5a92e2a46",
      "syntaxRole": "procedural-step",
      "sourceText": "2.  Either set this claim name in Entra ID to `userUID`, or, if you want to use a different claim name, set `assertion_attribute_external_uid` in Grafana to match the claim name you chose in Entra ID.",
