    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.3d08621ae898a58554e9",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Organization mapping allows you to assign users to a particular organization in Grafana depending on attribute value obtained from the identity provider.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure organization mapping for SAML"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/saml/configure-saml-org-mapping/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "fc1ed69f1b859012b866eacc9fc8b185164e7554",
        "sha256": "d5b6f892b4571a76b2d5ae9fb5522ce2d9a50c392caa5bb216676bea5867fa42",
        "lineStart": 17,
        "lineEnd": 17,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/saml/configure-saml-org-mapping/_index.md#L17-L17"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "excluded-by-explicit-document-products",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.1484b9d9a3fc1c1b3c9a",
      "syntaxRole": "procedural-step",
      "sourceText": "1. In configuration file, set [`assertion_attribute_org`](https://grafana.com/docs/grafana/<GRAFANA_VERSION>/setup-grafana/configure-grafana/enterprise-configuration/#assertion_attribute_org) to the attribute name you store organization info in. This attribute can be an array if you want a user to be in multiple organizations.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure organization mapping for SAML"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/saml/configure-saml-org-mapping/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "fc1ed69f1b859012b866eacc9fc8b185164e7554",
        "sha256": "d5b6f892b4571a76b2d5ae9fb5522ce2d9a50c392caa5bb216676bea5867fa42",
        "lineStart": 19,
        "lineEnd": 19,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/saml/configure-saml-org-mapping/_index.md#L19-L19"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "excluded-by-explicit-document-products",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.9464306d07e86d716dcb",
      "syntaxRole": "procedural-step",
      "sourceText": "1. Set [`org_mapping`](https://grafana.com/docs/grafana/<GRAFANA_VERSION>/setup-grafana/configure-grafana/enterprise-configuration/#org_mapping) option to the comma-separated list of `Organization:OrgId` pairs to map organization from IdP to Grafana organization specified by ID. If you want users to have different roles in multiple organizations, you can set this option to a comma-separated list of `Organization:OrgId:Role` mappings.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure organization mapping for SAML"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/saml/configure-saml-org-mapping/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "fc1ed69f1b859012b866eacc9fc8b185164e7554",
        "sha256": "d5b6f892b4571a76b2d5ae9fb5522ce2d9a50c392caa5bb216676bea5867fa42",
        "lineStart": 20,
        "lineEnd": 20,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/saml/configure-saml-org-mapping/_index.md#L20-L20"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "excluded-by-explicit-document-products",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.e2a53ea6c995daf5083d",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "For example, use following configuration to assign users from `Engineering` organization to the Grafana organization with ID `2` as Editor and users from `Sales` - to the org with ID `3` as Admin, based on `Org` assertion attribute value:",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure organization mapping for SAML"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/saml/configure-saml-org-mapping/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "fc1ed69f1b859012b866eacc9fc8b185164e7554",
        "sha256": "d5b6f892b4571a76b2d5ae9fb5522ce2d9a50c392caa5bb216676bea5867fa42",
        "lineStart": 22,
        "lineEnd": 22,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/saml/configure-saml-org-mapping/_index.md#L22-L22"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "excluded-by-explicit-document-products",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.2a7ea9f58fa09577b446",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "The `org_mapping` option stores mappings in the database as JSON. Size limits depend on your database. In MySQL before Grafana 12.3, the limit is 65,535 bytes. From Grafana 12.3, the column uses `MEDIUMTEXT`, raising the MySQL limit to 16,777,215 bytes (~16 MB). If you need to split users into more granular control, we suggest using [Role and Team Sync](../configure-saml-team-role-mapping/) instead.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure organization mapping for SAML"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/saml/configure-saml-org-mapping/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "fc1ed69f1b859012b866eacc9fc8b185164e7554",
        "sha256": "d5b6f892b4571a76b2d5ae9fb5522ce2d9a50c392caa5bb216676bea5867fa42",
        "lineStart": 31,
        "lineEnd": 31,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/saml/configure-saml-org-mapping/_index.md#L31-L31"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "excluded-by-explicit-document-products",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.621338be4eae42896aab",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Starting from Grafana version 11.5, you can use the organization name instead of the organization ID in the `org_mapping` option. Ensure that the organization name you configure matches exactly with the organization name in Grafana, as it is case-sensitive. If the organization name is not found in Grafana, the mapping will be ignored. If the external organization or the organization name contains spaces, use the JSON syntax for the `org_mapping` option:",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure organization mapping for SAML"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/saml/configure-saml-org-mapping/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "fc1ed69f1b859012b866eacc9fc8b185164e7554",
        "sha256": "d5b6f892b4571a76b2d5ae9fb5522ce2d9a50c392caa5bb216676bea5867fa42",
        "lineStart": 34,
        "lineEnd": 34,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/saml/configure-saml-org-mapping/_index.md#L34-L34"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "excluded-by-explicit-document-products",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.d1e53b8a43bb27b00339",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "If one of the mappings contains a `:`, use the JSON syntax and escape the `:` with a backslash:",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure organization mapping for SAML"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/saml/configure-saml-org-mapping/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "fc1ed69f1b859012b866eacc9fc8b185164e7554",
        "sha256": "d5b6f892b4571a76b2d5ae9fb5522ce2d9a50c392caa5bb216676bea5867fa42",
        "lineStart": 40,
        "lineEnd": 40,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/saml/configure-saml-org-mapping/_index.md#L40-L40"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "excluded-by-explicit-document-products",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.a15a6e66be7cd3fa845d",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "You can specify multiple organizations both for the IdP and Grafana:",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure organization mapping for SAML"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/saml/configure-saml-org-mapping/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "fc1ed69f1b859012b866eacc9fc8b185164e7554",
        "sha256": "d5b6f892b4571a76b2d5ae9fb5522ce2d9a50c392caa5bb216676bea5867fa42",
        "lineStart": 55,
        "lineEnd": 55,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/saml/configure-saml-org-mapping/_index.md#L55-L55"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "excluded-by-explicit-document-products",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.3133b33935893bc505d7",
      "syntaxRole": "list-item",
      "sourceText": "- `org_mapping = Engineering:2, Sales:2` to map users from `Engineering` and `Sales` to `2` in Grafana.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure organization mapping for SAML"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/saml/configure-saml-org-mapping/_index.md",
