    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.327e09f91d90941c24a8",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Grafana supports signed and encrypted responses, and _only_ supports signed requests.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure SAML signing and encryption"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/saml/configure-saml-signing-encryption/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "62d939014dc2ac54e0cb6909b85905561839011d",
        "sha256": "033450d5f2b6a51e5aba8688130947990c7f9cb0d18ea203c6011d6e6938cd29",
        "lineStart": 17,
        "lineEnd": 17,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/saml/configure-saml-signing-encryption/_index.md#L17-L17"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "excluded-by-explicit-document-products",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.9ceb30cf6408100bb5b3",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Commonly, the certificate and key are embedded in the IdP metadata and refreshed as needed by Grafana automatically. However, if your IdP expects signed requests, you must supply a certificate and private key.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure SAML signing and encryption",
        "Certificate and private key"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/saml/configure-saml-signing-encryption/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "62d939014dc2ac54e0cb6909b85905561839011d",
        "sha256": "033450d5f2b6a51e5aba8688130947990c7f9cb0d18ea203c6011d6e6938cd29",
        "lineStart": 21,
        "lineEnd": 21,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/saml/configure-saml-signing-encryption/_index.md#L21-L21"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "excluded-by-explicit-document-products",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.fa6344d5fdd51bd84b15",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "The SAML SSO standard uses asymmetric encryption to exchange information between the SP (Grafana) and the IdP. To perform such encryption, you need a public part and a private part. In this case, the X.509 certificate provides the public part, while the private key provides the private part. The private key needs to be issued in a [PKCS#8](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/PKCS_8) format.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure SAML signing and encryption",
        "Certificate and private key"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/saml/configure-saml-signing-encryption/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "62d939014dc2ac54e0cb6909b85905561839011d",
        "sha256": "033450d5f2b6a51e5aba8688130947990c7f9cb0d18ea203c6011d6e6938cd29",
        "lineStart": 23,
        "lineEnd": 23,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/saml/configure-saml-signing-encryption/_index.md#L23-L23"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "excluded-by-explicit-document-products",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.e21857fec3ea906cc29d",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "If you are directly supplying the certificate and key, Grafana supports two ways of specifying both the `certificate` and `private_key`:",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure SAML signing and encryption",
        "Certificate and private key"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/saml/configure-saml-signing-encryption/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "62d939014dc2ac54e0cb6909b85905561839011d",
        "sha256": "033450d5f2b6a51e5aba8688130947990c7f9cb0d18ea203c6011d6e6938cd29",
        "lineStart": 25,
        "lineEnd": 25,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/saml/configure-saml-signing-encryption/_index.md#L25-L25"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "excluded-by-explicit-document-products",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.19ee5177175aa49dfb1c",
      "syntaxRole": "list-item",
      "sourceText": "- Without a suffix (`certificate` or `private_key`), the configuration assumes you've supplied the base64-encoded file contents.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure SAML signing and encryption",
        "Certificate and private key"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/saml/configure-saml-signing-encryption/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "62d939014dc2ac54e0cb6909b85905561839011d",
        "sha256": "033450d5f2b6a51e5aba8688130947990c7f9cb0d18ea203c6011d6e6938cd29",
        "lineStart": 27,
        "lineEnd": 27,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/saml/configure-saml-signing-encryption/_index.md#L27-L27"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "excluded-by-explicit-document-products",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.397aa3b3f3a75459bcfc",
      "syntaxRole": "list-item",
      "sourceText": "- With the `_path` suffix (`certificate_path` or `private_key_path`), then Grafana treats the value entered as a path and attempts to read the file from the file system.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure SAML signing and encryption",
        "Certificate and private key"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/saml/configure-saml-signing-encryption/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "62d939014dc2ac54e0cb6909b85905561839011d",
        "sha256": "033450d5f2b6a51e5aba8688130947990c7f9cb0d18ea203c6011d6e6938cd29",
        "lineStart": 28,
        "lineEnd": 28,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/saml/configure-saml-signing-encryption/_index.md#L28-L28"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "excluded-by-explicit-document-products",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.64b67cd2721bf32d631c",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "You can only use one form of each configuration option. Using multiple forms, such as both `certificate` and `certificate_path`, results in an error.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure SAML signing and encryption",
        "Certificate and private key"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/saml/configure-saml-signing-encryption/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "62d939014dc2ac54e0cb6909b85905561839011d",
        "sha256": "033450d5f2b6a51e5aba8688130947990c7f9cb0d18ea203c6011d6e6938cd29",
        "lineStart": 31,
        "lineEnd": 31,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/saml/configure-saml-signing-encryption/_index.md#L31-L31"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "excluded-by-explicit-document-products",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.efa3d0d883e262fe2d60",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Always work with your company's security team on setting up certificates and private keys. If you need to generate them yourself (such as in the short term, for testing purposes, and so on), use the following example to generate your certificate and private key, including the step of ensuring that the key is generated with the [PKCS#8](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/PKCS_8) format.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure SAML signing and encryption",
        "Certificate and private key"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/saml/configure-saml-signing-encryption/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "62d939014dc2ac54e0cb6909b85905561839011d",
        "sha256": "033450d5f2b6a51e5aba8688130947990c7f9cb0d18ea203c6011d6e6938cd29",
        "lineStart": 34,
        "lineEnd": 34,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/saml/configure-saml-signing-encryption/_index.md#L34-L34"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "excluded-by-explicit-document-products",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.46b3217fc26bb30df64c",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "The SAML standard requires digital signatures for security-critical messages such as authentication and logout requests. When you configure the `signature_algorithm` option, Grafana automatically signs these SAML requests using your configured private key and certificate.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure SAML signing and encryption",
        "Signature algorithm"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/saml/configure-saml-signing-encryption/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "62d939014dc2ac54e0cb6909b85905561839011d",
        "sha256": "033450d5f2b6a51e5aba8688130947990c7f9cb0d18ea203c6011d6e6938cd29",
        "lineStart": 38,
        "lineEnd": 38,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/saml/configure-saml-signing-encryption/_index.md#L38-L38"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "excluded-by-explicit-document-products",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.27d56906c138749b3b7c",
      "syntaxRole": "list-item",
      "sourceText": "- `rsa-sha1`: Legacy algorithm, not recommended for new deployments",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure SAML signing and encryption",
        "Signature algorithm",
        "Supported algorithms"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/saml/configure-saml-signing-encryption/_index.md",
