    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.10f7a4fdb88a1ff84628",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "The single logout feature allows users to log out from all applications associated with the current IdP session established via SAML SSO. If the `single_logout` option is set to `true` and a user logs out, Grafana requests IdP to end the user session which in turn triggers logout from all other applications the user is logged into using the same IdP session (applications should support single logout). Conversely, if another application connected to the same IdP logs out using single logout, Grafana receives a logout request from IdP and ends the user session.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure SAML Single Logout"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/saml/configure-saml-single-logout/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "4eeca751d543516aaead30395b0eef944850efba",
        "sha256": "924b8bca87bb61cd598f44c838de4fe30422b3daef4d99ea61a616e6ae680cc0",
        "lineStart": 17,
        "lineEnd": 17,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/saml/configure-saml-single-logout/_index.md#L17-L17"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "excluded-by-explicit-document-products",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.b0bf3934c780d4eb173d",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "The improved SLO features, including proper handling of the IdP's SessionIndex, are currently behind the `improvedExternalSessionHandlingSAML` feature toggle. When this feature toggle is enabled, Grafana will correctly handle session-specific logouts. If the feature toggle is not enabled, logging out will end all of the user's sessions.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure SAML Single Logout"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/saml/configure-saml-single-logout/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "4eeca751d543516aaead30395b0eef944850efba",
        "sha256": "924b8bca87bb61cd598f44c838de4fe30422b3daef4d99ea61a616e6ae680cc0",
        "lineStart": 20,
        "lineEnd": 20,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/saml/configure-saml-single-logout/_index.md#L20-L20"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "excluded-by-explicit-document-products",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.5bef644503a2d9776ba2",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Available in [Grafana Enterprise](https://grafana.com/docs/grafana/<GRAFANA_VERSION>/introduction/grafana-enterprise/) and to customers on select Grafana Cloud plans. For pricing information, visit [pricing](https://grafana.com/pricing/) or contact our sales team.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure team sync for SAML"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/saml/configure-saml-team-role-mapping/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "727e58aab87aa12f202bdd630c6b5d4a2d80ec31",
        "sha256": "ee4d4ffddc50f2b7c4ad41a2aaaea84eaeae21bba1b53770850ee119744b6cc1",
        "lineStart": 19,
        "lineEnd": 19,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/saml/configure-saml-team-role-mapping/_index.md#L19-L19"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "excluded-by-explicit-document-products",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.c6dac9cae311e471d560",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "To use SAML Team sync, set [`assertion_attribute_groups`](https://grafana.com/docs/grafana/<GRAFANA_VERSION>/setup-grafana/configure-grafana/enterprise-configuration/#assertion_attribute_groups) to the attribute name where you store user groups. Then Grafana will use attribute values extracted from SAML assertion to add user into the groups with the same name configured on the External group sync tab.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure team sync for SAML"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/saml/configure-saml-team-role-mapping/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "727e58aab87aa12f202bdd630c6b5d4a2d80ec31",
        "sha256": "ee4d4ffddc50f2b7c4ad41a2aaaea84eaeae21bba1b53770850ee119744b6cc1",
        "lineStart": 22,
        "lineEnd": 22,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/saml/configure-saml-team-role-mapping/_index.md#L22-L22"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "excluded-by-explicit-document-products",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.19bb1f14419922393357",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Grafana requires the SAML groups attribute to be configured with distinct `AttributeValue` elements for each group. Do not include multiple groups within a single `AttributeValue` delimited by a comma or any other character. Failure to do so will prevent correct group parsing. Example:",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure team sync for SAML"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/saml/configure-saml-team-role-mapping/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "727e58aab87aa12f202bdd630c6b5d4a2d80ec31",
        "sha256": "ee4d4ffddc50f2b7c4ad41a2aaaea84eaeae21bba1b53770850ee119744b6cc1",
        "lineStart": 25,
        "lineEnd": 25,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/saml/configure-saml-team-role-mapping/_index.md#L25-L25"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "excluded-by-explicit-document-products",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.d5fb24ca730a7f6c6367",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Team Sync allows you sync users from SAML to Grafana teams. It does not automatically create teams in Grafana. You need to create teams in Grafana before you can use this feature.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure team sync for SAML"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/saml/configure-saml-team-role-mapping/_index.md",
