      "id": "grafana.candidate.c2d9c53a487489d096bb",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "While you can configure an Entra ID tenant in Grafana via SAML, some additional information is only accessible via the Graph API. To retrieve this information, create a new application in Entra ID and grant it the necessary permissions. To learn more refer to [Entra ID SAML limitations](https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/entra/identity-platform/id-token-claims-reference#groups-overage-claim).",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure SAML with Microsoft Entra ID",
        "Configure a Graph API application in Entra ID"
      ],
      "source": {
