      "syntaxRole": "list-item",
      "sourceText": "- In the **Audience URI (SP Entity ID)** field, use the `/saml/metadata` endpoint URL, by default it is the `/saml/metadata` endpoint of your Grafana instance (for example `https://example.grafana.com/saml/metadata`). This could be configured differently, but the value here must match the `entity_id` setting of the SAML settings of Grafana.",
