    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.5588291a738acaba27d9",
      "syntaxRole": "procedural-step",
      "sourceText": "1. In the `[auth.saml]` section in the Grafana configuration file, set [`enabled`](https://grafana.com/docs/grafana/<GRAFANA_VERSION>/setup-grafana/configure-grafana/enterprise-configuration/#enabled-3) to `true`.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure SAML authentication using the Grafana configuration file"
      ],
      "source": {
