      "syntaxRole": "procedural-step",
      "sourceText": "2. Configure SAML according to your requirements. **Review all the [available configuration options](https://grafana.com/docs/grafana/<GRAFANA_VERSION>/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/saml/saml-configuration-options/)**.",
