      "syntaxRole": "list-item",
      "sourceText": "- **Single logout:** The SAML single logout feature enables users to log out from all applications associated with the current IdP session established using SAML SSO. For more information, refer to [SAML single logout documentation](../configure-saml-single-logout).",
