      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "excluded-by-explicit-document-products",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.82a37c848811b8b771bb",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "If you want to automatically assign users' roles based on their SAML roles, complete the **Role mapping** section.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure SAML authentication using the Grafana user interface",
        "User Mapping",
        "Role mapping"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/saml/saml-ui/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "a9b448b96ab4cdfbe54f234798c5d3884f1b6c70",
        "sha256": "e0629082b9702e9220daa90875013b72915e1e39ff6cf86a723e78376f3d1c68",
        "lineStart": 94,
        "lineEnd": 94,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/saml/saml-ui/_index.md#L94-L94"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "excluded-by-explicit-document-products",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.f5841695a4a6501dca56",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "First, you need to configure the **Role attribute** field to specify which SAML attribute should be used to retrieve SAML role information. Then enter the SAML roles that you want to map to Grafana roles in **Role mapping** section. If you want to map multiple SAML roles to a Grafana role, separate them by a comma and a space. For example, `Editor: editor, developer`.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure SAML authentication using the Grafana user interface",
        "User Mapping",
        "Role mapping"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/saml/saml-ui/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "a9b448b96ab4cdfbe54f234798c5d3884f1b6c70",
        "sha256": "e0629082b9702e9220daa90875013b72915e1e39ff6cf86a723e78376f3d1c68",
        "lineStart": 96,
        "lineEnd": 96,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/saml/saml-ui/_index.md#L96-L96"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "excluded-by-explicit-document-products",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.8fa109b7d15f3fe65d8c",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Role mapping automatically updates user's [basic role](../../../../../administration/roles-and-permissions/access-control/#basic-roles) based on their SAML roles every time the user logs in to Grafana. Learn more about [SAML role synchronization](../configure-saml-team-role-mapping/#configure-role-sync).",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure SAML authentication using the Grafana user interface",
        "User Mapping",
        "Role mapping"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/saml/saml-ui/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "a9b448b96ab4cdfbe54f234798c5d3884f1b6c70",
        "sha256": "e0629082b9702e9220daa90875013b72915e1e39ff6cf86a723e78376f3d1c68",
        "lineStart": 98,
        "lineEnd": 98,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/saml/saml-ui/_index.md#L98-L98"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "excluded-by-explicit-document-products",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.cfe36dc394da3665afaf",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "If you're using Entra ID as the Identity Provider over SAML, keep in mind Azure's interpretation of these attributes. Enter the full URLs in the corresponding fields within the UI, which should match the URLs from the metadata XML. There are differences depending on whether it's a Role or Group claim vs other assertions which Microsoft has [documented](https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/entra/identity-platform/reference-claims-customization#table-2-saml-restricted-claim-set).",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure SAML authentication using the Grafana user interface",
        "User Mapping",
        "Mapping with Entra ID"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/saml/saml-ui/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "a9b448b96ab4cdfbe54f234798c5d3884f1b6c70",
        "sha256": "e0629082b9702e9220daa90875013b72915e1e39ff6cf86a723e78376f3d1c68",
