    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.fe2593ca0c0c877fb3c9",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "If you have multiple organizations and want to automatically add users to organizations, complete the **Org mapping section**.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure SAML authentication using the Grafana user interface",
        "User Mapping",
        "Mapping organizations"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/saml/saml-ui/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "a9b448b96ab4cdfbe54f234798c5d3884f1b6c70",
        "sha256": "e0629082b9702e9220daa90875013b72915e1e39ff6cf86a723e78376f3d1c68",
        "lineStart": 130,
        "lineEnd": 130,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/saml/saml-ui/_index.md#L130-L130"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "excluded-by-explicit-document-products",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.bb868711c0de51235dc4",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "First, you need to configure the **Org attribute** field to specify which SAML attribute should be used to retrieve SAML organization information. Now fill in the **Org mapping** field with mappings from SAML organization to Grafana organization. For example, `Org mapping: Engineering:2, Sales:2` will map users who belong to `Engineering` or `Sales` organizations in SAML to Grafana organization with ID 2. If you want users to have different roles in different organizations, you can additionally specify a role. For example, `Org mapping: Engineering:2:Editor` will map users who belong to `Engineering` organizations in SAML to Grafana organization with ID 2 and assign them Editor role.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure SAML authentication using the Grafana user interface",
        "User Mapping",
        "Mapping organizations"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/saml/saml-ui/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "a9b448b96ab4cdfbe54f234798c5d3884f1b6c70",
        "sha256": "e0629082b9702e9220daa90875013b72915e1e39ff6cf86a723e78376f3d1c68",
        "lineStart": 132,
        "lineEnd": 134,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/saml/saml-ui/_index.md#L132-L134"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "excluded-by-explicit-document-products",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.d92ab3a6990f012862d9",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Organization mapping automatically updates user's organization memberships (and roles, if they've been configured) based on their SAML organization every time the user logs in to Grafana. Learn more about [SAML organization mapping](../configure-saml-org-mapping/).",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure SAML authentication using the Grafana user interface",
        "User Mapping",
        "Mapping organizations"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/saml/saml-ui/_index.md",
