    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.f578eb88116058a5cd63",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "When the user logs in using SAML and gets presented with `origin not allowed`, the user might be issuing the login from an IdP (identity provider) service or the user is behind a reverse proxy. This potentially happens as the CSRF checks in Grafana deem the requests to be invalid. For more information [CSRF](https://owasp.org/www-community/attacks/csrf).",
      "headingPath": [
        "Troubleshooting",
        "Troubleshoot SAML authentication in Grafana",
        "SAML login attempts fail with request response `origin not allowed`"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/saml/troubleshoot-saml/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "b06ceea154d5e4830b95b8a5a8f4b7d9f1d44a2f",
        "sha256": "799d46671255ea5bf81504ed3152d1a9e163e69ee079e7a81728df8b374381b8",
        "lineStart": 71,
        "lineEnd": 71,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/saml/troubleshoot-saml/_index.md#L71-L71"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "excluded-by-explicit-document-products",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.9a5dd6f75e84482539ec",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "To solve this issue, you can configure either the [`csrf_trusted_origins`](/docs/grafana/<GRAFANA_VERSION>/setup-grafana/configure-grafana/#csrf_trusted_origins) or [`csrf_additional_headers`](/docs/grafana/<GRAFANA_VERSION>/setup-grafana/configure-grafana/#csrf_additional_headers) option in the SAML configuration.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Troubleshooting",
        "Troubleshoot SAML authentication in Grafana",
        "SAML login attempts fail with request response `origin not allowed`"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/saml/troubleshoot-saml/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "b06ceea154d5e4830b95b8a5a8f4b7d9f1d44a2f",
        "sha256": "799d46671255ea5bf81504ed3152d1a9e163e69ee079e7a81728df8b374381b8",
        "lineStart": 73,
        "lineEnd": 73,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/saml/troubleshoot-saml/_index.md#L73-L73"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "excluded-by-explicit-document-products",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.db42e17e1b886d037c2f",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Accessing the Grafana login page from a URL that is not the root URL of the Grafana server can cause the instance to return the following error: \"login session has expired\".",
      "headingPath": [
        "Troubleshooting",
        "Troubleshoot SAML authentication in Grafana",
        "SAML login attempts fail with request response \"login session has expired\""
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/saml/troubleshoot-saml/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "b06ceea154d5e4830b95b8a5a8f4b7d9f1d44a2f",
        "sha256": "799d46671255ea5bf81504ed3152d1a9e163e69ee079e7a81728df8b374381b8",
        "lineStart": 88,
        "lineEnd": 89,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/saml/troubleshoot-saml/_index.md#L88-L89"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "excluded-by-explicit-document-products",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.fc032787bedc6efb2ab9",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "If you are accessing Grafana through a proxy server, ensure that cookies are correctly rewritten to the root URL of Grafana. Cookies must be set on the same URL as the `root_url` of Grafana. This is normally the reverse proxy's domain/address.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Troubleshooting",
        "Troubleshoot SAML authentication in Grafana",
        "SAML login attempts fail with request response \"login session has expired\""
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/saml/troubleshoot-saml/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "b06ceea154d5e4830b95b8a5a8f4b7d9f1d44a2f",
