        "lineStart": 47,
        "lineEnd": 47,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-scim-provisioning/_index.md#L47-L47"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "excluded-by-explicit-document-products",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.f844f07e0ced9f35ffae",
      "syntaxRole": "procedural-step",
      "sourceText": "2. **Security restriction**: When using SAML, the login authentication flow requires the SAML assertion exchange between the Identity Provider and Grafana to include the `userUID` SAML assertion with the user's unique identifier at the Identity Provider.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure SCIM provisioning",
        "Authentication and access requirements"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-scim-provisioning/_index.md",
