    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.a7cc6c8d3a4fc7190208",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "When you use SAML with SCIM provisioning, align the SCIM `externalId` with the SAML user identifier. Use a stable IdP attribute (for example, Entra ID `user.objectid`) as the SCIM `externalId`, and send that same value as a SAML claim. Configure Grafana to read this claim with the `assertion_attribute_external_uid` setting so SAML authentication links to the SCIM-provisioned user and its permissions.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure SCIM provisioning",
        "Authentication and access requirements",
        "Align SAML identifier with SCIM `externalId`"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-scim-provisioning/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "a298736a0d923353f597de1ee76f6a6ce0df3d22",
        "sha256": "0cef8ee164df6d150dd51c4d90e510ab70a90018eda4118ccc38606d86fc1afa",
        "lineStart": 55,
        "lineEnd": 55,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-scim-provisioning/_index.md#L55-L55"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "excluded-by-explicit-document-products",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.26d85408ce7a67217147",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "If the SAML identifier and SCIM `externalId` differ, Grafana may not link the authenticated user to the intended SCIM profile, which can result in incorrect access. Verify your IdP sends a stable, unique identifier and that it matches the SCIM `externalId`. Refer to your IdP docs and the Grafana SCIM integration guides for [Entra ID](configure-scim-with-entraid/) and [Okta](configure-scim-with-okta/) for attribute configuration details.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure SCIM provisioning",
        "Authentication and access requirements",
        "Align SAML identifier with SCIM `externalId`"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-scim-provisioning/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "a298736a0d923353f597de1ee76f6a6ce0df3d22",
        "sha256": "0cef8ee164df6d150dd51c4d90e510ab70a90018eda4118ccc38606d86fc1afa",
        "lineStart": 57,
        "lineEnd": 57,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-scim-provisioning/_index.md#L57-L57"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "excluded-by-explicit-document-products",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.3cff86b960b818932d78",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "You can configure SCIM in Grafana using the Grafana user interface. To do this, navigate to **Administration > Authentication > SCIM**.",
