    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.182e93de6224a690b638",
      "syntaxRole": "list-item",
      "sourceText": "- Using the authentication settings permission allows us to restrict Grafana’s access scope rather than relying on an overly permissive role such as Admin.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure SCIM provisioning",
        "Configure SCIM using the Grafana user interface"
      ],
      "source": {
