      "syntaxRole": "table-row",
      "sourceText": "| `Enable Group Sync`            | No       | Enable SCIM group provisioning. When enabled, Grafana will create, update, and delete teams based on SCIM requests from your identity provider. Cannot be enabled if Team Sync is enabled. | `false` |",
