      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "You can also configure SCIM provisioning in Grafana using the [Grafana Terraform provider](https://registry.terraform.io/providers/grafana/grafana/latest/docs/resources/scim_config). This approach is particularly useful for infrastructure-as-code deployments and automated provisioning.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure SCIM provisioning",
