      "syntaxRole": "table-row",
      "sourceText": "| `user_sync_enabled`            | Yes      | Enable SCIM user provisioning. When enabled, Grafana will create, update, and deactivate users based on SCIM requests from your identity provider.                                         | `false` |",
      "headingPath": [
