      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Ensure your Okta SAML application is configured to send a stable, unique identifier (that will map to the Grafana SCIM `externalId`) as a SAML claim. Then, configure the Grafana SAML settings to use this claim. For general Okta SAML setup, refer to [Set up SAML with Okta](../../configure-authentication/saml/configure-saml-with-okta/).",
