    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.4650d4258c23bc343aea",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "When a user logs in via SAML, Grafana needs to securely match them to the correct user account provisioned by SCIM. This requires using a consistent, unique identifier across both processes (for example, the user's `objectId` in Entra ID).",
      "headingPath": [
        "Manage users and teams with SCIM",
        "User provisioning with SCIM",
        "How SCIM identifies users"
      ],
