    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.81149ceb40b5143a3138",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "If any of your teams, Team A for example, need to build and manage their own data sources for product-specific use cases, grant the `datasources:creator` fixed role so they can create and manage their own data sources independently.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Manage multi-team access in a single Grafana instance",
        "Example: Three teams, one stack",
        "Configure data access based on team requirements",
        "Autonomous team data management"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/multi-team-access.md",
