    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.73ed9f8343544e22961e",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "For example, users working in [Frontend Observability](https://grafana.com/docs/grafana-cloud/monitor-applications/frontend-observability/) need a writer fixed role so that they can create and manage services.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Manage multi-team access in a single Grafana instance",
        "Example: Three teams, one stack",
        "Configure data access based on team requirements",
        "Resources at an instance level"
      ],
