    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.33dd61f784ddcf3f701f",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "You can add any new users to your Grafana instance with an Identity Provider through [SCIM](../../configure-access/configure-authentication/). Use [role sync](../../../configure-access/configure-authentication/saml/configure-saml-team-role-mapping/#configure-role-sync-for-saml) to automatically assign users the correct basic role (Viewer, Editor, or Admin) based on their mapped attributes in the IdP..",
      "headingPath": [
        "Manage multi-team access in a single Grafana instance",
        "Example: Three teams, one stack",
        "Scale access management with Terraform and SSO"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-access/multi-team-access.md",
