      "sourceText": "- The [Least privilege custom role explainer](https://grafana.com/blog/2024/09/10/grafana-access-management-how-to-use-teams-for-seamless-user-and-permission-management/) blog walks through how to design roles that keep things simple and safe, so your users have just the access they need.",
