      "syntaxRole": "list-item",
      "sourceText": "- The [Introducing SCIM](https://grafana.com/blog/2025/05/14/introducing-scim-provisioning-in-grafana-enterprise-grade-user-management-made-simple/) post covers how to connect Grafana to your identity provider, making it easy to bring new users on board and keep permissions in sync as your organization grows.",
