    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.fe1e3ac80d88dd39bf0a",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "By default, the images are built using the widely used [Alpine Linux project](http://alpinelinux.org/) base image, which can be found in the [Alpine docker repo](https://hub.docker.com/_/alpine). If you prioritize security and want to minimize the size of your image, it is recommended that you use the Alpine variant. However, it's important to note that the Alpine variant uses [musl libc](http://www.musl-libc.org/) instead of [glibc and others](http://www.etalabs.net/compare_libcs.html). As a result, some software might encounter problems depending on their libc requirements. Nonetheless, most software should not experience any issues, so the Alpine variant is generally reliable.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure a Grafana Docker image",
        "Alpine image (recommended)"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-docker.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "d91b83cf21311b97e3e286b7c1efc686959b4b9f",
        "sha256": "c76f5bf33aa9948420698d8a2f35a8495645f0e19c57f16743f2e31ec133f9a7",
        "lineStart": 59,
        "lineEnd": 60,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-docker.md#L59-L60"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.a5c8fa3be05cc1f63dbf",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "The Ubuntu-based Grafana Enterprise and OSS images are built using the [Ubuntu](https://ubuntu.com/) base image, which can be found in the [Ubuntu docker repo](https://hub.docker.com/_/ubuntu). An Ubuntu-based image can be a good option for users who prefer an Ubuntu-based image or require certain tools unavailable on Alpine.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure a Grafana Docker image",
        "Ubuntu image"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-docker.md",
