    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.5d7831ea8fddfff9b0d2",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Slim images don't include the plugins that Grafana bundles with the standard images. You can still install plugins when the container starts by setting the `GF_PLUGINS_PREINSTALL` environment variable. For instructions, refer to [Install plugins in the Docker container](../installation/docker/#install-plugins-in-the-docker-container).",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure a Grafana Docker image",
        "Slim images"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-docker.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "d91b83cf21311b97e3e286b7c1efc686959b4b9f",
        "sha256": "c76f5bf33aa9948420698d8a2f35a8495645f0e19c57f16743f2e31ec133f9a7",
        "lineStart": 80,
        "lineEnd": 80,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-docker.md#L80-L80"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.bb04b90b573ad7e64157",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "To use a slim image, add `-slim` to the base image suffix. For example, use `<version>-slim` for Alpine, `<version>-ubuntu-slim` for Ubuntu, or `<version>-distroless-slim` for Distroless.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure a Grafana Docker image",
        "Slim images"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-docker.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "d91b83cf21311b97e3e286b7c1efc686959b4b9f",
        "sha256": "c76f5bf33aa9948420698d8a2f35a8495645f0e19c57f16743f2e31ec133f9a7",
        "lineStart": 82,
        "lineEnd": 82,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-docker.md#L82-L82"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.927930a6b7fc0042c246",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "You can also run a specific version of Grafana or a beta version based on the main branch of the [`grafana/grafana` GitHub repository](https://github.com/grafana/grafana).",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure a Grafana Docker image",
        "Run a specific version of Grafana"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-docker.md",
