    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.730bf1447b630aed69d1",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "The following example demonstrates creating a customized Grafana Docker image that includes a custom plugin from a URL link, the clock panel plugin, and the simple-json-datasource plugin. You can define these plugins in the build argument using the Grafana Plugin environment variable.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure a Grafana Docker image",
        "Build a custom Grafana Docker image",
        "Build a Grafana Docker image with pre-installed plugins from other sources"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-docker.md",
