      "id": "grafana.candidate.d6938dafcc87d7d33780",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "The chance of syntax errors appearing in a YAML file increases as the file becomes more complex. You can use the following command to check for syntax errors.",
