    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.c0a0c0615da811381047",
      "syntaxRole": "list-item",
      "sourceText": "- After you add custom options, [uncomment](#remove-comments-in-the-ini-files) the relevant sections of the configuration file and restart Grafana for your changes to take effect.",
