      "id": "grafana.candidate.55e20270958f749f631c",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "There is no local configuration file for Grafana Cloud stacks, but many of these settings are still configurable. To edit configurable settings, open a support ticket.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure Grafana",
        "Configuration file location",
        "Grafana Cloud"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-grafana/_index.md",
