      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "For more information, refer to [Integrate Grafana with Hashicorp Vault](/docs/grafana/<GRAFANA_VERSION>/setup-grafana/configure-security/configure-database-encryption/integrate-with-hashicorp-vault).",
