      "syntaxRole": "list-item",
      "sourceText": "- `ssl` (optional) is if SSL should be used to connect to Redis server. The value may be `true`, `false`, or `insecure`. Setting the value to `insecure` skips verification of the certificate chain and hostname when making the connection.",
