    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.0b50a2174cf1c9ec46a5",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Set to `true` to disable [brute force login protection by IP address](https://cheatsheetseries.owasp.org/cheatsheets/Authentication_Cheat_Sheet.html#account-lockout). Default is `true`. Anyone from the IP address will be unable to login for 5 minutes if all login attempts are spent within a 5 minute window.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure Grafana",
        "Configuration options",
        "`[security]`",
        "`disable_ip_address_login_protection`"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-grafana/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "840897d3e561f7771511009edaca25f1998321d0",
        "sha256": "110d223ee731dd41043e8181cce5c9d3503e4a9cb7ddd744807966a1d3b235c6",
        "lineStart": 764,
        "lineEnd": 764,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-grafana/_index.md#L764-L764"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.cd48f80c9463c886b768",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Set to `true` if you host Grafana behind HTTPS. Default is `false`.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure Grafana",
        "Configuration options",
        "`[security]`",
        "`cookie_secure`"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-grafana/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "840897d3e561f7771511009edaca25f1998321d0",
        "sha256": "110d223ee731dd41043e8181cce5c9d3503e4a9cb7ddd744807966a1d3b235c6",
        "lineStart": 768,
        "lineEnd": 768,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-grafana/_index.md#L768-L768"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.85e42d8bde36632570ac",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Sets the `SameSite` cookie attribute and prevents the browser from sending this cookie along with cross-site requests. The main goal is to mitigate the risk of cross-origin information leakage. This setting also provides some protection against cross-site request forgery attacks (CSRF), [read more about SameSite here](https://owasp.org/www-community/SameSite). Valid values are `lax`, `strict`, `none`, and `disabled`. Default is `lax`. Using value `disabled` does not add any `SameSite` attribute to cookies.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure Grafana",
        "Configuration options",
        "`[security]`",
        "`cookie_samesite`"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-grafana/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "840897d3e561f7771511009edaca25f1998321d0",
        "sha256": "110d223ee731dd41043e8181cce5c9d3503e4a9cb7ddd744807966a1d3b235c6",
        "lineStart": 772,
        "lineEnd": 772,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-grafana/_index.md#L772-L772"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.1037114a88820c0bac87",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "If you want to use OAuth/SAML for login, it is necessary to configure this attribute as `lax`.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure Grafana",
        "Configuration options",
        "`[security]`",
        "`cookie_samesite`"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-grafana/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "840897d3e561f7771511009edaca25f1998321d0",
        "sha256": "110d223ee731dd41043e8181cce5c9d3503e4a9cb7ddd744807966a1d3b235c6",
        "lineStart": 774,
        "lineEnd": 774,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-grafana/_index.md#L774-L774"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.15172efb5a2b70d9c521",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "When `false`, the HTTP header `X-Frame-Options: deny` is set in Grafana HTTP responses which instructs browsers to not allow rendering Grafana in a `<frame>`, `<iframe>`, `<embed>` or `<object>`. The main goal is to mitigate the risk of [Clickjacking](https://owasp.org/www-community/attacks/Clickjacking). Default is `false`.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure Grafana",
        "Configuration options",
        "`[security]`",
        "`allow_embedding`"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-grafana/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "840897d3e561f7771511009edaca25f1998321d0",
        "sha256": "110d223ee731dd41043e8181cce5c9d3503e4a9cb7ddd744807966a1d3b235c6",
        "lineStart": 778,
        "lineEnd": 780,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-grafana/_index.md#L778-L780"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.15ded1907dd177e27d9d",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Set to `true` if you want to enable HTTP `Strict-Transport-Security` (HSTS) response header. Only use this when HTTPS is enabled in your configuration, or when there is another upstream system that ensures your application does HTTPS (like a frontend load balancer). HSTS tells browsers that the site should only be accessed using HTTPS.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure Grafana",
        "Configuration options",
        "`[security]`",
        "`strict_transport_security`"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-grafana/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "840897d3e561f7771511009edaca25f1998321d0",
        "sha256": "110d223ee731dd41043e8181cce5c9d3503e4a9cb7ddd744807966a1d3b235c6",
        "lineStart": 784,
        "lineEnd": 784,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-grafana/_index.md#L784-L784"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.24b0899c5020ebc48946",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Sets how long a browser should cache HSTS in seconds. Only applied if `strict_transport_security` is enabled. The default value is `86400`.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure Grafana",
        "Configuration options",
        "`[security]`",
        "`strict_transport_security_max_age_seconds`"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-grafana/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "840897d3e561f7771511009edaca25f1998321d0",
        "sha256": "110d223ee731dd41043e8181cce5c9d3503e4a9cb7ddd744807966a1d3b235c6",
        "lineStart": 788,
        "lineEnd": 789,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-grafana/_index.md#L788-L789"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.32159e0ab2e90ec37d99",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Set to `true` to enable HSTS `preloading` option. Only applied if `strict_transport_security` is enabled. The default value is `false`.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure Grafana",
        "Configuration options",
        "`[security]`",
        "`strict_transport_security_preload`"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-grafana/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "840897d3e561f7771511009edaca25f1998321d0",
        "sha256": "110d223ee731dd41043e8181cce5c9d3503e4a9cb7ddd744807966a1d3b235c6",
        "lineStart": 793,
        "lineEnd": 793,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-grafana/_index.md#L793-L793"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.fb13fd998c048697e1af",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Set to `true` to enable the HSTS includeSubDomains option. Only applied if `strict_transport_security` is enabled. The default value is `false`.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure Grafana",
        "Configuration options",
        "`[security]`",
        "`strict_transport_security_subdomains`"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-grafana/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "840897d3e561f7771511009edaca25f1998321d0",
        "sha256": "110d223ee731dd41043e8181cce5c9d3503e4a9cb7ddd744807966a1d3b235c6",
        "lineStart": 797,
        "lineEnd": 797,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-grafana/_index.md#L797-L797"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.54be07d9588daa3cec26",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Set to `false` to disable the X-Content-Type-Options response header. The X-Content-Type-Options response HTTP header is a marker used by the server to indicate that the MIME types advertised in the Content-Type headers should not be changed and be followed. The default value is `true`.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure Grafana",
        "Configuration options",
        "`[security]`",
        "`x_content_type_options`"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-grafana/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "840897d3e561f7771511009edaca25f1998321d0",
        "sha256": "110d223ee731dd41043e8181cce5c9d3503e4a9cb7ddd744807966a1d3b235c6",
        "lineStart": 801,
        "lineEnd": 801,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-grafana/_index.md#L801-L801"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.21508afb503f5adbd068",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Set to `false` to disable the X-XSS-Protection header, which tells browsers to stop pages from loading when they detect reflected cross-site scripting (XSS) attacks. The default value is `true`.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure Grafana",
        "Configuration options",
        "`[security]`",
        "`x_xss_protection`"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-grafana/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "840897d3e561f7771511009edaca25f1998321d0",
        "sha256": "110d223ee731dd41043e8181cce5c9d3503e4a9cb7ddd744807966a1d3b235c6",
        "lineStart": 805,
        "lineEnd": 805,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-grafana/_index.md#L805-L805"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.0fcad95768d33f54aaa1",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Set to `true` to add the `Content-Security-Policy` header to your requests. The Content Security Policy (CSP) controls which resources that the user agent can load and helps prevent XSS attacks.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure Grafana",
        "Configuration options",
        "`[security]`",
        "`content_security_policy`"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-grafana/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "840897d3e561f7771511009edaca25f1998321d0",
        "sha256": "110d223ee731dd41043e8181cce5c9d3503e4a9cb7ddd744807966a1d3b235c6",
        "lineStart": 809,
        "lineEnd": 810,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-grafana/_index.md#L809-L810"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.d10f2f5aa21ceff5b7ed",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Set the policy template that's used to add the `Content-Security-Policy` header to your requests. `$NONCE` in the template includes a random nonce.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure Grafana",
        "Configuration options",
        "`[security]`",
        "`content_security_policy_template`"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-grafana/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "840897d3e561f7771511009edaca25f1998321d0",
        "sha256": "110d223ee731dd41043e8181cce5c9d3503e4a9cb7ddd744807966a1d3b235c6",
        "lineStart": 814,
        "lineEnd": 815,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-grafana/_index.md#L814-L815"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.e30a619ac0bc2bad05d2",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Set to `true` to add the `Content-Security-Policy-Report-Only` header to your requests. CSP in \"Report Only\" mode lets you to experiment with policies by monitoring their effects without enforcing them. You can enable both policies simultaneously.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure Grafana",
        "Configuration options",
        "`[security]`",
        "`content_security_policy_report_only`"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-grafana/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "840897d3e561f7771511009edaca25f1998321d0",
        "sha256": "110d223ee731dd41043e8181cce5c9d3503e4a9cb7ddd744807966a1d3b235c6",
