    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.7ee7829116c2e8778b42",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "The `auto_assign_org_role` setting determines the default role assigned to new users in the main organization if `auto_assign_org` setting is set to `true`. You can set this to one of the following roles: (`Viewer` (default), `Admin`, `Editor`, and `None`). For example:",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure Grafana",
        "Configuration options",
        "`[users]`",
        "`auto_assign_org_role`"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-grafana/_index.md",
