    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.6db48bb9d0912f2695f9",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "There are five retries in total, so with the default value, the total wait time (for acquiring the lock) is at least 5 seconds (the wait time between retries is calculated as random(n, n + 500)), which means that the maximum token refresh duration must be less than 5-6 seconds.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure Grafana",
        "Configuration options",
        "`[auth]`",
        "`oauth_refresh_token_server_lock_min_wait_ms`"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-grafana/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "840897d3e561f7771511009edaca25f1998321d0",
        "sha256": "110d223ee731dd41043e8181cce5c9d3503e4a9cb7ddd744807966a1d3b235c6",
        "lineStart": 1120,
        "lineEnd": 1120,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-grafana/_index.md#L1120-L1120"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.2f6cbd4ddf49dc8feb1a",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "If you experience issues with the OAuth token refresh mechanism, you can increase this value to allow more time for the token refresh to complete.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure Grafana",
        "Configuration options",
        "`[auth]`",
        "`oauth_refresh_token_server_lock_min_wait_ms`"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-grafana/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "840897d3e561f7771511009edaca25f1998321d0",
        "sha256": "110d223ee731dd41043e8181cce5c9d3503e4a9cb7ddd744807966a1d3b235c6",
        "lineStart": 1122,
        "lineEnd": 1122,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-grafana/_index.md#L1122-L1122"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.5abb436c61750bd98a1b",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "If you want to change the `oauth_skip_org_role_update_sync` setting from `true` to `false`, then each provider you have set up, use the `skip_org_role_sync` setting to specify whether you want to skip the synchronization.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure Grafana",
        "Configuration options",
        "`[auth]`",
        "`oauth_skip_org_role_update_sync`"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-grafana/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "840897d3e561f7771511009edaca25f1998321d0",
        "sha256": "110d223ee731dd41043e8181cce5c9d3503e4a9cb7ddd744807966a1d3b235c6",
        "lineStart": 1130,
        "lineEnd": 1130,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-grafana/_index.md#L1130-L1130"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.ebac161b1afa3ce2b16c",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Currently if no organization role mapping is found for a user, Grafana doesn't update the user's organization role.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure Grafana",
        "Configuration options",
        "`[auth]`",
        "`oauth_skip_org_role_update_sync`"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-grafana/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "840897d3e561f7771511009edaca25f1998321d0",
        "sha256": "110d223ee731dd41043e8181cce5c9d3503e4a9cb7ddd744807966a1d3b235c6",
        "lineStart": 1133,
        "lineEnd": 1133,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-grafana/_index.md#L1133-L1133"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.32a40edcfc9f82a234fb",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "If `oauth_skip_org_role_update_sync` option is set to `false`, users with no mapping are reset to the default organization role on every login.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure Grafana",
        "Configuration options",
        "`[auth]`",
        "`oauth_skip_org_role_update_sync`"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-grafana/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "840897d3e561f7771511009edaca25f1998321d0",
        "sha256": "110d223ee731dd41043e8181cce5c9d3503e4a9cb7ddd744807966a1d3b235c6",
        "lineStart": 1135,
        "lineEnd": 1135,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-grafana/_index.md#L1135-L1135"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.e86e2b158b76dd469720",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "The default value for `skip_org_role_sync` is `false`.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure Grafana",
        "Configuration options",
        "`[auth]`",
        "`skip_org_role_sync`"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-grafana/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "840897d3e561f7771511009edaca25f1998321d0",
        "sha256": "110d223ee731dd41043e8181cce5c9d3503e4a9cb7ddd744807966a1d3b235c6",
        "lineStart": 1144,
        "lineEnd": 1144,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-grafana/_index.md#L1144-L1144"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.5c45f60bad935cf5301d",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "With `skip_org_role_sync` set to `false`, the users' organization and role is reset on every new login, based on the external provider's role. See your provider in the tables below.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure Grafana",
        "Configuration options",
        "`[auth]`",
        "`skip_org_role_sync`"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-grafana/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "840897d3e561f7771511009edaca25f1998321d0",
        "sha256": "110d223ee731dd41043e8181cce5c9d3503e4a9cb7ddd744807966a1d3b235c6",
        "lineStart": 1146,
        "lineEnd": 1146,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-grafana/_index.md#L1146-L1146"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.58c1b28d635fe159d327",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "With `skip_org_role_sync` set to `true`, when a user logs in for the first time, Grafana sets the organization role based on the value specified in `auto_assign_org_role` and forces the organization to `auto_assign_org_id` when specified, otherwise it falls back to OrgID `1`.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure Grafana",
        "Configuration options",
        "`[auth]`",
        "`skip_org_role_sync`"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-grafana/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "840897d3e561f7771511009edaca25f1998321d0",
        "sha256": "110d223ee731dd41043e8181cce5c9d3503e4a9cb7ddd744807966a1d3b235c6",
        "lineStart": 1148,
        "lineEnd": 1148,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-grafana/_index.md#L1148-L1148"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.7ca2cff26e4cad848e04",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Use this setting when you want to manage the organization roles of your users from within Grafana and be able to manually assign them to multiple organizations, or to prevent synchronization conflicts when they can be synchronized from another provider.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure Grafana",
        "Configuration options",
        "`[auth]`",
        "`skip_org_role_sync`"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-grafana/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "840897d3e561f7771511009edaca25f1998321d0",
        "sha256": "110d223ee731dd41043e8181cce5c9d3503e4a9cb7ddd744807966a1d3b235c6",
        "lineStart": 1154,
        "lineEnd": 1154,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-grafana/_index.md#L1154-L1154"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.8cf5b17e6448d422c5c6",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "The behavior of `oauth_skip_org_role_update_sync` and `skip_org_role_sync`, can be seen in the tables below:",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure Grafana",
        "Configuration options",
        "`[auth]`",
        "`skip_org_role_sync`"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-grafana/_index.md",
