      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Use the [List Metrics API](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/AmazonCloudWatch/latest/APIReference/API_ListMetrics.html) option to load metrics for custom namespaces in the Amazon CloudWatch data source. By default, the page limit is 500.",
