      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Specifies whether user identity authentication fallback credentials should be enabled in data sources. Enabling this allows data source creators to provide fallback credentials for backend-initiated requests, such as alerting, recorded queries, and so on.",
