    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.37b4ec2953084d232b81",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Uploads screenshots to the local Grafana server or remote storage such as Azure, S3 and GCS. For more information, refer to [`[external_image_storage]`](#external-image-store). If this option is false then screenshots are persisted to disk for up to `temp_data_lifetime`.",
