      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "This section applies only to rules imported as Grafana-managed rules. For more information about the import process, refer to [Import data source-managed rules to Grafana-managed rules](/docs/grafana/<GRAFANA_VERSION>/alerting/alerting-rules/alerting-migration/).",
