      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Set the default data source UID to use for query execution when importing Prometheus rules. Grafana uses this default when the `X-Grafana-Alerting-Datasource-UID` header isn't provided during import. If this option isn't set, the header becomes required. The default value is empty.",
