      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Enforces the maximum allowed amount of tags for any newly introduced annotations. This value can be between 500 and 4096 (inclusive). The default value is 500. Setting it to a higher value would impact performance and is therefore not recommended.",
