    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.d6498f851a9ec210bb51",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "If you want to allow an internal or self-hosted Git server, such as an on-premises GitHub Enterprise host, add an entry here. Each entry can be a hostname, `host:port`, a full URL (only the host is used), a literal IP address, or a CIDR range.",
