      "sourceText": "Instruct headless browser instance to use a default timezone when not provided by Grafana, for example, when rendering panel image of alert. Refer to the [ICU `metaZones.txt` file](https://cs.chromium.org/chromium/src/third_party/icu/source/data/misc/metaZones.txt) for a list of supported timezone IDs. Fallbacks to TZ environment variable if not set.",
