    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.ec55d44a3f97049de50d",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Instruct headless browser instance to use a default language when not provided by Grafana, for example, when rendering panel image of alert. Refer to the HTTP header Accept-Language to understand how to format this value, for example, 'fr-CH, fr;q=0.9, en;q=0.8, de;q=0.7, \\*;q=0.5'.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure Grafana",
        "Configuration options",
        "`[plugin.grafana-image-renderer]`",
        "`rendering_language`"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-grafana/_index.md",
