    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.23ebeddbebdde0f54b99",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Additional arguments to pass to the headless browser instance. Defaults are `--no-sandbox,--disable-gpu`. The list of Chromium flags can be found at (https://peter.sh/experiments/chromium-command-line-switches/). Separate multiple arguments with commas.",
