      "id": "grafana.candidate.b7b9a6b2b522be2d936c",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Comma-separated list of plugin IDs whose RBAC data (roles, permissions, and seed assignments) will be purged from the database at startup. Use this to clean up leftover data from plugins that have been uninstalled or renamed.",
