    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.f1b282edbecc0a5d78ab",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Additionally, you can copy images to the local Grafana image directory, `/usr/share/grafana/public/img/`, and set `login_logo` to the stored image. For example:",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure custom branding"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-grafana/configure-custom-branding/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "626068ce514684ffda01cbb550ec0d7bfca40775",
        "sha256": "6c97c1f57a15454c8f6f4819c8fb6290c2b649b6181719bd7b8fe885ffdf77bf",
        "lineStart": 145,
        "lineEnd": 145,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-grafana/configure-custom-branding/index.md#L145-L145"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "excluded-by-explicit-document-products",
        "products": [
          "enterprise"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.9957bc250b0a3e93d41d",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "You have the option of adding custom links in place of the default footer links (Documentation, Support, Community). Below is an example of how to replace the default footer and help links with custom links.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure custom branding"
      ],
      "source": {
