      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.4af27f902c3edfe7690a",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "If you specify `footer_links` or `GF_WHITE_LABELING_FOOTER_LINKS`, then all other default links are removed from the footer, and only what is specified is included.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure custom branding"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-grafana/configure-custom-branding/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "626068ce514684ffda01cbb550ec0d7bfca40775",
        "sha256": "6c97c1f57a15454c8f6f4819c8fb6290c2b649b6181719bd7b8fe885ffdf77bf",
        "lineStart": 184,
        "lineEnd": 184,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-grafana/configure-custom-branding/index.md#L184-L184"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "excluded-by-explicit-document-products",
        "products": [
          "enterprise"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.138be5612da134d40d90",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "In addition to the customizations described below, you can customize the footer of your shared dashboards. To customize the footer of a shared dashboard, add the following section to the `grafana.ini` file.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure custom branding",
        "Custom branding for shared dashboards"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-grafana/configure-custom-branding/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "626068ce514684ffda01cbb550ec0d7bfca40775",
        "sha256": "6c97c1f57a15454c8f6f4819c8fb6290c2b649b6181719bd7b8fe885ffdf77bf",
        "lineStart": 188,
        "lineEnd": 189,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-grafana/configure-custom-branding/index.md#L188-L189"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "excluded-by-explicit-document-products",
        "products": [
          "enterprise"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.55516e0edcb947f6b297",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "If you specify `footer_hide` to `true`, all the other values are ignored because the footer will not be shown.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure custom branding",
        "Custom branding for shared dashboards"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-grafana/configure-custom-branding/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "626068ce514684ffda01cbb550ec0d7bfca40775",
        "sha256": "6c97c1f57a15454c8f6f4819c8fb6290c2b649b6181719bd7b8fe885ffdf77bf",
        "lineStart": 212,
        "lineEnd": 212,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-grafana/configure-custom-branding/index.md#L212-L212"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "excluded-by-explicit-document-products",
        "products": [
          "enterprise"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.34f07512049698845391",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "You can set up the `grafana-server` process to enable certain diagnostics when it starts. This can be useful when investigating certain performance problems. It's _not_ recommended to have these enabled by default.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure profiling and tracing to troubleshoot Grafana"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-grafana/configure-tracing/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "75cc709ec1a4640e9474da9dbe47406005a2875e",
        "sha256": "407b054f426dee986054a8566542604fa8a11151e90e2991ebc65ee022305d76",
        "lineStart": 22,
        "lineEnd": 23,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-grafana/configure-tracing/index.md#L22-L23"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.8dd5b29cde8dd618cf8d",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "The `grafana-server` can be started with the command-line option `-profile` to enable profiling, `-profile-addr` to override the default HTTP address (`localhost`), and `-profile-port` to override the default HTTP port (`6060`) where the `pprof` debugging endpoints are available. Further, [`-profile-block-rate`](https://pkg.go.dev/runtime#SetBlockProfileRate) controls the fraction of goroutine blocking events that are reported in the blocking profile, default `1` (i.e. track every event) for backward compatibility reasons, and [`-profile-mutex-rate`](https://pkg.go.dev/runtime#SetMutexProfileFraction) controls the fraction of mutex contention events that are reported in the mutex profile, default `0` (i.e. track no events). The higher the fraction (that is, the smaller this value) the more overhead it adds to normal operations.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure profiling and tracing to troubleshoot Grafana",
        "Turn on profiling and collect profiles"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-grafana/configure-tracing/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "75cc709ec1a4640e9474da9dbe47406005a2875e",
        "sha256": "407b054f426dee986054a8566542604fa8a11151e90e2991ebc65ee022305d76",
        "lineStart": 27,
        "lineEnd": 28,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-grafana/configure-tracing/index.md#L27-L28"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.8a29906d53e613fe69f5",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Running Grafana with profiling enabled and without block and mutex profiling enabled should only add a fraction of overhead and is suitable for [continuous profiling](https://grafana.com/oss/pyroscope/). Adding a small fraction of block and mutex profiling, such as 10-5 (10%-20%) should in general be fine.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure profiling and tracing to troubleshoot Grafana",
        "Turn on profiling and collect profiles"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-grafana/configure-tracing/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "75cc709ec1a4640e9474da9dbe47406005a2875e",
        "sha256": "407b054f426dee986054a8566542604fa8a11151e90e2991ebc65ee022305d76",
        "lineStart": 30,
        "lineEnd": 30,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-grafana/configure-tracing/index.md#L30-L30"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.b8fa1a520f2f1406409c",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Enable profiling:",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure profiling and tracing to troubleshoot Grafana",
        "Turn on profiling and collect profiles"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-grafana/configure-tracing/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "75cc709ec1a4640e9474da9dbe47406005a2875e",
        "sha256": "407b054f426dee986054a8566542604fa8a11151e90e2991ebc65ee022305d76",
        "lineStart": 32,
        "lineEnd": 32,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-grafana/configure-tracing/index.md#L32-L32"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.de90ab212cdfff4b4f85",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Enable profiling with block and mutex profiling enabled with a fraction of 20%:",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure profiling and tracing to troubleshoot Grafana",
        "Turn on profiling and collect profiles"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-grafana/configure-tracing/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "75cc709ec1a4640e9474da9dbe47406005a2875e",
        "sha256": "407b054f426dee986054a8566542604fa8a11151e90e2991ebc65ee022305d76",
        "lineStart": 38,
        "lineEnd": 38,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-grafana/configure-tracing/index.md#L38-L38"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.611e8057956a61536f37",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "You can configure or override profiling settings using environment variables:",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure profiling and tracing to troubleshoot Grafana",
        "Turn on profiling and collect profiles"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-grafana/configure-tracing/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "75cc709ec1a4640e9474da9dbe47406005a2875e",
        "sha256": "407b054f426dee986054a8566542604fa8a11151e90e2991ebc65ee022305d76",
        "lineStart": 48,
        "lineEnd": 48,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-grafana/configure-tracing/index.md#L48-L48"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.d4bf53779cbfd8c4bc1d",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "In general, you use the [Go command pprof](https://golang.org/cmd/pprof/) to both collect and analyze profiling data. You can also use [curl](https://curl.se/) or similar to collect profiles which could be convenient in environments where you don't have the Go/pprof command available. Next, some usage examples of using curl and pprof to collect and analyze memory and CPU profiles.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure profiling and tracing to troubleshoot Grafana",
        "Turn on profiling and collect profiles"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-grafana/configure-tracing/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "75cc709ec1a4640e9474da9dbe47406005a2875e",
        "sha256": "407b054f426dee986054a8566542604fa8a11151e90e2991ebc65ee022305d76",
        "lineStart": 58,
        "lineEnd": 58,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-grafana/configure-tracing/index.md#L58-L58"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.e185689fe8bdc58c694e",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "When experiencing high memory usage or potential memory leaks it's useful to collect several heap profiles and later when analyzing, compare them. It's a good idea to wait some time, e.g. 30 seconds, between collecting each profile to allow memory consumption to increase.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure profiling and tracing to troubleshoot Grafana",
        "Turn on profiling and collect profiles"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-grafana/configure-tracing/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "75cc709ec1a4640e9474da9dbe47406005a2875e",
        "sha256": "407b054f426dee986054a8566542604fa8a11151e90e2991ebc65ee022305d76",
        "lineStart": 62,
        "lineEnd": 62,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-grafana/configure-tracing/index.md#L62-L62"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.fa1fe341015685555ce4",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "You can then use pprof tool to compare two heap profiles:",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure profiling and tracing to troubleshoot Grafana",
        "Turn on profiling and collect profiles"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-grafana/configure-tracing/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "75cc709ec1a4640e9474da9dbe47406005a2875e",
        "sha256": "407b054f426dee986054a8566542604fa8a11151e90e2991ebc65ee022305d76",
        "lineStart": 70,
        "lineEnd": 70,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-grafana/configure-tracing/index.md#L70-L70"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.e8b4fca7a62e34cf3eeb",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "When experiencing high CPU usage it's suggested to collect CPU profiles over a period of time, e.g. 30 seconds.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure profiling and tracing to troubleshoot Grafana",
        "Turn on profiling and collect profiles"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-grafana/configure-tracing/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "75cc709ec1a4640e9474da9dbe47406005a2875e",
        "sha256": "407b054f426dee986054a8566542604fa8a11151e90e2991ebc65ee022305d76",
        "lineStart": 78,
        "lineEnd": 78,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-grafana/configure-tracing/index.md#L78-L78"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.a89409d61046021ed05f",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "You can then use pprof tool to analyze the collected CPU profile:",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure profiling and tracing to troubleshoot Grafana",
        "Turn on profiling and collect profiles"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-grafana/configure-tracing/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "75cc709ec1a4640e9474da9dbe47406005a2875e",
        "sha256": "407b054f426dee986054a8566542604fa8a11151e90e2991ebc65ee022305d76",
        "lineStart": 84,
        "lineEnd": 84,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-grafana/configure-tracing/index.md#L84-L84"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.95b0e68af70efde4d673",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "The `grafana-server` can be started with the arguments `-tracing` to enable tracing and `-tracing-file` to override the default trace file (`trace.out`) where trace result is written to. For example:",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure profiling and tracing to troubleshoot Grafana",
        "Use tracing"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-grafana/configure-tracing/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "75cc709ec1a4640e9474da9dbe47406005a2875e",
        "sha256": "407b054f426dee986054a8566542604fa8a11151e90e2991ebc65ee022305d76",
        "lineStart": 92,
        "lineEnd": 92,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-grafana/configure-tracing/index.md#L92-L92"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.a512688e2f043103384d",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "You can configure or override profiling settings using environment variables:",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure profiling and tracing to troubleshoot Grafana",
        "Use tracing"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-grafana/configure-tracing/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "75cc709ec1a4640e9474da9dbe47406005a2875e",
        "sha256": "407b054f426dee986054a8566542604fa8a11151e90e2991ebc65ee022305d76",
        "lineStart": 98,
        "lineEnd": 98,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-grafana/configure-tracing/index.md#L98-L98"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.d18f0b77377179bbabca",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Grafana can write its own distributed traces to a local file in OpenTelemetry Protocol (OTLP) JSON format, without a collector or a tracing backend. This helps you get traces for debugging without setting up the backend: turn on the exporter, reproduce the issue, then collect and share the file.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure profiling and tracing to troubleshoot Grafana",
        "Export traces to a file"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-grafana/configure-tracing/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "75cc709ec1a4640e9474da9dbe47406005a2875e",
        "sha256": "407b054f426dee986054a8566542604fa8a11151e90e2991ebc65ee022305d76",
        "lineStart": 118,
        "lineEnd": 118,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-grafana/configure-tracing/index.md#L118-L118"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.a32c2678976af902ebeb",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Don't use this exporter as a permanent configuration. Use it to troubleshoot issues in Grafana, then turn it off.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure profiling and tracing to troubleshoot Grafana",
        "Export traces to a file"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-grafana/configure-tracing/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "75cc709ec1a4640e9474da9dbe47406005a2875e",
        "sha256": "407b054f426dee986054a8566542604fa8a11151e90e2991ebc65ee022305d76",
        "lineStart": 121,
        "lineEnd": 121,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-grafana/configure-tracing/index.md#L121-L121"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.3c071b07cc5acd67d124",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "To turn it on, set a `path` in the `[tracing.opentelemetry.file]` section. Grafana uses this exporter only when you haven't configured a `tracing.opentelemetry.jaeger` or `tracing.opentelemetry.otlp` endpoint. Grafana limits each capture by file size and duration to protect disk space.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure profiling and tracing to troubleshoot Grafana",
        "Export traces to a file"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-grafana/configure-tracing/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "75cc709ec1a4640e9474da9dbe47406005a2875e",
        "sha256": "407b054f426dee986054a8566542604fa8a11151e90e2991ebc65ee022305d76",
        "lineStart": 126,
        "lineEnd": 126,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-grafana/configure-tracing/index.md#L126-L126"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.b20ca516b054e692f63b",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "To view the captured file, open Grafana, go to **Explore**, select a Tempo data source, and select **Import trace**.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure profiling and tracing to troubleshoot Grafana",
        "Export traces to a file"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-grafana/configure-tracing/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "75cc709ec1a4640e9474da9dbe47406005a2875e",
        "sha256": "407b054f426dee986054a8566542604fa8a11151e90e2991ebc65ee022305d76",
        "lineStart": 135,
        "lineEnd": 135,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-grafana/configure-tracing/index.md#L135-L135"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.3b794f9638fabd6e335b",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "This page describes Grafana Enterprise-specific configuration options that you can specify in a `.ini` configuration file or using environment variables. Refer to [Configuration](../) for more information about available configuration options.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure Grafana Enterprise"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-grafana/enterprise-configuration/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "51174e643296aefdf7f2a277d5fe604eeb1d2300",
        "sha256": "43ec22c446ce6485d8d3dc90918a7efc784c7b19118c82019ee5ab6cb8881586",
        "lineStart": 14,
        "lineEnd": 14,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-grafana/enterprise-configuration/index.md#L14-L14"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "excluded-by-explicit-document-products",
        "products": [
          "enterprise"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.7a78ceb561cd420872e6",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "When set to the text representation (i.e. content of the license file) of the license, Grafana will evaluate and apply the given license to the instance.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure Grafana Enterprise",
        "[enterprise]",
        "license_text"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-grafana/enterprise-configuration/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "51174e643296aefdf7f2a277d5fe604eeb1d2300",
        "sha256": "43ec22c446ce6485d8d3dc90918a7efc784c7b19118c82019ee5ab6cb8881586",
        "lineStart": 25,
        "lineEnd": 27,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-grafana/enterprise-configuration/index.md#L25-L27"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "excluded-by-explicit-document-products",
        "products": [
          "enterprise"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.3dd80c9943c7801dcaae",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "When enabled, Grafana will send the license and usage statistics to the license issuer. If the license has been updated on the issuer's side to be valid for a different number of users or a new duration, your Grafana instance will be updated with the new terms automatically. Defaults to `true`.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure Grafana Enterprise",
        "[enterprise]",
        "auto_refresh_license"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-grafana/enterprise-configuration/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "51174e643296aefdf7f2a277d5fe604eeb1d2300",
        "sha256": "43ec22c446ce6485d8d3dc90918a7efc784c7b19118c82019ee5ab6cb8881586",
        "lineStart": 31,
        "lineEnd": 35,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-grafana/enterprise-configuration/index.md#L31-L35"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "excluded-by-explicit-document-products",
        "products": [
          "enterprise"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.3fe15a3d01a865398b9b",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "The license only automatically updates once per day. To immediately update the terms for a license, use the Grafana UI to renew your license token.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure Grafana Enterprise",
        "[enterprise]",
        "auto_refresh_license"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-grafana/enterprise-configuration/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "51174e643296aefdf7f2a277d5fe604eeb1d2300",
        "sha256": "43ec22c446ce6485d8d3dc90918a7efc784c7b19118c82019ee5ab6cb8881586",
        "lineStart": 38,
        "lineEnd": 38,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-grafana/enterprise-configuration/index.md#L38-L38"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "excluded-by-explicit-document-products",
        "products": [
          "enterprise"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.63407bd658f9f8b6e51c",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "When set to `aws`, Grafana will validate its license status with Amazon Web Services (AWS) instead of with Grafana Labs. Only use this setting if you purchased an Enterprise license from AWS Marketplace. Defaults to empty, which means that by default Grafana Enterprise will validate using a license issued by Grafana Labs. For details about licenses issued by AWS, refer to [Activate a Grafana Enterprise license purchased through AWS Marketplace](../../../administration/enterprise-licensing/activate-aws-marketplace-license/).",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure Grafana Enterprise",
        "[enterprise]",
        "license_validation_type"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-grafana/enterprise-configuration/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "51174e643296aefdf7f2a277d5fe604eeb1d2300",
        "sha256": "43ec22c446ce6485d8d3dc90918a7efc784c7b19118c82019ee5ab6cb8881586",
        "lineStart": 43,
