      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Maximum number of times the following reporting rendering requests are retried before returning an error: generating PDFs, generating embedded dashboard images for report emails, and generating attached CSV files. Default is `0`, which means it is disabled.",
