      "id": "grafana.candidate.22ae29f08ebb6aa42b5e",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Only available for the HTTP client. Disabled by default. How many events, in bytes, to accumulate in a single batch before sending it to Loki. Whichever threshold is hit first between `batch_wait_duration` and `batch_size_bytes` triggers the batch to be sent to Loki. If you want to always wait for the `batch_wait_duration`, set `batch_size_bytes` to a very high number. To enable batching, you must also set the `batch_wait_duration` configuration option.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure Grafana Enterprise",
        "[auditing.logs.loki]",
        "batch_size_bytes"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-grafana/enterprise-configuration/index.md",
