      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "A space-separated list of memcached servers. Example: `memcached-server-1:11211 memcached-server-2:11212 memcached-server-3:11211`. Or if there's only one server: `memcached-server:11211`.",
      "headingPath": [
