      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Most [generally available](https://grafana.com/docs/release-life-cycle/#general-availability) features are enabled by default. You can disable these feature by setting the feature flag to \"false\" in the configuration.",
