    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.47b2e95ff1e2ebfb4181",
      "syntaxRole": "procedural-step",
      "sourceText": "1. Set up a data source and configure it to send data source connections through the proxy.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure a data source SOCKS5 connection proxy",
        "Steps"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-grafana/proxy/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "c448b252ccec059d4e758d73c4e571b92ff5d33e",
        "sha256": "d62dca82e3dcabad631b0cd3abdc25e493a3c78a08d4bfb799a27cae80b2be10",
        "lineStart": 45,
        "lineEnd": 45,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-grafana/proxy/index.md#L45-L45"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.ef20cfc6e722849556d3",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "To configure your data sources to send connections through the proxy, `enableSecureSocksProxy=true` must be specified in the data source json. You can do this in the [API](../../../developers/http_api/data_source/) or use [file based provisioning](../../../administration/provisioning/#data-sources).",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure a data source SOCKS5 connection proxy",
        "Steps"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-grafana/proxy/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "c448b252ccec059d4e758d73c4e571b92ff5d33e",
        "sha256": "d62dca82e3dcabad631b0cd3abdc25e493a3c78a08d4bfb799a27cae80b2be10",
        "lineStart": 47,
        "lineEnd": 47,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-grafana/proxy/index.md#L47-L47"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.5ec56f5afbafe3903eb0",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Additionally, if using SOCKS5 authentication, you can set the SOCKS5 username and password by adding `secureSocksProxyUsername` in the data source's `jsonData` field and `secureSocksProxyPassword` in the data source's `secureJsonData` field.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure a data source SOCKS5 connection proxy",
        "Steps"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-grafana/proxy/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "c448b252ccec059d4e758d73c4e571b92ff5d33e",
        "sha256": "d62dca82e3dcabad631b0cd3abdc25e493a3c78a08d4bfb799a27cae80b2be10",
        "lineStart": 49,
        "lineEnd": 49,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-grafana/proxy/index.md#L49-L49"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.b6d5d245a3c7cdeeecf5",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "This functionality is deprecated and will be removed in a future release. For configuring SAML authentication, please use the new [SSO settings API](../../../developers/http_api/sso-settings/).",
      "headingPath": [
        "Settings updates at runtime"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-grafana/settings-updates-at-runtime/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "b3667bbf9771fe45d85c598660c42b6986801450",
        "sha256": "ee807afb8e2274f561d14247f34feee43e3a51d6fcdc4c4fd21e54eb08671d90",
        "lineStart": 20,
        "lineEnd": 20,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-grafana/settings-updates-at-runtime/index.md#L20-L20"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.19412f1ad99e0f30cac7",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "By updating settings at runtime, you can update Grafana settings without needing to restart the Grafana server.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Settings updates at runtime"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-grafana/settings-updates-at-runtime/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "b3667bbf9771fe45d85c598660c42b6986801450",
        "sha256": "ee807afb8e2274f561d14247f34feee43e3a51d6fcdc4c4fd21e54eb08671d90",
        "lineStart": 23,
        "lineEnd": 23,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-grafana/settings-updates-at-runtime/index.md#L23-L23"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.9ced448e2d7d853a2604",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Updates that happen at runtime are stored in the database and override [settings from other sources](../) (arguments, environment variables, settings file, etc). Therefore, every time a specific setting key is removed at runtime, the value used for that key is the inherited one from the other sources in the reverse order of precedence (`arguments > environment variables > settings file`). When no value is provided through any of these options, then the value used will be the application default",
      "headingPath": [
        "Settings updates at runtime"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-grafana/settings-updates-at-runtime/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "b3667bbf9771fe45d85c598660c42b6986801450",
        "sha256": "ee807afb8e2274f561d14247f34feee43e3a51d6fcdc4c4fd21e54eb08671d90",
        "lineStart": 25,
        "lineEnd": 29,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-grafana/settings-updates-at-runtime/index.md#L25-L29"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.8491ab225e2c17cf7afe",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Currently, **it only supports updates on the `auth.saml` section.**",
      "headingPath": [
        "Settings updates at runtime"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-grafana/settings-updates-at-runtime/index.md",
