    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.5e0dab6d33dca73a28dc",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "You can update settings through the [Admin API](../../../developers/http_api/admin/#update-settings).",
      "headingPath": [
        "Settings updates at runtime",
        "Update settings via the API"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-grafana/settings-updates-at-runtime/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "b3667bbf9771fe45d85c598660c42b6986801450",
        "sha256": "ee807afb8e2274f561d14247f34feee43e3a51d6fcdc4c4fd21e54eb08671d90",
        "lineStart": 35,
        "lineEnd": 35,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-grafana/settings-updates-at-runtime/index.md#L35-L35"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.cf6a6943ca9bc235648a",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "When you submit a settings update via API, Grafana verifies if the given settings updates are allowed and valid. If they are, then Grafana stores the settings in the database and reloads Grafana services with no need to restart the instance.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Settings updates at runtime",
        "Update settings via the API"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-grafana/settings-updates-at-runtime/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "b3667bbf9771fe45d85c598660c42b6986801450",
        "sha256": "ee807afb8e2274f561d14247f34feee43e3a51d6fcdc4c4fd21e54eb08671d90",
        "lineStart": 37,
        "lineEnd": 38,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-grafana/settings-updates-at-runtime/index.md#L37-L38"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.a8ad01e98d0d63647c35",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "So, the payload of a `PUT` request to the update settings endpoint (`/api/admin/settings`) should contain (either one or both):",
      "headingPath": [
        "Settings updates at runtime",
        "Update settings via the API"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-grafana/settings-updates-at-runtime/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "b3667bbf9771fe45d85c598660c42b6986801450",
        "sha256": "ee807afb8e2274f561d14247f34feee43e3a51d6fcdc4c4fd21e54eb08671d90",
        "lineStart": 40,
        "lineEnd": 41,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-grafana/settings-updates-at-runtime/index.md#L40-L41"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.9baf18897abd543c4c6b",
      "syntaxRole": "list-item",
      "sourceText": "- An `updates` map with a key, and a value per section you want to set.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Settings updates at runtime",
        "Update settings via the API"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-grafana/settings-updates-at-runtime/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "b3667bbf9771fe45d85c598660c42b6986801450",
        "sha256": "ee807afb8e2274f561d14247f34feee43e3a51d6fcdc4c4fd21e54eb08671d90",
        "lineStart": 43,
        "lineEnd": 43,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-grafana/settings-updates-at-runtime/index.md#L43-L43"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.63753791f5994c927b38",
      "syntaxRole": "list-item",
      "sourceText": "- A `removals` list with keys per section you want to unset.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Settings updates at runtime",
        "Update settings via the API"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-grafana/settings-updates-at-runtime/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "b3667bbf9771fe45d85c598660c42b6986801450",
