      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.7caec04a1ab650393e94",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "it would enable SAML and disable single logouts. And, if you provide the following `removals`:",
      "headingPath": [
        "Settings updates at runtime",
        "Update settings via the API"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-grafana/settings-updates-at-runtime/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "b3667bbf9771fe45d85c598660c42b6986801450",
        "sha256": "ee807afb8e2274f561d14247f34feee43e3a51d6fcdc4c4fd21e54eb08671d90",
        "lineStart": 59,
        "lineEnd": 59,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-grafana/settings-updates-at-runtime/index.md#L59-L59"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.d69224f7ede61dc76bfd",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "it would remove the key/value setting identified by `allow_idp_initiated` within the `auth.saml`. So, the SAML service would be reloaded and that value would be inherited for either (settings `.ini` file, environment variable, command line arguments or any other accepted mechanism to provide configuration).",
      "headingPath": [
        "Settings updates at runtime",
        "Update settings via the API"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-grafana/settings-updates-at-runtime/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "b3667bbf9771fe45d85c598660c42b6986801450",
        "sha256": "ee807afb8e2274f561d14247f34feee43e3a51d6fcdc4c4fd21e54eb08671d90",
        "lineStart": 69,
        "lineEnd": 71,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-grafana/settings-updates-at-runtime/index.md#L69-L71"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.873e53005ee879a68e2e",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "In case any of these settings cannot be overridden nor valid, it would return an error and these settings won't be persisted into the database.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Settings updates at runtime",
        "Update settings via the API"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-grafana/settings-updates-at-runtime/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "b3667bbf9771fe45d85c598660c42b6986801450",
        "sha256": "ee807afb8e2274f561d14247f34feee43e3a51d6fcdc4c4fd21e54eb08671d90",
        "lineStart": 89,
        "lineEnd": 90,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-grafana/settings-updates-at-runtime/index.md#L89-L90"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.b5978cb91ccb555de892",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Grafana Enterprise has a built-in scheduled background job that looks into the database every minute for settings updates. If there are updates, it reloads the Grafana services affected by the detected changes.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Settings updates at runtime",
        "Background job (high availability set-ups)"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-grafana/settings-updates-at-runtime/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "b3667bbf9771fe45d85c598660c42b6986801450",
        "sha256": "ee807afb8e2274f561d14247f34feee43e3a51d6fcdc4c4fd21e54eb08671d90",
        "lineStart": 94,
        "lineEnd": 95,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-grafana/settings-updates-at-runtime/index.md#L94-L95"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "mixed-edition-statement-requires-review",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.5336a7055e558d5dcd9b",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "The background job synchronizes settings between instances in a highly available set-up. So, after you perform some changes through the HTTP API, then the other instances are synchronized through the database and the background job.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Settings updates at runtime",
        "Background job (high availability set-ups)"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-grafana/settings-updates-at-runtime/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "b3667bbf9771fe45d85c598660c42b6986801450",
        "sha256": "ee807afb8e2274f561d14247f34feee43e3a51d6fcdc4c4fd21e54eb08671d90",
        "lineStart": 97,
        "lineEnd": 98,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-grafana/settings-updates-at-runtime/index.md#L97-L98"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.32388e8b902ae2057ad7",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "If you have [role-based access control](../../../administration/roles-and-permissions/access-control/) enabled, you can control who can read or update settings. Refer to the [Admin API](../../../developers/http_api/admin/#update-settings) for more information.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Settings updates at runtime",
        "Control access with role-based access control"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-grafana/settings-updates-at-runtime/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "b3667bbf9771fe45d85c598660c42b6986801450",
        "sha256": "ee807afb8e2274f561d14247f34feee43e3a51d6fcdc4c4fd21e54eb08671d90",
        "lineStart": 102,
        "lineEnd": 103,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-grafana/settings-updates-at-runtime/index.md#L102-L103"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.89873a8379af24bad953",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "If you run non-Grafana web services on your Grafana server or within its local network, then they might be vulnerable to exploitation through the Grafana data source proxy or other methods.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure security"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-security/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "b03577d38dce2ab1a5c66d28a8c0e3a64ad010d1",
        "sha256": "ab2ebce89e774730bf06fc3646fd01cf7490718548ad32e4d080c0fec125251f",
        "lineStart": 16,
        "lineEnd": 16,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-security/_index.md#L16-L16"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.08c303b2dac304399e27",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "You can configure Grafana to only allow certain IP addresses or hostnames to be used as data source URLs and proxied through the Grafana data source proxy. Refer to [data_source_proxy_whitelist](../configure-grafana/#data_source_proxy_whitelist) for usage instructions.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure security",
        "Limit IP addresses/hostnames for data source URL"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-security/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "b03577d38dce2ab1a5c66d28a8c0e3a64ad010d1",
        "sha256": "ab2ebce89e774730bf06fc3646fd01cf7490718548ad32e4d080c0fec125251f",
        "lineStart": 22,
        "lineEnd": 22,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-security/_index.md#L22-L22"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.4116d582a3be1424fab9",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "The request security configuration option allows users to limit requests from the Grafana server. It targets requests that are generated by users. For more information, refer to [Request security](configure-request-security/).",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure security",
        "Request security"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-security/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "b03577d38dce2ab1a5c66d28a8c0e3a64ad010d1",
        "sha256": "ab2ebce89e774730bf06fc3646fd01cf7490718548ad32e4d080c0fec125251f",
        "lineStart": 26,
        "lineEnd": 26,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-security/_index.md#L26-L26"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.a7f6c2f0574267423ad2",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Configure a firewall to restrict Grafana from making network requests to sensitive internal web services.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure security",
        "Firewall rules"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-security/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "b03577d38dce2ab1a5c66d28a8c0e3a64ad010d1",
        "sha256": "ab2ebce89e774730bf06fc3646fd01cf7490718548ad32e4d080c0fec125251f",
        "lineStart": 34,
        "lineEnd": 34,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-security/_index.md#L34-L34"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.a05000c841fc86c4889d",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "There are many firewall tools available. Refer to the documentation for your specific security tool. For example, Linux users can use [iptables](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Iptables).",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure security",
        "Firewall rules"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-security/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "b03577d38dce2ab1a5c66d28a8c0e3a64ad010d1",
        "sha256": "ab2ebce89e774730bf06fc3646fd01cf7490718548ad32e4d080c0fec125251f",
        "lineStart": 36,
        "lineEnd": 36,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-security/_index.md#L36-L36"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.bf7554531f6f7b01d49a",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "You can require all network requests made by Grafana to go through a proxy server.",
      "headingPath": [
