    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.eb6a76d916d8d8a2f8dd",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "The console exporter is only available in Grafana Enterprise.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Audit a Grafana instance",
        "Configure audit logging",
        "Console exporter"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-security/audit-grafana.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "a9fcf3dc960f2d43a8ec00029c536b2c8f420635",
        "sha256": "b6963213d04b5904eb5810639906d3d281e3b6eed681456732071846799d65f2",
        "lineStart": 476,
        "lineEnd": 476,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-security/audit-grafana.md#L476-L476"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "excluded-by-explicit-document-products",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.7635f811ef40f56b0808",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Audit logs are sent to the Grafana default logger. The audit logs use the `auditing.console` logger and are logged on `debug`-level. To learn how to enable debug logging, refer to the [log configuration](https://grafana.com/docs/grafana/<GRAFANA_VERSION>/setup-grafana/configure-grafana/#log) section. Accessing the audit logs in this way isn't recommended for production use.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Audit a Grafana instance",
        "Configure audit logging",
        "Console exporter"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-security/audit-grafana.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "a9fcf3dc960f2d43a8ec00029c536b2c8f420635",
        "sha256": "b6963213d04b5904eb5810639906d3d281e3b6eed681456732071846799d65f2",
        "lineStart": 479,
        "lineEnd": 479,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-security/audit-grafana.md#L479-L479"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "excluded-by-explicit-document-products",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.98ea77e7ed20ad81dfee",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Grafana’s database contains secrets, which are used to query data sources, send alert notifications, and perform other functions within Grafana.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure database encryption"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-security/configure-database-encryption/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "936ab7c1d208cbcd86c66db25b399c78675a122b",
        "sha256": "511e359127e5ceaf00a6eeb39834e100fdb31f51a3261d71f49ab872f60129bc",
        "lineStart": 17,
        "lineEnd": 17,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-security/configure-database-encryption/_index.md#L17-L17"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.f851cea66ec68696ea09",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Grafana encrypts these secrets before they are written to the database, by using a symmetric-key encryption algorithm called Advanced Encryption Standard (AES). These secrets are signed using a [secret key](../../configure-grafana/#secret_key) that you can change when you configure a new Grafana instance.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure database encryption"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-security/configure-database-encryption/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "936ab7c1d208cbcd86c66db25b399c78675a122b",
        "sha256": "511e359127e5ceaf00a6eeb39834e100fdb31f51a3261d71f49ab872f60129bc",
        "lineStart": 19,
        "lineEnd": 19,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-security/configure-database-encryption/_index.md#L19-L19"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.baead133a5ed98cd3b90",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Grafana v9.0 and newer use [envelope encryption](#envelope-encryption) by default, which adds a layer of indirection to the encryption process that introduces an [**implicit breaking change**](#implicit-breaking-change) for older versions of Grafana.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure database encryption"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-security/configure-database-encryption/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "936ab7c1d208cbcd86c66db25b399c78675a122b",
        "sha256": "511e359127e5ceaf00a6eeb39834e100fdb31f51a3261d71f49ab872f60129bc",
        "lineStart": 22,
        "lineEnd": 22,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-security/configure-database-encryption/_index.md#L22-L22"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.7015b8cb2bea40f91fa5",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "In Grafana Enterprise, you can also [encrypt secrets in AES-GCM (Galois/Counter Mode)](#changing-your-encryption-mode-to-aes-gcm) instead of the default AES-CFB (Cipher FeedBack mode).",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure database encryption"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-security/configure-database-encryption/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "936ab7c1d208cbcd86c66db25b399c78675a122b",
        "sha256": "511e359127e5ceaf00a6eeb39834e100fdb31f51a3261d71f49ab872f60129bc",
        "lineStart": 28,
        "lineEnd": 28,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-security/configure-database-encryption/_index.md#L28-L28"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "mixed-edition-statement-requires-review",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.e57342ac87ef6549986c",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Since Grafana v9.0, you can turn envelope encryption off by adding the feature toggle `disableEnvelopeEncryption` to your [Grafana configuration](../../configure-grafana/#feature_toggles).",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure database encryption",
        "Envelope encryption"
      ],
