    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.f6c363d88299d724313f",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "To roll back secrets, use the [Grafana CLI](../../../cli/) by running the `grafana cli admin secrets-migration rollback` command or the `/encryption/rollback-secrets` endpoint of the Grafana [Admin API](../../../developers/http_api/admin/#re-encrypt-secrets). It's safe to run more than once, more recommended under maintenance mode.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure database encryption",
