    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.f6cf2d2205736c0202d8",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "To re-encrypt data keys, use the [Grafana CLI](../../../cli/) by running the `grafana cli admin secrets-migration re-encrypt-data-keys` command or the `/encryption/reencrypt-data-keys` endpoint of the Grafana [Admin API](../../../developers/http_api/admin/#re-encrypt-data-encryption-keys). It's safe to run more than once, more recommended under maintenance mode.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure database encryption",
        "Operational work",
        "Re-encrypt data keys"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-security/configure-database-encryption/_index.md",
