    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.dd53adda5c2b4ed927de",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "If you are using Grafana Enterprise, you can integrate with a key management service (KMS) provider, and change Grafana’s cryptographic mode of operation from AES-CFB to AES-GCM.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure database encryption",
        "Encrypting your database with a key from a key management service (KMS)"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-security/configure-database-encryption/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "936ab7c1d208cbcd86c66db25b399c78675a122b",
        "sha256": "511e359127e5ceaf00a6eeb39834e100fdb31f51a3261d71f49ab872f60129bc",
        "lineStart": 92,
        "lineEnd": 92,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-security/configure-database-encryption/_index.md#L92-L92"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "mixed-edition-statement-requires-review",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.9d3d18e26fe1074d4dfa",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "You can choose to encrypt secrets stored in the Grafana database using a key from a KMS, which is a secure central storage location that is designed to help you to create and manage cryptographic keys and control their use across many services. When you integrate with a KMS, Grafana does not directly store your encryption key. Instead, Grafana stores KMS credentials and the identifier of the key, which Grafana uses to encrypt the database.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure database encryption",
        "Encrypting your database with a key from a key management service (KMS)"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-security/configure-database-encryption/_index.md",
