    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.3d4876167a3f5e5b2f7e",
      "syntaxRole": "procedural-step",
      "sourceText": "8. (Optional) From the command line and the root directory of Grafana Enterprise, re-encrypt all of the secrets within the Grafana database with the new key using the following command:",
      "headingPath": [
        "Encrypt database secrets using Hashicorp Vault"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-security/configure-database-encryption/encrypt-secrets-using-hashicorp-key-vault/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "feee0cda4fb503bde046c381a13520ddce784e1a",
