    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.0327bafbed8ce63e66b0",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "If you do not re-encrypt existing secrets, then they will remain encrypted by the previous encryption key. Users will still be able to access them.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Encrypt database secrets using Hashicorp Vault"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-security/configure-database-encryption/encrypt-secrets-using-hashicorp-key-vault/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "feee0cda4fb503bde046c381a13520ddce784e1a",
        "sha256": "7cd641acc544cd2c916d21b4bbf9044b31d793fddbc60bea6c9b1e652bb61c7b",
        "lineStart": 75,
        "lineEnd": 75,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-security/configure-database-encryption/encrypt-secrets-using-hashicorp-key-vault/index.md#L75-L75"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "excluded-by-explicit-document-products",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.e719d38dfd26e0eb1305",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "**> Note:** If you are updating this encryption key during the initial setup of Grafana before any data sources or dashboards have been created, then this step is not necessary because there are no secrets in Grafana to migrate.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Encrypt database secrets using Hashicorp Vault"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-security/configure-database-encryption/encrypt-secrets-using-hashicorp-key-vault/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "feee0cda4fb503bde046c381a13520ddce784e1a",
        "sha256": "7cd641acc544cd2c916d21b4bbf9044b31d793fddbc60bea6c9b1e652bb61c7b",
        "lineStart": 79,
        "lineEnd": 79,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-security/configure-database-encryption/encrypt-secrets-using-hashicorp-key-vault/index.md#L79-L79"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "excluded-by-explicit-document-products",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.80e06578b0f44caefe31",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "If you manage your secrets with [Hashicorp Vault](https://www.hashicorp.com/products/vault), you can use them for [Configuration](../../../configure-grafana/) and [Provisioning](../../../../administration/provisioning/).",
      "headingPath": [
        "Integrate Grafana with Hashicorp Vault"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-security/configure-database-encryption/integrate-with-hashicorp-vault/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "0ebe1aee927937de30e79825a779313594cdefde",
        "sha256": "96927d471f537ca2b4d741b257285e66796c9cc33b3f7361fb393ce5f2ba4a02",
        "lineStart": 15,
        "lineEnd": 15,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-security/configure-database-encryption/integrate-with-hashicorp-vault/index.md#L15-L15"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "excluded-by-explicit-document-products",
        "products": [
          "enterprise"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.864e4ff8464b1ea85a91",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "If you have Grafana [set up for high availability](../../../set-up-for-high-availability/), then we advise not to use dynamic secrets for provisioning files. Each Grafana instance is responsible for renewing its own leases. Your data source leases might expire when one of your Grafana servers shuts down.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Integrate Grafana with Hashicorp Vault"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-security/configure-database-encryption/integrate-with-hashicorp-vault/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "0ebe1aee927937de30e79825a779313594cdefde",
        "sha256": "96927d471f537ca2b4d741b257285e66796c9cc33b3f7361fb393ce5f2ba4a02",
        "lineStart": 22,
        "lineEnd": 23,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-security/configure-database-encryption/integrate-with-hashicorp-vault/index.md#L22-L23"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "excluded-by-explicit-document-products",
        "products": [
          "enterprise"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.21e9895265a5db73a21f",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Before using Vault, you need to activate it by providing a URL, authentication method (currently only token), and a token for your Vault service. Grafana automatically renews the service token if it is renewable and set up with a limited lifetime.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Integrate Grafana with Hashicorp Vault",
        "Configuration"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-security/configure-database-encryption/integrate-with-hashicorp-vault/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "0ebe1aee927937de30e79825a779313594cdefde",
        "sha256": "96927d471f537ca2b4d741b257285e66796c9cc33b3f7361fb393ce5f2ba4a02",
        "lineStart": 28,
        "lineEnd": 30,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-security/configure-database-encryption/integrate-with-hashicorp-vault/index.md#L28-L30"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "excluded-by-explicit-document-products",
        "products": [
          "enterprise"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.cd662ab1e608c3868452",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "If you're using short-lived leases, then you can also configure how often Grafana should renew the lease and for how long. We recommend keeping the defaults unless you run into problems.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Integrate Grafana with Hashicorp Vault",
        "Configuration"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-security/configure-database-encryption/integrate-with-hashicorp-vault/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "0ebe1aee927937de30e79825a779313594cdefde",
        "sha256": "96927d471f537ca2b4d741b257285e66796c9cc33b3f7361fb393ce5f2ba4a02",
        "lineStart": 32,
        "lineEnd": 32,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-security/configure-database-encryption/integrate-with-hashicorp-vault/index.md#L32-L32"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "excluded-by-explicit-document-products",
        "products": [
          "enterprise"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.9cac02e5efd0d8e131b6",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "After you configure Vault, you must set the configuration or provisioning files you wish to use Vault. Vault configuration is an extension of configuration's [variable expansion](../../../configure-grafana/#variable-expansion) and follows the `$__vault{<argument>}` syntax.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Integrate Grafana with Hashicorp Vault",
        "Using the Vault expander"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-security/configure-database-encryption/integrate-with-hashicorp-vault/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "0ebe1aee927937de30e79825a779313594cdefde",
        "sha256": "96927d471f537ca2b4d741b257285e66796c9cc33b3f7361fb393ce5f2ba4a02",
        "lineStart": 64,
        "lineEnd": 66,
