    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.317b8ad1b12d4bc4bc36",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "For example, if you place a Key/Value secret for the Grafana admin user in _secret/grafana/admin_defaults_ the syntax for accessing its _password_ field would be `$__vault{kv:secret/grafana/admin_defaults:password}`.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Integrate Grafana with Hashicorp Vault",
        "Using the Vault expander"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-security/configure-database-encryption/integrate-with-hashicorp-vault/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "0ebe1aee927937de30e79825a779313594cdefde",
        "sha256": "96927d471f537ca2b4d741b257285e66796c9cc33b3f7361fb393ce5f2ba4a02",
        "lineStart": 74,
        "lineEnd": 75,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-security/configure-database-encryption/integrate-with-hashicorp-vault/index.md#L74-L75"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "excluded-by-explicit-document-products",
        "products": [
          "enterprise"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.c92073c3c10cbf97d2f5",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Vault supports many secrets engines which represents different methods for storing or generating secrets when requested by an authorized user. Grafana supports a subset of these which are most likely to be relevant for a Grafana installation.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Integrate Grafana with Hashicorp Vault",
        "Using the Vault expander",
        "Secrets engines"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-security/configure-database-encryption/integrate-with-hashicorp-vault/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "0ebe1aee927937de30e79825a779313594cdefde",
        "sha256": "96927d471f537ca2b4d741b257285e66796c9cc33b3f7361fb393ce5f2ba4a02",
        "lineStart": 79,
        "lineEnd": 80,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-security/configure-database-encryption/integrate-with-hashicorp-vault/index.md#L79-L80"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "excluded-by-explicit-document-products",
        "products": [
          "enterprise"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.ecb28f9a0f5c7cbebd60",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Grafana supports Vault's [K/V version 2](https://www.vaultproject.io/docs/secrets/kv/kv-v2) storage engine which is used to store and retrieve arbitrary secrets as `kv`.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Integrate Grafana with Hashicorp Vault",
        "Using the Vault expander",
        "Secrets engines",
        "Key/Value"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-security/configure-database-encryption/integrate-with-hashicorp-vault/index.md",
