    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.8a2c54d98cbe754887e1",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "The Vault [databases secrets engines](https://www.vaultproject.io/docs/secrets/databases) is a family of secret engines which shares a similar syntax and grants the user dynamic access to a database. You can use this both for setting up Grafana's own database access and for provisioning data sources.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Integrate Grafana with Hashicorp Vault",
        "Using the Vault expander",
        "Secrets engines",
        "Databases"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-security/configure-database-encryption/integrate-with-hashicorp-vault/index.md",
