      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.10d290757a1aa05ca864",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Grafana includes a few additional headers that you can configure to help mitigate against certain attacks, such as XSS.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure security hardening",
        "Security headers"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-security/configure-security-hardening/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "3d53e64d215efc829e6827f523ce8947fa777722",
        "sha256": "a854d8317e4a2fc51bb82f7a31ee6438dc48f45d8ae483e504521c35e34c73df",
        "lineStart": 74,
        "lineEnd": 74,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-security/configure-security-hardening/index.md#L74-L74"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.b6e0c329afb2f73202b5",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "A content security policy (CSP) is an HTTP response header that controls how the web browser handles content, such as allowing inline scripts to execute or loading images from certain domains. The default CSP template is already configured to provide sufficient protection against some attacks. This makes it more difficult for attackers to execute arbitrary JavaScript if such a vulnerability is present.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure security hardening",
        "Security headers",
        "Add a Content Security Policy"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-security/configure-security-hardening/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "3d53e64d215efc829e6827f523ce8947fa777722",
        "sha256": "a854d8317e4a2fc51bb82f7a31ee6438dc48f45d8ae483e504521c35e34c73df",
        "lineStart": 78,
        "lineEnd": 78,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-security/configure-security-hardening/index.md#L78-L78"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
