    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.410f13e7719b7bcd4115",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Grafana Cloud provides provisioned dashboards for usage insights. Refer to the [Grafana Cloud documentation](/docs/grafana-cloud/usage-insights/) for more information. If you export usage insights to a separate Loki instance, these dashboards stop receiving usage insights data. This is a current limitation of the feature in Grafana Cloud.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Export logs of usage insights",
        "Configuration"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-security/export-logs.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "360cd7d594256e67be0f2db0058bf8ec8d0ca3e3",
        "sha256": "6c8e62c75630753ebed006e85830fc6e56cdd6b89d391f127231b6857723703a",
        "lineStart": 70,
        "lineEnd": 70,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-security/export-logs.md#L70-L70"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "excluded-by-explicit-document-products",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.ac9a8c0b60ecc35edd7f",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "To export your logs, enable the usage insights feature and [configure](../../configure-grafana/) an export location in the configuration file:",
      "headingPath": [
        "Export logs of usage insights",
        "Configuration"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-security/export-logs.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "360cd7d594256e67be0f2db0058bf8ec8d0ca3e3",
        "sha256": "6c8e62c75630753ebed006e85830fc6e56cdd6b89d391f127231b6857723703a",
        "lineStart": 73,
        "lineEnd": 73,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-security/export-logs.md#L73-L73"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "excluded-by-explicit-document-products",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.8d19c629a611f8850e3a",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "If the storage type is set to `loki` you'll need to also configure Grafana to export to a Loki ingestion server. To do this, you'll need Loki installed. Refer to [Install Loki](/docs/loki/latest/installation/) for instructions on how to install Loki.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Export logs of usage insights",
        "Configuration"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-security/export-logs.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "360cd7d594256e67be0f2db0058bf8ec8d0ca3e3",
        "sha256": "6c8e62c75630753ebed006e85830fc6e56cdd6b89d391f127231b6857723703a",
        "lineStart": 85,
        "lineEnd": 88,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-security/export-logs.md#L85-L88"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "excluded-by-explicit-document-products",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.a56ed084503ceaa3f471",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Using `logger` will print usage insights to your [Grafana server log](../../configure-grafana/#log). There is no option for configuring the `logger` storage type.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Export logs of usage insights",
        "Configuration"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-security/export-logs.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "360cd7d594256e67be0f2db0058bf8ec8d0ca3e3",
        "sha256": "6c8e62c75630753ebed006e85830fc6e56cdd6b89d391f127231b6857723703a",
        "lineStart": 111,
        "lineEnd": 112,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-security/export-logs.md#L111-L112"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "excluded-by-explicit-document-products",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.8507c1de5d952568d8a5",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "If you export logs into Loki, you can build Grafana dashboards to understand your Grafana instance usage.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Export logs of usage insights",
        "Visualize Loki usage insights in Grafana"
      ],
      "source": {
