    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.9f7d6a16059fdad9e930",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "With Grafana, you can use the GitHub Secret Scanning service to determine if your [service account tokens](../../../administration/service-accounts/) have been leaked on GitHub.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure Grafana secret scanning and notifications"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-security/secret-scan.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "12597b223ae18c5c0222799e6ec44348894d8d32",
        "sha256": "12eb364d70dd1b00747a2b35d66e833d2182e657f2df3774865bb3273833304f",
        "lineStart": 14,
        "lineEnd": 14,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-security/secret-scan.md#L14-L14"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.e937fda39bf2fb2aa1fe",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "When GitHub Secret Scanning detects a Grafana secret, its hash is stored in Grafana Labs' secret scanning service.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure Grafana secret scanning and notifications"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-security/secret-scan.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "12597b223ae18c5c0222799e6ec44348894d8d32",
        "sha256": "12eb364d70dd1b00747a2b35d66e833d2182e657f2df3774865bb3273833304f",
        "lineStart": 16,
        "lineEnd": 16,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-security/secret-scan.md#L16-L16"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.e19159e13711e4fe1555",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Grafana instances, whether on-premises or on the cloud, can use this service to verify if a token generated by the instance has been made public. This verification is done by comparing the token's hash with the exposed token's hash.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure Grafana secret scanning and notifications"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-security/secret-scan.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "12597b223ae18c5c0222799e6ec44348894d8d32",
        "sha256": "12eb364d70dd1b00747a2b35d66e833d2182e657f2df3774865bb3273833304f",
        "lineStart": 18,
        "lineEnd": 18,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-security/secret-scan.md#L18-L18"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.9abc800fc9ab4998eea6",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "If the service detects a leaked token, it immediately revokes it, making it useless, and logs the event.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure Grafana secret scanning and notifications"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-security/secret-scan.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "12597b223ae18c5c0222799e6ec44348894d8d32",
        "sha256": "12eb364d70dd1b00747a2b35d66e833d2182e657f2df3774865bb3273833304f",
        "lineStart": 20,
        "lineEnd": 20,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-security/secret-scan.md#L20-L20"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.6652bd56a43f5bd474e0",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "If the `revoke` option is disabled, the service only sends a notification to the configured webhook URL and logs the event. The token is not automatically revoked.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure Grafana secret scanning and notifications"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/configure-security/secret-scan.md",
