      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "**Database:** SQLite works for local development and small evaluation instances, but isn't recommended for production environments. For production use, consider an external MySQL or PostgreSQL instance for higher reliability and growth capacity. For more information, refer to [Supported databases](#supported-databases).",
