    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.609a156d40f04256b2cf",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "SQLite isn't recommended for production environments. It works well for local development and small evaluation instances, but it doesn't scale for production workloads. If you want [high availability](https://grafana.com/docs/grafana/<GRAFANA_VERSION>/setup-grafana/set-up-for-high-availability/), you must use either a MySQL or PostgreSQL database. For information about how to define the database configuration parameters inside the `grafana.ini` file, refer to [[database]](https://grafana.com/docs/grafana/<GRAFANA_VERSION>/setup-grafana/configure-grafana/#database).",
      "headingPath": [
        "Install Grafana",
        "Supported databases"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/installation/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "0375272bc13891108a61af95a43d5fdbb29272d4",
        "sha256": "d47c19597705e01e7f35bb165ea58a752edc5fc63824e8ae3ba55574a5cf4adb",
        "lineStart": 149,
        "lineEnd": 149,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/installation/_index.md#L149-L149"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.c92ceec2b5959eadbcc1",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Grafana supports the versions of these databases that are officially supported by the project at the time a version of Grafana is released. When a Grafana version becomes unsupported, Grafana Labs might also drop support for that database version. See the links above for the support policies for each project.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Install Grafana",
        "Supported databases"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/installation/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "0375272bc13891108a61af95a43d5fdbb29272d4",
        "sha256": "d47c19597705e01e7f35bb165ea58a752edc5fc63824e8ae3ba55574a5cf4adb",
        "lineStart": 152,
        "lineEnd": 152,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/installation/_index.md#L152-L152"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.83a9c7a3fb1d94ea1a94",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Grafana binaries and images might not work with unsupported databases, even if they claim to be drop-in or replicate the API to their best. Binaries and images built with [BoringCrypto](https://pkg.go.dev/crypto/internal/boring) may have different problems than other distributions of Grafana.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Install Grafana",
        "Supported databases"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/installation/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "0375272bc13891108a61af95a43d5fdbb29272d4",
        "sha256": "d47c19597705e01e7f35bb165ea58a752edc5fc63824e8ae3ba55574a5cf4adb",
        "lineStart": 159,
        "lineEnd": 160,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/installation/_index.md#L159-L160"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.677bae2bc00f099c22e7",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "> Grafana can report errors when relying on read-only MySQL servers, such as in high-availability failover scenarios or serverless AWS Aurora MySQL. This is a known issue; for more information, see [issue #13399](https://github.com/grafana/grafana/issues/13399).",
      "headingPath": [
        "Install Grafana",
        "Supported databases"
      ],
      "source": {
