    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.9a58b61db39fc50b4c8a",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "> **Note:** The recommended and default edition of Grafana is Grafana Enterprise. It is free and includes all the features of the OSS edition. Additionally, you have the option to upgrade to the [full Enterprise feature set](/products/enterprise/?utm_source=grafana-install-page), which includes support for [Enterprise plugins](/grafana/plugins/?enterprise=1&utcm_source=grafana-install-page).",
      "headingPath": [
        "Run Grafana Docker image"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/installation/docker/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "4775409c5b7e8b32342ff84f543f3e11c51aa950",
