    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.65b079cd444c0a17d509",
      "syntaxRole": "list-item",
      "sourceText": "- `--name` assign a logical name to the container (e.g. `grafana`). This allows you to refer to the container by name instead of by ID.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Run Grafana Docker image",
