    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.bcad4da6cd8e8b6d4c96",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "The following example runs the latest stable version of Grafana, listening on port 3000, with the container named `grafana`, persistent storage in the `grafana-storage` docker volume, the server root URL set, and the official [clock panel](/grafana/plugins/grafana-clock-panel) plugin installed.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Run Grafana Docker image",
        "Example"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/installation/docker/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "4775409c5b7e8b32342ff84f543f3e11c51aa950",
        "sha256": "d22215b5401d2dbb28e4e78cd75823626dbed0af66963f21c05477a85dc715a9",
        "lineStart": 176,
        "lineEnd": 176,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/installation/docker/index.md#L176-L176"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.bce55219dc2a9cedcb3c",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Docker Compose is a software tool that makes it easy to define and share applications that consist of multiple containers. It works by using a YAML file, usually called `docker-compose.yaml`, which lists all the services that make up the application. You can start the containers in the correct order with a single command, and with another command, you can shut them down. For more information about the benefits of using Docker Compose and how to use it refer to [Use Docker Compose](https://docs.docker.com/get-started/08_using_compose/).",
      "headingPath": [
        "Run Grafana Docker image",
        "Run Grafana via Docker Compose"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/installation/docker/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "4775409c5b7e8b32342ff84f543f3e11c51aa950",
        "sha256": "d22215b5401d2dbb28e4e78cd75823626dbed0af66963f21c05477a85dc715a9",
        "lineStart": 194,
        "lineEnd": 194,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/installation/docker/index.md#L194-L194"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.e9f62859286d3bd1dbbd",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "To run Grafana via Docker Compose, install the compose tool on your machine. To determine if the compose tool is available, run the following command:",
      "headingPath": [
        "Run Grafana Docker image",
        "Run Grafana via Docker Compose",
        "Before you begin"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/installation/docker/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "4775409c5b7e8b32342ff84f543f3e11c51aa950",
        "sha256": "d22215b5401d2dbb28e4e78cd75823626dbed0af66963f21c05477a85dc715a9",
        "lineStart": 198,
        "lineEnd": 198,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/installation/docker/index.md#L198-L198"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.3ac404af4db2c4813df9",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "If the compose tool is unavailable, refer to [Install Docker Compose](https://docs.docker.com/compose/install/).",
      "headingPath": [
        "Run Grafana Docker image",
        "Run Grafana via Docker Compose",
        "Before you begin"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/installation/docker/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "4775409c5b7e8b32342ff84f543f3e11c51aa950",
