        "lineEnd": 353,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/installation/docker/index.md#L353-L353"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.7c2125042509107ef4f6",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "If you want to specify the version of a plugin, add the version number to the `GF_PLUGINS_PREINSTALL` environment variable. For example: `-e \"GF_PLUGINS_PREINSTALL=grafana-clock-panel@1.0.1,yesoreyeram-infinity-datasource@3.8.0\"`. If you do not specify a version number, the latest version is used.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Run Grafana Docker image",
        "Run Grafana via Docker Compose",
        "Example"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/installation/docker/index.md",
