    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.fa581bd1cfb51348c4a5",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Helm is a popular package manager for Kubernetes. It bundles Kubernetes resource manifests to be re-used across different environments. These manifests are written in a templating language, allowing you to provide configuration values via `values.yaml` file, or in-line using Helm, to replace the placeholders in the manifest where these configurations should reside.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Deploy Grafana using Helm Charts",
        "Customize Grafana default configuration"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/installation/helm/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "41c9c763ba14b1a634ed0d24f1f44ec54f690f7b",
        "sha256": "27cec149272554118e038bc615ca8efaa33b8bbc137764bfc16cde0fce6430bb",
        "lineStart": 188,
        "lineEnd": 188,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/installation/helm/index.md#L188-L188"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.5f0fa3e930860058c0d5",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "The `values.yaml` file allows you to customize the chart's configuration by specifying values for various parameters such as image versions, resource limits, service configurations, etc.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Deploy Grafana using Helm Charts",
        "Customize Grafana default configuration"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/installation/helm/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "41c9c763ba14b1a634ed0d24f1f44ec54f690f7b",
        "sha256": "27cec149272554118e038bc615ca8efaa33b8bbc137764bfc16cde0fce6430bb",
        "lineStart": 190,
        "lineEnd": 190,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/installation/helm/index.md#L190-L190"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.75b35294b7261c82d1b9",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "By modifying the values in the `values.yaml` file, you can tailor the deployment of a Helm chart to your specific requirements by using the helm install or upgrade commands. For more information about configuring Helm, refer to [Values Files](https://helm.sh/docs/chart_template_guide/values_files/).",
      "headingPath": [
        "Deploy Grafana using Helm Charts",
        "Customize Grafana default configuration"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/installation/helm/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "41c9c763ba14b1a634ed0d24f1f44ec54f690f7b",
        "sha256": "27cec149272554118e038bc615ca8efaa33b8bbc137764bfc16cde0fce6430bb",
        "lineStart": 192,
        "lineEnd": 192,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/installation/helm/index.md#L192-L192"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.571276b6dda26da5c328",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Depending on your use case requirements, you can use a single YAML file that contains your configuration changes or you can create multiple YAML files.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Deploy Grafana using Helm Charts",
        "Customize Grafana default configuration",
        "Download the values.yaml file"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/installation/helm/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "41c9c763ba14b1a634ed0d24f1f44ec54f690f7b",
        "sha256": "27cec149272554118e038bc615ca8efaa33b8bbc137764bfc16cde0fce6430bb",
        "lineStart": 201,
        "lineEnd": 201,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/installation/helm/index.md#L201-L201"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
