    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.321c7e880629553fa426",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "By default, the Grafana log level is set to `info`, but you can increase it to `debug` mode to fetch information needed to diagnose and troubleshoot a problem. For more information about Grafana log levels, refer to [Configuring logs](https://grafana.com/docs/grafana/latest/setup-grafana/configure-grafana#log).",
      "headingPath": [
        "Deploy Grafana using Helm Charts",
        "Troubleshooting",
        "Increase log levels"
      ],
      "source": {
