    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.c7d497445d563fdf6fbc",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Rolling updates enable deployment updates to take place with no downtime by incrementally updating Pods instances with new ones. The new Pods will be scheduled on nodes with available resources. For more information about rolling updates, refer to [Performing a Rolling Update](https://kubernetes.io/docs/tutorials/kubernetes-basics/update/update-intro/).",
      "headingPath": [
        "Deploy Grafana on Kubernetes",
        "Update an existing deployment using a rolling update strategy"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/installation/kubernetes/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "803d4f6ef66b7230aad8073b27d2701645b5bab8",
        "sha256": "512a408147ae16bdd9395abbb50d889e50607a2a2236b02e173a1b1fecaf2ba4",
        "lineStart": 345,
        "lineEnd": 345,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/installation/kubernetes/index.md#L345-L345"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.9ae43ff6fb5f65214103",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "The following steps use the `kubectl annotate` command to add the metadata and keep track of the deployment. For more information about `kubectl annotate`, refer to [kubectl annotate documentation](https://jamesdefabia.github.io/docs/user-guide/kubectl/kubectl_annotate/).",
      "headingPath": [
        "Deploy Grafana on Kubernetes",
        "Update an existing deployment using a rolling update strategy"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/installation/kubernetes/index.md",
