    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.dcff2c049d462541d034",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "When the Grafana deployment becomes unstable due to crash looping, bugs, and so on, you can roll back a deployment to an earlier version (a `REVISION`).",
      "headingPath": [
        "Deploy Grafana on Kubernetes",
        "Update an existing deployment using a rolling update strategy",
        "Roll back a deployment"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/installation/kubernetes/index.md",
