      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "By default, the Grafana log level is set to `info`, but you can increase it to `debug` mode to fetch information needed to diagnose and troubleshoot a problem. For more information about Grafana log levels, refer to [Configuring logs](/docs/grafana/latest/setup-grafana/configure-grafana#log).",
