      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Performing a dry run can be useful for catching errors or unintended consequences before they occur. For more information, refer to [Kubernetes Dry-run](https://github.com/kubernetes/enhancements/blob/master/keps/sig-api-machinery/576-dry-run/README.md).",
      "headingPath": [
        "Deploy Grafana on Kubernetes",
